  ('Aether','Aether','Aether','SID_天空','special',null,null,'Treats foe''s Def/Res as if reduced by 50% during combat. Restores HP = half of damage dealt.','Sol;Luna',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,5,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Aethers Course','Aether''s Course','Aether''s Course','SID_真蒼炎の天空','special',null,null,'When Special triggers, boosts damage by the greater of unit''s or foe''s Def, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP, and neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills.<br><br>Foe can make a follow-up attack before unit''s next attack during combat.<br><br>Reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】by 50%, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 40%, but if unit receives consecutive attacks, reduces damage from foe''s second attack onward by 70% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Sol;Luna',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,5,null,'offensive_special,random_owner'),
  ('Aethers Path','Aether''s Path','Aether''s Path','SID_蒼炎の天空','special',null,null,'When Special triggers, boosts damage by 75% of the greater of foe''s Spd or Def and restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP.<br><br>Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】by 50%, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks, and reduces damage from attacks by X% during combat (X = 50 - current Special cooldown count value × 10, but if unit''s Special triggered during this combat, X = 50).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Sol;Luna',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,4,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Agneas Arrow','Agnea''s Arrow','Agnea''s Arrow','SID_アグネアの矢','weapon',2,null,'Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) on odd-numbered turns, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd on even-numbered turns.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Agneas Arrow ATK','Agnea''s Arrow','Agnea''s Arrow','SID_アグネアの矢_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) on odd-numbered turns, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd on even-numbered turns during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Agneas Arrow DEF','Agnea''s Arrow','Agnea''s Arrow','SID_アグネアの矢_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) on odd-numbered turns, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd on even-numbered turns during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Agneas Arrow RES','Agnea''s Arrow','Agnea''s Arrow','SID_アグネアの矢_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) on odd-numbered turns, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd on even-numbered turns during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,3,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Agneas Arrow SKILL1','Agnea''s Arrow','Agnea''s Arrow','SID_アグネアの矢_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) on odd-numbered turns, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd on even-numbered turns during combat.<br>Enables【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】.<br><br>At start of turn and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Spd/Res-7, 【Sabotage】, and【Discord】on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 2, + 5 (max 11), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn (min. １; if unit used a movement skill that warped them, unit can move １ space(s)). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Agneas Arrow SPD','Agnea''s Arrow','Agnea''s Arrow','SID_アグネアの矢_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) on odd-numbered turns, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd on even-numbered turns during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,5,0,0',null,null,null),
