  ('Air Orders 2','Air Orders 2','Air Orders','SID_先導の伝令・天2','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, grants the following status to adjacent flying allies for 1 turn: "Unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces."','Air Orders 1','Air Orders 3',false,120,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Air Orders 3','Air Orders 3','Air Orders','SID_先導の伝令・天3','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, grants the following status to adjacent flying allies for 1 turn: "Unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces."','Air Orders 2',null,false,240,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Air Orders 4','Air Orders 4','Air Orders','SID_先導の伝令・天4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6,【Charge】, and the following status to unit and flying allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn: "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces."<br><br>【Charge】<br>Unit can move up to 3 spaces in any cardinal direction. (Cannot move through foes, terrain that blocks movement, or effects of skills like Obstruct. Granted movement treated as Warp movement.)','Air Orders 3',null,false,300,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Air Superiority','Air Superiority','Air Superiority','SID_天翔ける','passiveb',null,null,'Unit can move through foes'' spaces.<br><br>For each foe within 5 spaces of unit, unit can move to any of the nearest spaces adjacent to that foe (unless space is impassable terrain).<br><br>Inflicts Spd/Def-4 on foe and deals damage during combat = 20% of the greater of unit''s Spd or Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, if foe is cavalry or flying, or if decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 25 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow-ups), triggers 【Potent Follow X%】during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).','Flier Formation 3;Aerobatics 3',null,false,300,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Airborne Spear','Airborne Spear','Airborne Spear','SID_穢れなき白槍','weapon',1,null,'If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
