  ('Airborne Spear RES','Airborne Spear','Airborne Spear','SID_穢れなき白槍_RES','weapon',1,'res','If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Airborne Spear SKILL1','Airborne Spear','Airborne Spear','SID_穢れなき白槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special and unit''s Spd+Res ≥ foe''s Spd+Res-5 during combat (excluding effects from【Phantom】), grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Phantom】<br>If a skill effect compares unit''s stats to a foe or ally stats, treats unit''s stats as if granted +X.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Airborne Spear SPD','Airborne Spear','Airborne Spear','SID_穢れなき白槍_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Alarm AtkDef','Alarm Atk/Def','Alarm Atk/Def','SID_攻撃守備の奮進4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 2, grants Atk/Def+6 and【Canto (１)】 to unit for 1 turn. If number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Def+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Rouse AtkDef 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Alarm AtkSpd','Alarm Atk/Spd','Alarm Atk/Spd','SID_攻撃速さの奮進4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 2, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Canto (１)】 to unit for 1 turn. If number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Spd+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Rouse AtkSpd 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Alarm DefRes','Alarm Def/Res','Alarm Def/Res','SID_守備魔防の奮進4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 2, grants Def/Res+6 and【Canto (１)】 to unit for 1 turn. If number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Def/Res+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Rouse DefRes 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Alarm SpdDef','Alarm Spd/Def','Alarm Spd/Def','SID_速さ守備の奮進4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 2, grants Spd/Def+6 and【Canto (１)】 to unit for 1 turn. If number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Spd/Def+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Rouse SpdDef 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('All for One','All for One','All for One','SID_オールフォーワン','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by X% of unit''s Spd when Special triggers (X = 40 + the number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 20; max 100%).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by Y% during combat (Y = the number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 20; if unit initiates combat, max 60%; otherwise, max 40%; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>For allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, if ally initiates combat, reduces damage from foe''s attack by 40% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; counts as if damage reduction is from a Special).<br><br>For certain target allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, if foe initiates combat, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 40% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; only triggers once per turn; counts as if damage reduction is from a Special). (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets any ally.)','Astra',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,4,null,'offensive_special,random_owner'),
  ('All Together','All Together!','All Together!','SID_ずっとみんなと一緒','passivec',null,null,'Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to allies within 2 spaces during combat. If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, reduces damage from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by X% (X = number of allies within 2 spaces of unit × 40; max 80%), grants unit Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat, and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by X% (X = number of allies within 2 spaces of unit × 20; max 40%).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
