  ('Arc-Fort Breath','Arc-Fort Breath','Arc-Fort Breath','SID_強弓・呼吸','passiveb',null,null,'Inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe, unit deals +X damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = the greater of 15% of unit''s Atk or 20% of unit''s Def), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Seal Def 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Arc. Caliburnus','Arc. Caliburnus','Arc. Caliburnus','SID_魔器カリブルヌス','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.','Rexcalibur',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arc. Caliburnus ATK','Arc. Caliburnus','Arc. Caliburnus','SID_魔器カリブルヌス_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arc. Caliburnus DEF','Arc. Caliburnus','Arc. Caliburnus','SID_魔器カリブルヌス_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arc. Caliburnus RES','Arc. Caliburnus','Arc. Caliburnus','SID_魔器カリブルヌス_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arc. Caliburnus SPD','Arc. Caliburnus','Arc. Caliburnus','SID_魔器カリブルヌス_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcadian Axes','Arcadian Axes','Arcadian Axes','SID_永遠の理想郷の双斧','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat, unit attacks twice). Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-X on foe during combat (X = 20% of unit''s Res at start of combat, + 5), and also, if foe''s attack can trigger foe''s Special and unit''s Res ≥ foe''s Res+5, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe before foe''s first attack during combat (cannot exceed foe''s maximum Special cooldown).','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',11,'0,11,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Arcane 12s Writ','Arcane 12''s Writ','Arcane 12''s Writ','SID_魔器・十二魔将の書','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Spd/Res-7, 【Sabotage】,【Spd Shackle】, and【Res Shackle】 on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Spd Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Spd during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane 12s Writ ATK','Arcane 12''s Writ','Arcane 12''s Writ','SID_魔器・十二魔将の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Spd/Res-7, 【Sabotage】,【Spd Shackle】, and【Res Shackle】 on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Spd Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Spd during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
