  ('Arcane Fellstone SPD','Arcane Fellstone','Arcane Fellstone','SID_魔器・歪神竜の竜石_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat - 4 (max 14; min 5), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Fury Bite','Arcane Fury Bite','Arcane Fury Bite','SID_魔器・猛き嘴爪','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, neutralizes foe''s bonuses, and foe suffers +10 damage from attacks during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+10 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit and unit can move 1 extra space (that turn only; does not stack).','Adult Flier',null,false,300,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
