  ('Arcane Giant Axe','Arcane Giant Axe','Arcane Giant Axe','SID_魔器・ヨトゥンの斧','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, neutralizes【Panic】and penalties on unit''s Atk/Def that take effect on unit at that time.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including when dealing damage with an area-of-effect Special), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk (including from area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.','Silver Axe',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
