  ('Arcane Grima','Arcane Grima','Arcane Grima','SID_魔器ギムレー','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
