  ('Arcane Grima SPD','Arcane Grima','Arcane Grima','SID_魔器ギムレー_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Hex Bow','Arcane Hex Bow','Arcane Hex Bow','SID_魔器・呪術の秘弓','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts 【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.','Silver Bow',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'flying','arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Hex Bow ATK','Arcane Hex Bow','Arcane Hex Bow','SID_魔器・呪術の秘弓_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts 【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,'flying','arcane'),
  ('Arcane Hex Bow DEF','Arcane Hex Bow','Arcane Hex Bow','SID_魔器・呪術の秘弓_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts 【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,'flying','arcane'),
  ('Arcane Hex Bow RES','Arcane Hex Bow','Arcane Hex Bow','SID_魔器・呪術の秘弓_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts 【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,'flying','arcane'),
  ('Arcane Hex Bow SPD','Arcane Hex Bow','Arcane Hex Bow','SID_魔器・呪術の秘弓_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts 【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,'flying','arcane'),
  ('Arcane Latona','Arcane Latona','Arcane Latona','SID_魔器・聖杖ラトナ','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1; max cooldown count value cannot be reduced below 1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants【Imbue】to unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>After start-of-turn effects trigger on player phase, and after start-of-turn effects trigger on enemy phase (except for in Summoner Duels), for unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit, neutralizes stat penalties and two【Penalty】 effects (does not apply to Penalty effects that are applied at the same time; neutralizes the first applicable Penalty effects on unit''s or ally''s list of active effects).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Imbue】<br>Reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and restores 40% of unit''s maximum HP as unit''s combat begins for 1 turn (triggers after effects that deal damage as combat begins; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Assault',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Latona SKILL1ATK','Arcane Latona','Arcane Latona','SID_魔器・聖杖ラトナ_神_ATK','weapon',2,'skill1atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1; max cooldown count value cannot be reduced below 1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants【Imbue】to unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>After start-of-turn effects trigger on player phase, and after start-of-turn effects trigger on enemy phase (except for in Summoner Duels), for unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit, neutralizes stat penalties and two【Penalty】 effects (does not apply to Penalty effects that are applied at the same time; neutralizes the first applicable Penalty effects on unit''s or ally''s list of active effects).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Imbue】<br>Reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and restores 40% of unit''s maximum HP as unit''s combat begins for 1 turn (triggers after effects that deal damage as combat begins; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.<br>Calculates damage from staff like other weapons.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
