  ('Arcane Luin','Arcane Lúin','Arcane Lúin','SID_魔器・魔槍ルーン','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Def during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.','Silver Lance',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
