  ('Arcane Medusa SPD','Arcane Medusa','Arcane Medusa','SID_魔器メデューサ_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants 【Anathema】to unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Anathema】<br>Inflicts Spd/Def/Res-4 on foes within 3 spaces of unit during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Nastrond','Arcane Náströnd','Arcane Náströnd','SID_魔器ナーストレンド','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 30%, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = 12 - foe''s max Special cooldown count value × 2 (min 4; if foe does not have a Special skill, bonus = 4).','Silver Bow',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'flying','arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Nastrond ATK','Arcane Náströnd','Arcane Náströnd','SID_魔器ナーストレンド_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 30%, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = 12 - foe''s max Special cooldown count value × 2 (min 4; if foe does not have a Special skill, bonus = 4).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,'flying','arcane'),
  ('Arcane Nastrond DEF','Arcane Náströnd','Arcane Náströnd','SID_魔器ナーストレンド_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 30%, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = 12 - foe''s max Special cooldown count value × 2 (min 4; if foe does not have a Special skill, bonus = 4).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,'flying','arcane'),
  ('Arcane Nastrond RES','Arcane Náströnd','Arcane Náströnd','SID_魔器ナーストレンド_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 30%, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = 12 - foe''s max Special cooldown count value × 2 (min 4; if foe does not have a Special skill, bonus = 4).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,'flying','arcane'),
  ('Arcane Nastrond SPD','Arcane Náströnd','Arcane Náströnd','SID_魔器ナーストレンド_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 30%, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = 12 - foe''s max Special cooldown count value × 2 (min 4; if foe does not have a Special skill, bonus = 4).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,'flying','arcane'),
  ('Arcane Nihility','Arcane Nihility','Arcane Nihility','SID_魔器・虚無の角','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 and Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = current bonus on each of foe''s stats; calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd during combat (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.','Adult Cavalry',null,false,300,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Nihility ATK','Arcane Nihility','Arcane Nihility','SID_魔器・虚無の角_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 and Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = current bonus on each of foe''s stats; calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd during combat (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
