  ('Arcane Parasol','Arcane Parasol','Arcane Parasol','SID_魔器・天女の日傘','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes. Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, foe suffers +10 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and foe suffers a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+10 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Silver Bow',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'flying','arcane,random_owner'),
