  ('Arcane Renegade','Arcane Renegade','Arcane Renegade','SID_魔器・マギ団の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>For allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat, and also, when ally deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to ally.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat, - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk (including from area-of- effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat, and also, when unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to unit.','Silver Sword',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Renegade ATK','Arcane Renegade','Arcane Renegade','SID_魔器・マギ団の剣_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>For allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat, and also, when ally deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to ally.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat, - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk (including from area-of- effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat, and also, when unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to unit.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
