  ('Arcane Renegade RES','Arcane Renegade','Arcane Renegade','SID_魔器・マギ団の剣_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>For allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat, and also, when ally deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to ally.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat, - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk (including from area-of- effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat, and also, when unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to unit.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Renegade SPD','Arcane Renegade','Arcane Renegade','SID_魔器・マギ団の剣_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>For allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat, and also, when ally deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to ally.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat, - 4 (max 14; min 5), deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (including area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk (including from area-of- effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat, and also, when unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to unit.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Rexbolt','Arcane Rexbolt','Arcane Rexbolt','SID_魔器レクスボルト','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Res+6, "grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Thoron;Shine',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Rexbolt ATK','Arcane Rexbolt','Arcane Rexbolt','SID_魔器レクスボルト_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Res+6, "grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Rexbolt DEF','Arcane Rexbolt','Arcane Rexbolt','SID_魔器レクスボルト_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Res+6, "grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Rexbolt RES','Arcane Rexbolt','Arcane Rexbolt','SID_魔器レクスボルト_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Res+6, "grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Rexbolt SPD','Arcane Rexbolt','Arcane Rexbolt','SID_魔器レクスボルト_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Res+6, "grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Slicer','Arcane Slicer','Arcane Slicer','SID_魔器・春風の旋刃','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If a skill compares unit''s Spd to a foe''s or ally''s Spd, treats unit''s Spd as if granted +7.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Spd+6,【Pulse Follow】, and【Dodge】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Pulse Follow】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before unit''s first follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Silver Dagger',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Slicer ATK','Arcane Slicer','Arcane Slicer','SID_魔器・春風の旋刃_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If a skill compares unit''s Spd to a foe''s or ally''s Spd, treats unit''s Spd as if granted +7.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Spd+6,【Pulse Follow】, and【Dodge】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Pulse Follow】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before unit''s first follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
