  ('Arcane Tempest DEF','Arcane Tempest','Arcane Tempest','SID_魔器・暁風の刃_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit (X = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat, - 4; min 5, max 14), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Tempest RES','Arcane Tempest','Arcane Tempest','SID_魔器・暁風の刃_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit (X = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat, - 4; min 5, max 14), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Tempest SPD','Arcane Tempest','Arcane Tempest','SID_魔器・暁風の刃_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit (X = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat, - 4; min 5, max 14), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Thorn','Arcane Thorn','Arcane Thorn','SID_魔器・戦神の鋭槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6,【Truly Incited】, and 【Preempt Pulse】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Truly Incited】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2 (max 8).<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.','Silver Lance',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Thorn ATK','Arcane Thorn','Arcane Thorn','SID_魔器・戦神の鋭槍_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6,【Truly Incited】, and 【Preempt Pulse】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Truly Incited】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2 (max 8).<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Thorn DEF','Arcane Thorn','Arcane Thorn','SID_魔器・戦神の鋭槍_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6,【Truly Incited】, and 【Preempt Pulse】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Truly Incited】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2 (max 8).<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Thorn RES','Arcane Thorn','Arcane Thorn','SID_魔器・戦神の鋭槍_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6,【Truly Incited】, and 【Preempt Pulse】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Truly Incited】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2 (max 8).<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Thorn SPD','Arcane Thorn','Arcane Thorn','SID_魔器・戦神の鋭槍_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6,【Truly Incited】, and 【Preempt Pulse】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Truly Incited】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2 (max 8).<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Thrima','Arcane Þrima','Arcane Þrima','SID_魔器スリマ','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target; calculates each stat penalty independently), neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.','Silver Axe',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Thrima ATK','Arcane Þrima','Arcane Þrima','SID_魔器スリマ_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target; calculates each stat penalty independently), neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Thrima DEF','Arcane Þrima','Arcane Þrima','SID_魔器スリマ_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target; calculates each stat penalty independently), neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
