  ('Arcane Void','Arcane Void','Arcane Void','SID_魔器ギンヌンガガプ','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target; calculates each stat penalty independently), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Silver Dagger',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane,random_owner'),
  ('Arcane Void ATK','Arcane Void','Arcane Void','SID_魔器ギンヌンガガプ_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target; calculates each stat penalty independently), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Void DEF','Arcane Void','Arcane Void','SID_魔器ギンヌンガガプ_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target; calculates each stat penalty independently), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Void RES','Arcane Void','Arcane Void','SID_魔器ギンヌンガガプ_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target; calculates each stat penalty independently), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arcane Void SPD','Arcane Void','Arcane Void','SID_魔器ギンヌンガガプ_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target; calculates each stat penalty independently), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,'arcane'),
  ('Arch-Sage Tome','Arch-Sage Tome','Arch-Sage Tome','SID_大賢者の書','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6 and 【Assign Decoy】to any support partner within 2 spaces of unit or, if unit is not on a team with unit''s support partner, to ally with the highest Def within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = 5 + highest bonus on each stat between allies within 3 spaces of unit (calculates each stat bonus independently), and if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br><br>【Assign Decoy】<br>If foe''s Range = unit''s Range and foe initiates combat against an ally within 2 spaces of unit, triggers【Savior】on unit (that turn only; triggers only if unit is not equipped with a skill that can trigger the Savior effect).<br><br>【Savior】<br>Unit takes ally''s space, enters combat in ally''s place, and receives all after-combat effects.<br><br>Savior will not trigger if ally is on terrain that unit cannot move to or if multiple units are able to use Savior during the same combat. If Savior triggers, after-combat movement effects do not occur.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Arch-Sage Tome ATK','Arch-Sage Tome','Arch-Sage Tome','SID_大賢者の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6 and 【Assign Decoy】to any support partner within 2 spaces of unit or, if unit is not on a team with unit''s support partner, to ally with the highest Def within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = 5 + highest bonus on each stat between allies within 3 spaces of unit (calculates each stat bonus independently), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res during combat (including area-of-effect Specials, excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of- effect Specials by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Assign Decoy】<br>If foe''s Range = unit''s Range and foe initiates combat against an ally within 2 spaces of unit, triggers【Savior】on unit (triggers only if unit is not equipped with a skill that can trigger the Savior effect).<br><br>【Savior】<br>Unit takes ally''s space, enters combat in ally''s place, and receives all after-combat effects.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Arch-Sage Tome DEF','Arch-Sage Tome','Arch-Sage Tome','SID_大賢者の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6 and 【Assign Decoy】to any support partner within 2 spaces of unit or, if unit is not on a team with unit''s support partner, to ally with the highest Def within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = 5 + highest bonus on each stat between allies within 3 spaces of unit (calculates each stat bonus independently), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res during combat (including area-of-effect Specials, excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of- effect Specials by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Assign Decoy】<br>If foe''s Range = unit''s Range and foe initiates combat against an ally within 2 spaces of unit, triggers【Savior】on unit (triggers only if unit is not equipped with a skill that can trigger the Savior effect).<br><br>【Savior】<br>Unit takes ally''s space, enters combat in ally''s place, and receives all after-combat effects.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Arch-Sage Tome RES','Arch-Sage Tome','Arch-Sage Tome','SID_大賢者の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6 and 【Assign Decoy】to any support partner within 2 spaces of unit or, if unit is not on a team with unit''s support partner, to ally with the highest Def within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = 5 + highest bonus on each stat between allies within 3 spaces of unit (calculates each stat bonus independently), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res during combat (including area-of-effect Specials, excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of- effect Specials by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Assign Decoy】<br>If foe''s Range = unit''s Range and foe initiates combat against an ally within 2 spaces of unit, triggers【Savior】on unit (triggers only if unit is not equipped with a skill that can trigger the Savior effect).<br><br>【Savior】<br>Unit takes ally''s space, enters combat in ally''s place, and receives all after-combat effects.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,null),
  ('Arch-Sage Tome SKILL1','Arch-Sage Tome','Arch-Sage Tome','SID_大賢者の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6 and 【Assign Decoy】to any support partner within 2 spaces of unit or, if unit is not on a team with unit''s support partner, to ally with the highest Def within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = 5 + highest bonus on each stat between allies within 3 spaces of unit (calculates each stat bonus independently), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res during combat (including area-of-effect Specials, excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of- effect Specials by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Assign Decoy】<br>If foe''s Range = unit''s Range and foe initiates combat against an ally within 2 spaces of unit, triggers【Savior】on unit (triggers only if unit is not equipped with a skill that can trigger the Savior effect).<br><br>【Savior】<br>Unit takes ally''s space, enters combat in ally''s place, and receives all after-combat effects.<br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Exposure】, and【Discord】on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 2, + 5 (max 11), neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Res, and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Arch-Sage Tome SPD','Arch-Sage Tome','Arch-Sage Tome','SID_大賢者の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6 and 【Assign Decoy】to any support partner within 2 spaces of unit or, if unit is not on a team with unit''s support partner, to ally with the highest Def within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = 5 + highest bonus on each stat between allies within 3 spaces of unit (calculates each stat bonus independently), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res during combat (including area-of-effect Specials, excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of- effect Specials by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Assign Decoy】<br>If foe''s Range = unit''s Range and foe initiates combat against an ally within 2 spaces of unit, triggers【Savior】on unit (triggers only if unit is not equipped with a skill that can trigger the Savior effect).<br><br>【Savior】<br>Unit takes ally''s space, enters combat in ally''s place, and receives all after-combat effects.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Archrival','Archrival','Archrival','SID_角逐','special',null,null,'When Special triggers, boosts damage by X% of the greater of unit''s or foe''s Atk (if unit has weapon-triangle advantage, X = 80; otherwise, X = 70).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes) and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and also, if unit has weapon-triangle advantage, grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit and inflicts Special cooldown count+2 on foe before unit''s first attack during combat (cannot exceed foe''s maximum Special cooldown).','Dragon Fang',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,null,5,null,'offensive_special,random_owner'),
