  ('Ardent Durandal','Ardent Durandal','Ardent Durandal','SID_緋剣デュランダル','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. At start of turn, grants 【Bonus Doubler】 to ally with the highest Atk.<br><br>【Bonus Doubler】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of unit''s stats for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Ardent Durandal ATK','Ardent Durandal','Ardent Durandal','SID_緋剣デュランダル_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3. At start of turn, grants 【Bonus Doubler】to unit and ally with the highest Atk (excluding unit). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus Doubler】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of unit''s stats for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Ardent Durandal DEF','Ardent Durandal','Ardent Durandal','SID_緋剣デュランダル_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3. At start of turn, grants 【Bonus Doubler】to unit and ally with the highest Atk (excluding unit). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus Doubler】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of unit''s stats for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
