  ('Argent Aura','Argent Aura','Argent Aura','SID_アルジローレ','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 and 【Stall】on foes on the enemy team with the lowest Spd and any foes within 2 spaces of those foes. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Stall】<br>If unit has "unit can move 1 extra space," converts that effect into "restricts movement to 1 space" through its next action.','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Argent Aura ATK','Argent Aura','Argent Aura','SID_アルジローレ_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-6,【Stall】, 【Sabotage】, and【Discord】on foes on the enemy team with the lowest Spd and any foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Stall】<br>If unit has "unit can move 1 extra space," converts that effect into "restricts movement to 1 space."<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Argent Aura DEF','Argent Aura','Argent Aura','SID_アルジローレ_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-6,【Stall】, 【Sabotage】, and【Discord】on foes on the enemy team with the lowest Spd and any foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Stall】<br>If unit has "unit can move 1 extra space," converts that effect into "restricts movement to 1 space."<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Argent Aura RES','Argent Aura','Argent Aura','SID_アルジローレ_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-6,【Stall】, 【Sabotage】, and【Discord】on foes on the enemy team with the lowest Spd and any foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Stall】<br>If unit has "unit can move 1 extra space," converts that effect into "restricts movement to 1 space."<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,null),
  ('Argent Aura SKILL1','Argent Aura','Argent Aura','SID_アルジローレ_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-6,【Stall】, 【Sabotage】, and【Discord】on foes on the enemy team with the lowest Spd and any foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Stall】<br>If unit has "unit can move 1 extra space," converts that effect into "restricts movement to 1 space."<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).<br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Argent Aura SPD','Argent Aura','Argent Aura','SID_アルジローレ_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-6,【Stall】, 【Sabotage】, and【Discord】on foes on the enemy team with the lowest Spd and any foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Stall】<br>If unit has "unit can move 1 extra space," converts that effect into "restricts movement to 1 space."<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,null),
