  ('Astra Blade ATK','Astra Blade','Astra Blade','SID_流星剣_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3. If unit''s Atk > foe''s Def, deals damage = 50% of unit''s Atk minus foe''s Def. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Astra Blade DEF','Astra Blade','Astra Blade','SID_流星剣_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3. If unit''s Atk > foe''s Def, deals damage = 50% of unit''s Atk minus foe''s Def. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Astra Blade RES','Astra Blade','Astra Blade','SID_流星剣_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Atk+3. If unit''s Atk > foe''s Def, deals damage = 50% of unit''s Atk minus foe''s Def. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,19,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Astra Blade SKILL1','Astra Blade','Astra Blade','SID_流星剣_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk+3. If unit''s Atk > foe''s Def, deals damage = 50% of unit''s Atk minus foe''s Def. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.<br>Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of any ally within 2 spaces. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 and an additional Atk+X to unit and inflicts Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2; max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,19,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Astra Blade SPD','Astra Blade','Astra Blade','SID_流星剣_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Atk+3. If unit''s Atk > foe''s Def, deals damage = 50% of unit''s Atk minus foe''s Def. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Astra Storm','Astra Storm','Astra Storm','SID_流星群','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by 40% of unit''s Spd when Special triggers.<br><br>If unit''s Special is ready or has triggered during this combat,【Potent Follow X%】 has triggered, and X ≤ 99, then X = 100.<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>――――― Astra Storm Style ―――――<br>Unit can attack foes within 6 spaces of unit and 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit regardless of unit''s range. Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 2, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br><br>Unit cannot move or attack structures, after-combat movement effects do not occur, and remaining movement granted from Canto is treated as 0. Skill effect''s Range is treated as 2, including by skill effects determined by attack Range, like Pavise and Aegis. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. When unit has a status or a skill that enables use of a Style, Duo Skills and Harmonized Skills cannot be used while unit can take an action (those skills can be used after unit has acted).<br>Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.','Astra',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,2,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Astral Breath','Astral Breath','Astral Breath','SID_星竜のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. Unit can move to a space adjacent to support partner. If unit is within 3 spaces of support partner, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Water Breath',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Astral Breath ATK','Astral Breath','Astral Breath','SID_星竜のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Spd+3. Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of support partner. At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of support partner, grants Spd/Def/Res+6 and【Dodge】to unit and any support partner within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,18,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Astral Breath DEF','Astral Breath','Astral Breath','SID_星竜のブレス_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Spd+3. Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of support partner. At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of support partner, grants Spd/Def/Res+6 and【Dodge】to unit and any support partner within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,3,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Astral Breath RES','Astral Breath','Astral Breath','SID_星竜のブレス_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Spd+3. Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of support partner. At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of support partner, grants Spd/Def/Res+6 and【Dodge】to unit and any support partner within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,3,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Astral Breath SKILL1','Astral Breath','Astral Breath','SID_星竜のブレス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Spd+3. Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of support partner. At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of support partner, grants Spd/Def/Res+6 and【Dodge】to unit and any support partner within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat, + 4; max 8), unit deals +Y damage (Y = highest total bonuses among unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit; excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Astral Breath SPD','Astral Breath','Astral Breath','SID_星竜のブレス_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Spd+3. Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of support partner. At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of support partner, grants Spd/Def/Res+6 and【Dodge】to unit and any support partner within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,6,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Asura Blades','Asura Blades','Asura Blades','SID_アスラの双刃','weapon',2,null,'Grants Spd+5. Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat). Neutralizes penalties on unit during combat. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br>Effect: 【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Silver Dagger',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'0,8,5,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Asura Blades ATK','Asura Blades','Asura Blades','SID_アスラの双刃_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5. Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and neutralizes penalties on unit during combat. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'2,14,5,5,5',null,null,null),
  ('Asura Blades DEF','Asura Blades','Asura Blades','SID_アスラの双刃_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5. Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and neutralizes penalties on unit during combat. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'2,13,5,8,5',null,null,null),
  ('Asura Blades RES','Asura Blades','Asura Blades','SID_アスラの双刃_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5. Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and neutralizes penalties on unit during combat. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'2,13,5,5,8',null,null,null),
  ('Asura Blades SKILL1','Asura Blades','Asura Blades','SID_アスラの双刃_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5. Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and neutralizes penalties on unit during combat. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.<br>At start of turn and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts【Exposure】, 【Spd Shackle】, and【Def Shackle】on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 2, + 5 (max 11), and unit deals +X × 5 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of Bonus effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses + number of Penalty effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties; max 5).<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Spd Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Spd during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br><br>【Def Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Def during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'0,13,5,5,5',null,null,null),
  ('Asura Blades SPD','Asura Blades','Asura Blades','SID_アスラの双刃_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5. Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and neutralizes penalties on unit during combat. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'2,13,7,5,5',null,null,null),
  ('Athame','Athame','Athame','SID_アサメイの短剣','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if foe’s HP < 100%, grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat, and if foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe’s first attack.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Silver Dagger',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Athame ATK','Athame','Athame','SID_アサメイの短剣_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Res+3. If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. If foe initiates combat and foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,15,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Athame DEF','Athame','Athame','SID_アサメイの短剣_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Res+3. If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. If foe initiates combat and foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,3,3',null,null,null),
  ('Athame RES','Athame','Athame','SID_アサメイの短剣_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Res+3. If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. If foe initiates combat and foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,0,6',null,null,null),
  ('Athame SKILL1','Athame','Athame','SID_アサメイの短剣_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Res+3. If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. If foe initiates combat and foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.<br>If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. After combat, if unit initiated combat and attacked, deals 5 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of unit, and inflicts【Exposure】 on those foes through their next actions.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Athame SPD','Athame','Athame','SID_アサメイの短剣_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Res+3. If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. If foe initiates combat and foe''s HP ≤ 99% at the start of combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,2,0,3',null,null,null),
