  ('AtkDef Unity','Atk/Def Unity','Atk/Def Unity','SID_攻撃守備の連帯4','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+5 and bonus to Atk/Def during combat = current penalty on each of those stats × 2. (Example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+19, for a net bonus of Atk+12.) Calculates each stat bonus independently.','AtkDef Bond 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkDef Wild','Atk/Def Wild','Atk/Def Wild','SID_攻撃守備の野性','passivea',null,null,'If number of adjacent allies other than beast or dragon allies ≤ 1, or if unit is transformed, grants Atk/Def+7 to unit during combat and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.','AtkDef Solo 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Airspace','Atk/Res Airspace','Atk/Res Airspace','SID_攻撃魔防の領空','passivea',null,null,'Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+10 to unit and unit deals +X damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; if any space within 2 spaces of unit or foe has a Divine Vein effect applied, is defensive terrain, or counts as difficult or impassable terrain for units other than flying, X = 12; otherwise, X = 7), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','AtkRes Catch 3',null,false,300,'Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Aria','Atk/Res Aria','Atk/Res Aria','SID_攻撃魔防の詠唱','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Res = unit''s maximum Special cooldown count + 7 during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, deals damage = unit''s maximum Special cooldown count × X (excluding area-of-effect Specials; if unit triggers the "unit attacks twice" effect, X = 3; otherwise, X = 5).','AtkRes Bond 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
