  ('AtkRes Catch 1','Atk/Res Catch 1','Atk/Res Catch','SID_攻撃魔防の機先1','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if foe''s HP = 100% or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Res+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,'AtkRes Catch 2',false,60,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Catch 2','Atk/Res Catch 2','Atk/Res Catch','SID_攻撃魔防の機先2','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if foe’s HP = 100% or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Res+4 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','AtkRes Catch 1','AtkRes Catch 3',false,120,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Catch 3','Atk/Res Catch 3','Atk/Res Catch','SID_攻撃魔防の機先3','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if foe’s HP = 100% or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','AtkRes Catch 2',null,false,240,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Catch 4','Atk/Res Catch 4','Atk/Res Catch','SID_攻撃魔防の機先4','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if foe''s HP = 100% or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Res+7 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if foe''s HP = 100% and【Penalty】is active on foe, grants an additional Atk/Res+2 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','AtkRes Catch 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Crux','Atk/Res Crux','Atk/Res Crux','SID_攻撃魔防の十字牽制','passivec',null,null,'Inflicts Atk/Res-4 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, and those foes suffer guaranteed follow-up attacks during combat.','AtkRes Rein 3',null,false,300,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Detect','Atk/Res Detect','Atk/Res Detect','SID_攻撃魔防の看破','passiveb',null,null,'Inflicts Atk/Res-4 on foe during combat.<br><br>If a movement Assist skill (like Reposition, Shove, Pivot, etc.) is used by unit or targets unit, inflicts【Exposure】on closest foes within 5 spaces of both unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally after movement and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-5 on foes on the map with the 【Exposure】effect active and neutralizes bonuses to Atk/Res for those foes during combat.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.','AtkRes Snag 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Discord','Atk/Res Discord','Atk/Res Discord','SID_攻撃魔防の不和','passiveb',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and【Discord】on foes with Res < unit''s Res and that are within 2 spaces of another foe through their next actions.<br><br>Inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res during combat = number of foes inflicted with【Discord】 within 2 spaces of target, including target, × 2, + 4 (max 10) and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.','Sabotage Atk 3;Sabotage Res 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Favor','Atk/Res Favor','Atk/Res Favor','SID_攻撃魔防の共感','passiveb',null,null,'If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit or targets unit, grants Atk/Res+6, 【Empathy】, and "reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special ''reduce damage by X%'' skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn, and grants Special cooldown-1 to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally once per turn.<br><br>Allies on the map with【Empathy】active deal +7 damage during combat (excluding area-of- effect Specials).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def/Res-4 on foe and unit deals +X+7 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = highest total Atk+Res bonuses among unit and allies with 【Empathy】active).<br><br>【Empathy】<br>Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of types of【Bonus】effects, excluding stat bonuses, and【Penalty】effects, excluding stat penalties, active on player team and enemy team during combat (max 7).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','AtkRes Link 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Finish 1','Atk/Res Finish 1','Atk/Res Finish','SID_攻撃魔防の秘奥1','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+2 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Special is ready or unit''s Special triggered before or during this combat, deals +1 damage during combat. (Except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials.)',null,'AtkRes Finish 2',false,60,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Finish 2','Atk/Res Finish 2','Atk/Res Finish','SID_攻撃魔防の秘奥2','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+4 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Special is ready or unit''s Special triggered before or during this combat, deals +3 damage during combat. (Except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials.)','AtkRes Finish 1','AtkRes Finish 3',false,120,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Finish 3','Atk/Res Finish 3','Atk/Res Finish','SID_攻撃魔防の秘奥3','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Special is ready or unit''s Special triggered before or during this combat, deals +5 damage during combat. (Except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials.)','AtkRes Finish 2',null,false,240,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Finish 4','Atk/Res Finish 4','Atk/Res Finish','SID_攻撃魔防の秘奥4','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+7 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Special is ready or unit''s Special triggered before or during this combat, deals +5 damage during combat (except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials), and when unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to unit. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.)','AtkRes Finish 3',null,false,300,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Form 1','Atk/Res Form 1','Atk/Res Form','SID_攻撃魔防の密集1','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+X to unit during combat (X = number of allies within 2 spaces; max 3).',null,'AtkRes Form 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Form 2','Atk/Res Form 2','Atk/Res Form','SID_攻撃魔防の密集2','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+X to unit during combat (X = number of allies within 2 spaces + 2; max 5).','AtkRes Form 1','AtkRes Form 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Form 3','Atk/Res Form 3','Atk/Res Form','SID_攻撃魔防の密集3','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+X to unit during combat (X = 2 × number of allies within 2 spaces, + 1; max 7).','AtkRes Form 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Fortune','Atk/Res Fortune','Atk/Res Fortune','SID_攻撃魔防の共栄','passivea',null,null,'If unit can transform, transformation effects gain "if unit is within 2 spaces of a beast or dragon ally, or if number of adjacent allies other than beast or dragon allies ≤ 2" as a trigger condition (in addition to existing conditions).<br><br>If defending in Aether Raids, at the start of enemy turn 1, if conditions for transforming are met, unit transforms.<br><br>If unit is transformed or if foe initiates combat, grants Atk/Res+8 to unit and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def during combat, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.','AtkRes Form 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Gap 1','Atk/Res Gap 1','Atk/Res Gap','SID_攻撃魔防の大開放1','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, grants Atk/Res+1 to ally with the highest Atk+Res total for 1 turn. (Excludes unit.)',null,'AtkRes Gap 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
