  ('AtkRes Gap 3','Atk/Res Gap 3','Atk/Res Gap','SID_攻撃魔防の大開放3','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, grants Atk/Res+5 to ally with the highest Atk+Res total for 1 turn. (Excludes unit.)','AtkRes Gap 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Havoc','Atk/Res Havoc','Atk/Res Havoc','SID_攻撃魔防の大混乱','passiveb',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Sabotage】, and【Schism】 on foes with Res < unit''s Res and that are within 2 spaces of another foe through their next actions.<br><br>After start-of-turn skills trigger on unit''s player phase, if the number of foes with the 【Sabotage】effect active on the map ≥ 2, grants 【Canto (１)】to unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-4 on foe and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Schism】<br>Neutralizes Triangle Attack, Dual Strike, and Pathfinder effects active on unit through unit''s next action. Unit is excluded from ally Triangle Attack and Dual Strike effects calculated using numbers of allies. When this status (Schism) is neutralized, Triangle Attack, Dual Strike, and Pathfinder effects are also neutralized.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Sabotage Atk 3;Sabotage Res 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Hold','Atk/Res Hold','Atk/Res Hold','SID_攻撃魔防の大牽制','passivec',null,null,'Inflicts Atk/Res-4 on foes within 3 spaces during combat.','AtkRes Rein 3',null,false,300,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Ideal 1','Atk/Res Ideal 1','Atk/Res Ideal','SID_攻撃魔防の万全1','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP = 100% or if【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Res+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,'AtkRes Ideal 2',false,60,'Infantry,Armored','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Ideal 2','Atk/Res Ideal 2','Atk/Res Ideal','SID_攻撃魔防の万全2','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP = 100% or if【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Res+4 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','AtkRes Ideal 1','AtkRes Ideal 3',false,120,'Infantry,Armored','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Ideal 3','Atk/Res Ideal 3','Atk/Res Ideal','SID_攻撃魔防の万全3','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP = 100% or if【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','AtkRes Ideal 2','AtkRes Ideal 4',false,240,'Infantry,Armored','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Ideal 4','Atk/Res Ideal 4','Atk/Res Ideal','SID_攻撃魔防の万全4','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP = 100% or if【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Res+7 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP = 100% and【Bonus】is active on unit, grants an additional Atk/Res+2 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','AtkRes Ideal 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,Armored','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Liberate','Atk/Res Liberate','Atk/Res Liberate','SID_攻撃魔防の解放','passivec',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants【Atk Liberate】and【Res Liberate】to unit and allies closest to foes (excluding unit) for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+4 to unit during combat.<br><br>For unit and allies on the map with the 【Atk Liberate】or【Res Liberate】effects active, deals damage during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit or ally + 5, excluding stat bonuses (max 10; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Atk Liberate】<br>Grants bonus to Atk during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, + 4 (max 8).<br><br>【Res Liberate】<br>Grants bonus to Res during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, + 4 (max 8).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','AtkRes Gap 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkRes Link 1','Atk/Res Link 1','Atk/Res Link','SID_攻撃魔防の連携1','passiveb',null,null,'If a movement Assist skill (like Reposition, Shove, Pivot, etc.) is used by unit or targets unit, grants Atk/Res+2 to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn.',null,'AtkRes Link 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner,random_inherit_base'),
