  ('AtkSpd Airspace','Atk/Spd Airspace','Atk/Spd Airspace','SID_攻撃速さの領空','passivea',null,null,'Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+10 to unit and unit deals +X damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; if any space within 2 spaces of unit or foe has a Divine Vein effect applied, is defensive terrain, or counts as difficult or impassable terrain for units other than flying, X = 12; otherwise, X = 7), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','AtkSpd Catch 3',null,false,300,'Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Aria','Atk/Spd Aria','Atk/Spd Aria','SID_攻撃速さの詠唱','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = unit''s maximum Special cooldown count + 7 during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, deals damage = unit''s maximum Special cooldown count × X (excluding area-of-effect Specials; if unit triggers the "unit attacks twice" effect, X = 3; otherwise, X = 5).','AtkSpd Bond 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
