  ('AtkSpd Catch 1','Atk/Spd Catch 1','Atk/Spd Catch','SID_攻撃速さの機先1','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if foe''s HP = 100% or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,'AtkSpd Catch 2',false,60,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Catch 2','Atk/Spd Catch 2','Atk/Spd Catch','SID_攻撃速さの機先2','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if foe’s HP = 100% or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd+4 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','AtkSpd Catch 1','AtkSpd Catch 3',false,120,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Catch 3','Atk/Spd Catch 3','Atk/Spd Catch','SID_攻撃速さの機先3','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if foe’s HP = 100% or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','AtkSpd Catch 2',null,false,240,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Catch 4','Atk/Spd Catch 4','Atk/Spd Catch','SID_攻撃速さの機先4','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if foe''s HP = 100% or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd+7 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if foe''s HP = 100% and【Penalty】is active on foe, grants an additional Atk/Spd+2 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','AtkSpd Catch 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Clash 1','Atk/Spd Clash 1','Atk/Spd Clash','SID_攻撃速さの激突1','passivea',null,null,'If unit or foe initiates combat after moving to a different space, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd during combat = X + 1. (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat; max 1.)',null,'AtkSpd Clash 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base'),
  ('AtkSpd Clash 2','Atk/Spd Clash 2','Atk/Spd Clash','SID_攻撃速さの激突2','passivea',null,null,'If unit or foe initiates combat after moving to a different space, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd during combat = X + 3. (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat; max 2.)','AtkSpd Clash 1','AtkSpd Clash 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base'),
  ('AtkSpd Clash 3','Atk/Spd Clash 3','Atk/Spd Clash','SID_攻撃速さの激突3','passivea',null,null,'If unit or foe initiates combat after moving to a different space, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd during combat = X + 5. (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat; max 3.)','AtkSpd Clash 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base'),
  ('AtkSpd Clash 4','Atk/Spd Clash 4','Atk/Spd Clash','SID_攻撃速さの激突4','passivea',null,null,'If unit or foe initiates combat after moving to a different space, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd during combat = X + 6. (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat; max 4.) If X ≥ 2, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd during combat.','AtkSpd Clash 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base'),
  ('AtkSpd Excel','Atk/Spd Excel','Atk/Spd Excel','SID_攻撃速さの突破','passivea',null,null,'If unit or foe initiates combat after moving to a different space, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Atk/Spd+X to unit during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat; max 4), and also, if unit initiates combat, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X × 3 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials). If foe''s attack triggers foe''s Special, reduces damage dealt to unit by X × 3 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','AtkSpd Clash 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Faith','Atk/Spd Faith','Atk/Spd Faith','SID_攻撃速さの信念','passivec',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Bulwark】to unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If【Bulwark】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+4 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 5 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Bulwark】<br>Foes with Range = 1 cannot move through spaces adjacent to unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills).<br><br>Foes with Range = 2 cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills).','AtkSpd Oath 3',null,false,300,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Favor','Atk/Spd Favor','Atk/Spd Favor','SID_攻撃速さの共感','passiveb',null,null,'If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit or targets unit, grants Atk/Spd+6, 【Empathy】, and "reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special ''reduce damage by X%'' skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn, and grants Special cooldown-1 to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally once per turn.<br><br>Allies on the map with【Empathy】active deal +7 damage during combat (excluding area-of- effect Specials).<br><br>Inflicts Spd/Def/Res-4 on foe and unit deals +X+7 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = highest total Atk+Spd bonuses among unit and allies with 【Empathy】active).<br><br>【Empathy】<br>Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of types of【Bonus】effects, excluding stat bonuses, and【Penalty】effects, excluding stat penalties, active on player team and enemy team during combat (max 7).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','AtkSpd Link 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Finish 1','Atk/Spd Finish 1','Atk/Spd Finish','SID_攻撃速さの秘奥1','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+2 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Special is ready or unit''s Special triggered before or during this combat, deals +1 damage during combat. (Except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials.)',null,'AtkSpd Finish 2',false,60,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Finish 2','Atk/Spd Finish 2','Atk/Spd Finish','SID_攻撃速さの秘奥2','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+4 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Special is ready or unit''s Special triggered before or during this combat, deals +3 damage during combat. (Except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials.)','AtkSpd Finish 1','AtkSpd Finish 3',false,120,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
