  ('AtkSpd Ideal 4','Atk/Spd Ideal 4','Atk/Spd Ideal','SID_攻撃速さの万全4','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP = 100% or if【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+7 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP = 100% and【Bonus】is active on unit, grants an additional Atk/Spd+2 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','AtkSpd Ideal 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Liberate','Atk/Spd Liberate','Atk/Spd Liberate','SID_攻撃速さの解放','passivec',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Atk Liberate】and【Spd Liberate】to unit and allies closest to foes (excluding unit) for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+4 to unit during combat.<br><br>For unit and allies on the map with the 【Atk Liberate】or【Spd Liberate】effects active, deals damage during combat = number of 【Bonus】effects active on unit or ally + 5, excluding stat bonuses (max 10; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Atk Liberate】<br>Grants bonus to Atk during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, + 4 (max 8).<br><br>【Spd Liberate】<br>Grants bonus to Spd during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, + 4 (max 8).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','AtkSpd Gap 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Link 1','Atk/Spd Link 1','Atk/Spd Link','SID_攻撃速さの連携1','passiveb',null,null,'If a movement Assist skill (like Reposition, Shove, Pivot, etc.) is used by unit or targets unit, grants Atk/Spd+2 to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn.',null,'AtkSpd Link 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Link 2','Atk/Spd Link 2','Atk/Spd Link','SID_攻撃速さの連携2','passiveb',null,null,'If a movement Assist skill (like Reposition, Shove, Pivot, etc.) is used by unit or targets unit, grants Atk/Spd+4 to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn.','AtkSpd Link 1','AtkSpd Link 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Link 3','Atk/Spd Link 3','Atk/Spd Link','SID_攻撃速さの連携3','passiveb',null,null,'If a movement Assist skill (like Reposition, Shove, Pivot, etc.) is used by unit or targets unit, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn.','AtkSpd Link 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Link 4','Atk/Spd Link 4','Atk/Spd Link','SID_攻撃速さの連携4','passiveb',null,null,'If a movement Assist skill (like Reposition, Shove, Pivot, etc.) is used by unit or targets unit, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Canto (１)】to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn. Inflicts Spd-4 and Def/Res-2 on foe and unit deals +X damage during combat (X = highest total Atk+Spd bonuses among unit and allies with【Canto (１)】active; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','AtkSpd Link 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Mastery','Atk/Spd Mastery','Atk/Spd Mastery','SID_攻撃速さの制空','passivea',null,null,'If unit has entered combat during the current turn, enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd+7 to unit during combat, and also, if any space within 2 spaces of unit has a Divine Vein effect applied or counts as difficult terrain, excluding impassable terrain, grants Atk/Spd+4 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','AtkSpd Catch 3',null,false,300,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Menace','Atk/Spd Menace','Atk/Spd Menace','SID_攻撃速さの脅嚇3','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 4 spaces of a foe, inflicts Atk/Spd-6 on closest foes through their next actions and grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit for 1 turn.','Threat. AtkSpd 2',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Oath 1','Atk/Spd Oath 1','Atk/Spd Oath','SID_攻撃速さの信義1','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+3 to unit for 1 turn.',null,'AtkSpd Oath 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Oath 2','Atk/Spd Oath 2','Atk/Spd Oath','SID_攻撃速さの信義2','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+4 to unit for 1 turn.','AtkSpd Oath 1','AtkSpd Oath 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Oath 3','Atk/Spd Oath 3','Atk/Spd Oath','SID_攻撃速さの信義3','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit for 1 turn.','AtkSpd Oath 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Oath 4','Atk/Spd Oath 4','Atk/Spd Oath','SID_攻撃速さの信義4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and the following status to unit for 1 turn: "Unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces." If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+3 to unit during combat.','AtkSpd Oath 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner')
insert into feh.skills (wiki_name,name,group_name,tag_id,scategory,use_range,refine_path,description,required,next,exclusive,sp,can_use_move,can_use_weapon,might,stat_modifiers,cooldown,weapon_effectiveness,properties) values
  ('AtkSpd Pledge','Atk/Spd Pledge','Atk/Spd Pledge','SID_攻撃速さの信条4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and "Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)" to unit for 1 turn. If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+3 to unit during combat.','AtkSpd Oath 3',null,false,300,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Ploy 3','Atk/Spd Ploy 3','Atk/Spd Ploy','SID_攻撃速さの謀策3','passivec',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Spd-7,【Ploy】, and【Exposure】 on those foes through their next actions.<br><br>【Ploy】<br>Neutralizes【Bonus Doubler】,【Treachery】, and【Grand Strategy】effects active on unit during combat through unit''s next action.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Bonus Doubler】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of unit''s stats for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Treachery】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total bonuses on unit for 1 turn.<br><br>【Grand Strategy】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of unit''s stats × 2 for 1 turn. (Example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+14, for a net bonus of Atk+7.) Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>Unit''s negative effects that last "through unit''s next action" will remain in effect until this status (Grand Strategy) is neutralized.','Atk Ploy 3;Spd Ploy 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Prime 1','Atk/Spd Prime 1','Atk/Spd Prime','SID_攻撃速さの備え1','passivea',null,null,'If【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+X to unit during combat (X = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, × 2, + 1; max 3).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,'AtkSpd Prime 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Prime 2','Atk/Spd Prime 2','Atk/Spd Prime','SID_攻撃速さの備え2','passivea',null,null,'If【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+X to unit during combat (X = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, × 2, + 1; max 5).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','AtkSpd Prime 1','AtkSpd Prime 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Prime 3','Atk/Spd Prime 3','Atk/Spd Prime','SID_攻撃速さの備え3','passivea',null,null,'If【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+X to unit during combat (X = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, × 2, + 3; max 7).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','AtkSpd Prime 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Prime 4','Atk/Spd Prime 4','Atk/Spd Prime','SID_攻撃速さの備え4','passivea',null,null,'If【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+X to unit during combat (X = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, × 2, + 3; max 9), and also, if number of【Bonus】effects active on unit (excluding stat bonuses) ≥ 4, unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','AtkSpd Prime 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
