  ('AtkSpd Tidings','Atk/Spd Tidings','Atk/Spd Tidings','SID_攻撃速さの福音','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = number of allies within 3 spaces of unit × 2, + 8 (max 12), and foe cannot counterattack during combat.','AtkSpd Form 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Unity','Atk/Spd Unity','Atk/Spd Unity','SID_攻撃速さの連帯4','passivea',null,null,'If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat, and also, if unit is inflicted with any Atk/Spd penalty, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd during combat = current penalty on each of those stats × 2. (Example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+14, for a net bonus of Atk+12.) Calculates each stat bonus independently.','AtkSpd Bond 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('AtkSpd Waylay','Atk/Spd Waylay','Atk/Spd Waylay','SID_攻撃速さの奇襲','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat or the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Spd+8 to unit during combat, and also, if foe''s HP = 100% at start of combat, grants an additional Atk/Spd+2 to unit and unit deals +7 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, and if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.','AtkSpd Solo 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
