  ('Aurora Breath','Aurora Breath','Aurora Breath','SID_極光のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. If unit initiates combat, grants Atk+6 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. If foe initiates combat, grants Def/Res+6 during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
