  ('Aurora Breath DEF','Aurora Breath','Aurora Breath','SID_極光のブレス_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3. Grants Atk/Def/Res+6, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) during combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Aurora Breath RES','Aurora Breath','Aurora Breath','SID_極光のブレス_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Atk+3. Grants Atk/Def/Res+6, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) during combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Aurora Breath SKILL1','Aurora Breath','Aurora Breath','SID_極光のブレス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk+3. Grants Atk/Def/Res+6, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) during combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Def/Res+4 to unit and unit''s first attack deals damage = 15% of foe''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,19,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Aurora Breath SPD','Aurora Breath','Aurora Breath','SID_極光のブレス_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Atk+3. Grants Atk/Def/Res+6, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) during combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Auto-Lofnheidr','Auto-Lofnheiðr','Auto-Lofnheiðr','SID_機斧ロヴンヘイズ','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. Enables【Canto (３)】during turns 1 through 4. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk+6 to unit during combat, inflicts Atk-6 on foe during combat, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Canto (３)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ３ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Auto-Lofnheidr ATK','Auto-Lofnheiðr','Auto-Lofnheiðr','SID_機斧ロヴンヘイズ_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Enables【Canto (３)】during turns 1 through 4.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk+6 to unit, inflicts Atk-6 on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and foe cannot make a follow-up attack during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (３)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ３ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Auto-Lofnheidr DEF','Auto-Lofnheiðr','Auto-Lofnheiðr','SID_機斧ロヴンヘイズ_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Enables【Canto (３)】during turns 1 through 4.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk+6 to unit, inflicts Atk-6 on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and foe cannot make a follow-up attack during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (３)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ３ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
