  ('B Tomebreaker 1','B Tomebreaker 1','B Tomebreaker','SID_青魔殺し1','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 90% in combat against a blue tome foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,'B Tomebreaker 2',false,50,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('B Tomebreaker 2','B Tomebreaker 2','B Tomebreaker','SID_青魔殺し2','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 70% in combat against a blue tome foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','B Tomebreaker 1','B Tomebreaker 3',false,100,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('B Tomebreaker 3','B Tomebreaker 3','B Tomebreaker','SID_青魔殺し3','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 50% in combat against a blue tome foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','B Tomebreaker 2',null,false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Baked Treats','Baked Treats','Baked Treats','SID_美味しい焼き菓子','weapon',2,null,'Enables【Canto (１)】.<br><br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, inflicts Spd/Res-6 and 【Sabotage】on nearest foes within 5 spaces of unit and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Balance Circlet II','Balance Circlet II','Balance Circlet II','SID_聖神と暗黒神…・承','special',null,null,'When Special triggers, boosts damage by 40% of unit''s Res and neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills.<br><br>If unit''s or foe''s Special is ready or if unit''s or foe''s Special triggered before or during this combat and if unit can attack in combat, reduces damage from foe''s next attack by 40% (once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit’s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0 during combat, unit survives with 1 HP (once per combat; considered a non-Special effect; does not stack with non-Special effects that allow unit to survive with 1 HP if foe''s attack would reduce unit''s HP to 0).','Circlet of Balance',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,2,null,'offensive_special'),
  ('Balmung','Balmung','Balmung','SID_バルムンク','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP = 100% at start of combat, neutralizes penalties on unit and grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Balmung ATK','Balmung','Balmung','SID_バルムンク_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Spd+3. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes unit''s penalties, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,18,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Balmung DEF','Balmung','Balmung','SID_バルムンク_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Spd+3. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes unit''s penalties, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Balmung RES','Balmung','Balmung','SID_バルムンク_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Spd+3. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes unit''s penalties, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Balmung SKILL1','Balmung','Balmung','SID_バルムンク_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Spd+3. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes unit''s penalties, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = 15% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, + 4), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between Spd stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Balmung SPD','Balmung','Balmung','SID_バルムンク_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Spd+3. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes unit''s penalties, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,6,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Bane','Bane','Bane','SID_瞬殺','special',null,null,'Treats foe''s Def/Res stats as if reduced by 40% when Special triggers.<br><br>When Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills, and also, if damage dealt prior to damage reduction calculation < foe''s HP - 1, sets damage before damage reduction as foe''s HP - 1 (excluding certain foes, such as Røkkr).<br><br>If unit''s or foe''s Special is ready or triggered before or during this combat, reduces damage from foe''s next attack by 30% (once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Moonbow',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,2,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Banshee Theta','Banshee Θ','Banshee Θ','SID_バンシーΘ','weapon',2,null,'At the start of turns 3 and 4, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-6,【Gravity】,【Guard】, and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes within 5 spaces of unit through their next actions.<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Banshee Theta ATK','Banshee Θ','Banshee Θ','SID_バンシーΘ_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','At the start of turns 3 and 4, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-7,【Gravity】,【Guard】, and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes within 5 spaces of unit through their next actions.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res = number of【Penalty】effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties, + 6, and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Banshee Theta DEF','Banshee Θ','Banshee Θ','SID_バンシーΘ_DEF','weapon',2,'def','At the start of turns 3 and 4, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-7,【Gravity】,【Guard】, and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes within 5 spaces of unit through their next actions.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res = number of【Penalty】effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties, + 6, and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Banshee Theta RES','Banshee Θ','Banshee Θ','SID_バンシーΘ_RES','weapon',2,'res','At the start of turns 3 and 4, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-7,【Gravity】,【Guard】, and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes within 5 spaces of unit through their next actions.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res = number of【Penalty】effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties, + 6, and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Banshee Theta SKILL1','Banshee Θ','Banshee Θ','SID_バンシーΘ_一','weapon',2,'skill1','At the start of turns 3 and 4, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-7,【Gravity】,【Guard】, and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes within 5 spaces of unit through their next actions.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res = number of【Penalty】effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties, + 6, and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts Atk/Res-7 and【Sabotage】on foes with Res < unit''s Res and that are within 2 spaces of another foe through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res during combat, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Banshee Theta SPD','Banshee Θ','Banshee Θ','SID_バンシーΘ_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','At the start of turns 3 and 4, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-7,【Gravity】,【Guard】, and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes within 5 spaces of unit through their next actions.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res = number of【Penalty】effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties, + 6, and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Barb Shuriken','Barb Shuriken','Barb Shuriken','SID_暗殺手裏剣','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-5 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Steel Dagger','Barb Shuriken Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'0,8,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
