  ('Beast Sense 1','Beast Sense 1','Beast Sense','SID_絶対化身・察知1','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP = 100%, removes the condition to transform. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by X% (X = difference between Spd stats; max 10).',null,'Beast Sense 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
