  ('Beorcs Blessing','Beorc''s Blessing','Beorc''s Blessing','SID_ベオクの加護','passiveb',null,null,'Neutralizes cavalry and flying foes'' bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.<br>(Skill cannot be inherited.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Bereft Lance','Bereft Lance','Bereft Lance','SID_虚ろな槍','weapon',1,null,'Grants Def+3. Grants Atk/Def+X during combat. (Calculates X based on number of allies within 2 spaces of unit: 0 allies grants +6; 1 ally grants +4; 2 allies grants +2; ≥3 allies grants +0.) If the number of allies within 2 spaces is ≤ 1, neutralizes foe''s bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,3,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Bereft Lance ATK','Bereft Lance','Bereft Lance','SID_虚ろな槍_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Def+3. Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit (calculates X based on number of allies adjacent to unit: 0 allies grants +10; 1 ally grants +8; 2 allies grants +6; ≥3 allies grants +4), neutralizes foe''s bonuses, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,18,0,3,0',null,null,null),
