  ('Berukas Axe SKILL1','Beruka''s Axe','Beruka''s Axe','SID_ベルカの殺斧_消','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, inflicts Atk-4 on foe during combat and Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
