  ('Book of Orchids SKILL1','Book of Orchids','Book of Orchids','SID_金蘭の書_連','weapon',2,'skill1','If unit initiates combat, grants Atk+6 during combat.<br>If a movement Assist skill (like Reposition, Shove, Pivot, etc.) is used by unit or targets unit, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
