  ('Brazen Cat Fang','Brazen Cat Fang','Brazen Cat Fang','SID_剛なる戦猫の爪牙','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. If unit is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','Adult Cavalry',null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Brazen Cat Fang 2 ATK','Brazen Cat Fang','Brazen Cat Fang','SID_剛なる戦猫の爪牙2_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and deals +10 damage when Special triggers. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Brazen Cat Fang 2 DEF','Brazen Cat Fang','Brazen Cat Fang','SID_剛なる戦猫の爪牙2_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and deals +10 damage when Special triggers. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Brazen Cat Fang 2 RES','Brazen Cat Fang','Brazen Cat Fang','SID_剛なる戦猫の爪牙2_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and deals +10 damage when Special triggers. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Brazen Cat Fang 2 SKILL1','Brazen Cat Fang','Brazen Cat Fang','SID_剛なる戦猫の爪牙2_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and deals +10 damage when Special triggers. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack, and also, if unit transforms, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Brazen Cat Fang 2 SPD','Brazen Cat Fang','Brazen Cat Fang','SID_剛なる戦猫の爪牙2_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and deals +10 damage when Special triggers. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,6,0,0',null,null,null),
