  ('Brilliant Rapier RES','Brilliant Rapier','Brilliant Rapier','SID_光明レイピア_RES','weapon',1,'res','Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Spd+3. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Def (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat. If unit''s HP ≤ 80% and foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,0,4',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Brilliant Rapier SKILL1','Brilliant Rapier','Brilliant Rapier','SID_光明レイピア_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Spd+3. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Def (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat. If unit''s HP ≤ 80% and foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = 4 + highest bonus on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit; calculates each stat bonus independently) and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,3,0,0',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Brilliant Rapier SPD','Brilliant Rapier','Brilliant Rapier','SID_光明レイピア_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Spd+3. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Def (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat. If unit''s HP ≤ 80% and foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,6,0,0',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Brilliant Starlight','Brilliant Starlight','Brilliant Starlight','SID_聖光スターライト','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Def/Res+6 and "reduces damage from area-of-effect Specials by 80% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, neutralizes bonuses to foe''s Atk/Res during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Brilliant Starlight ATK','Brilliant Starlight','Brilliant Starlight','SID_聖光スターライト_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If a skill compares unit''s Res to a foe''s or ally''s Res, treats unit''s Res as if granted +5.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6 and "reduces damage from area-of-effect Specials by 80% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, neutralizes bonuses to foe''s Atk/Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Brilliant Starlight DEF','Brilliant Starlight','Brilliant Starlight','SID_聖光スターライト_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If a skill compares unit''s Res to a foe''s or ally''s Res, treats unit''s Res as if granted +5.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6 and "reduces damage from area-of-effect Specials by 80% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, neutralizes bonuses to foe''s Atk/Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Brilliant Starlight RES','Brilliant Starlight','Brilliant Starlight','SID_聖光スターライト_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If a skill compares unit''s Res to a foe''s or ally''s Res, treats unit''s Res as if granted +5.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6 and "reduces damage from area-of-effect Specials by 80% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, neutralizes bonuses to foe''s Atk/Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,null),
  ('Brilliant Starlight SKILL1','Brilliant Starlight','Brilliant Starlight','SID_聖光スターライト_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If a skill compares unit''s Res to a foe''s or ally''s Res, treats unit''s Res as if granted +5.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6 and "reduces damage from area-of-effect Specials by 80% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, neutralizes bonuses to foe''s Atk/Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br>For foes on the map whose Res < unit''s Res at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Res-5, foe suffers +10 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe before foe''s first attack during combat (cannot exceed the foe''s maximum Special cooldown).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-11 on foe, and unit deals +25 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
