  ('Bun-Bun Baton SKILL1','Bun-Bun Baton','Bun-Bun Baton','SID_ウカノミタマ_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against armored foes. Neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>If a skill compares unit''s Spd to a foe''s or ally''s Spd, treats unit''s Spd as if granted +7. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduces damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (example: a foe with a "reduces damage by 45%" skill would reduce damage by 23% instead), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,'armored',null),
  ('Bun-Bun Baton SPD','Bun-Bun Baton','Bun-Bun Baton','SID_ウカノミタマ_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against armored foes. Neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,'armored',null),
  ('Bunny Fang','Bunny Fang','Bunny Fang','SID_タグエルの子の爪牙','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. Effective against cavalry foes. After combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 75%, grants Special cooldown count-2.<br>Effect:【Beast (Cavalry)】<br><br>【Beast (Cavalry)】<br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','Adult Cavalry',null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,'cavalry','random_owner'),
  ('Bunny Fang 2 ATK','Bunny Fang','Bunny Fang','SID_タグエルの子の爪牙2_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Spd+3. Effective against cavalry foes. If unit is not adjacent to an ally or unit''s HP ≤ 90% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. After combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 90%, grants Special cooldown count-2. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,3,0,0',null,'cavalry',null),
  ('Bunny Fang 2 DEF','Bunny Fang','Bunny Fang','SID_タグエルの子の爪牙2_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Spd+3. Effective against cavalry foes. If unit is not adjacent to an ally or unit''s HP ≤ 90% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. After combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 90%, grants Special cooldown count-2. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,4,0',null,'cavalry',null),
  ('Bunny Fang 2 RES','Bunny Fang','Bunny Fang','SID_タグエルの子の爪牙2_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Spd+3. Effective against cavalry foes. If unit is not adjacent to an ally or unit''s HP ≤ 90% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. After combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 90%, grants Special cooldown count-2. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,0,4',null,'cavalry',null),
  ('Bunny Fang 2 SKILL1','Bunny Fang','Bunny Fang','SID_タグエルの子の爪牙2_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Spd+3. Effective against cavalry foes. If unit is not adjacent to an ally or unit''s HP ≤ 90% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. After combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 90%, grants Special cooldown count-2. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.<br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat, deals damage = 10% of unit''s Spd (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), and also, if unit transforms, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,14,3,0,0',null,'cavalry',null),
