  ('Call to Flame','Call to Flame','Call to Flame','SID_オイデ、ヒノコタチ','assist',1,null,'Grants another action to target ally and grants Atk+6 and Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat to that ally for 1 turn. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.) Also, if the target ally is a dragon, target can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack. Cannot target an ally with Sing or Dance. This skill treated as Sing or Dance.)','Dance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Called to Serve','Called to Serve','Called to Serve','SID_激励・強化無効','passiveb',null,null,'If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit, grants "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat" to unit, target ally, and allies within 2 spaces of target ally after movement for 1 turn.<br><br>Allies on the map with the "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat" status active deal +5 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Inflicts Spd/Res-4 on foe and unit deals +X damage during combat (X = number of allies on the map with "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat" status active, excluding unit, × 5; max 15; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Live to Serve 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Caltrop Dagger','Caltrop Dagger','Caltrop Dagger','SID_騎殺の暗器','weapon',2,null,'Effective against cavalry foes. Disables unit''s and foe''s skills that change attack priority.<br>Effect:【Dagger ５】<br><br>【Dagger ５】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-５ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Steel Dagger','Caltrop Dagger Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,'cavalry',null),
