  ('Canny Fighter','Canny Fighter','Canny Fighter','SID_魔の守備隊形','passiveb',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-4 on foe, unit and foe cannot make a follow-up attack, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by X% (if foe can make a follow-up attack, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40), and reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 40% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes; likewise, "follow-up attack" normally means the second strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the third and fourth strikes), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.','Wary Fighter 3',null,false,300,'Armored','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Canto Control 1','Canto Control 1','Canto Control','SID_再移動制限1','passivec',null,null,'If foe within 2 spaces of unit triggers Canto, inflicts【Canto Control】on that foe.<br><br>【Canto Control】<br>Limits the number of spaces unit can move with Canto through their next action. If unit''s Range = 1, unit can move 1 space when Canto triggers. If unit''s Range = 2, unit''s action ends when Canto triggers.',null,'Canto Control 2',false,60,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Canto Control 2','Canto Control 2','Canto Control','SID_再移動制限2','passivec',null,null,'If foe within 3 spaces of unit triggers Canto, inflicts【Canto Control】on that foe.<br><br>【Canto Control】<br>Limits the number of spaces target can move with Canto through their next action. If target''s Range = 1, target can move 1 space when Canto triggers. If target''s Range = 2, target''s action ends when Canto triggers.','Canto Control 1','Canto Control 3',false,120,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Canto Control 3','Canto Control 3','Canto Control','SID_再移動制限3','passivec',null,null,'If foe within 4 spaces of unit triggers Canto, inflicts【Canto Control】on that foe.<br><br>【Canto Control】<br>Limits the number of spaces target can move with Canto through their next action. If target''s Range = 1, target can move 1 space when Canto triggers. If target''s Range = 2, target''s action ends when Canto triggers.','Canto Control 2',null,false,240,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Captains Sword','Captain''s Sword','Captain''s Sword','SID_白銀の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Foes with Range = 1 cannot move through spaces adjacent to unit, and foes with Range = 2 cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and neutralizes foe''s bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat, restores 7 HP to unit after combat, and also, if foe initiates combat and unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Cardinals Tome','Cardinal''s Tome','Cardinal''s Tome','SID_枢機卿の書','weapon',2,null,'For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, deals 10 damage to foe as their combat begins (effects that reduce damage during combat do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1) and inflicts Atk/Res-5 on foe during their combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Cardinals Tome ATK','Cardinal''s Tome','Cardinal''s Tome','SID_枢機卿の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, deals 10 damage to foe as their combat begins (effects that reduce damage during combat do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1) and inflicts Atk/Res-5 on foe during their combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Cardinals Tome DEF','Cardinal''s Tome','Cardinal''s Tome','SID_枢機卿の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, deals 10 damage to foe as their combat begins (effects that reduce damage during combat do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1) and inflicts Atk/Res-5 on foe during their combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Cardinals Tome RES','Cardinal''s Tome','Cardinal''s Tome','SID_枢機卿の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, deals 10 damage to foe as their combat begins (effects that reduce damage during combat do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1) and inflicts Atk/Res-5 on foe during their combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Cardinals Tome SKILL1','Cardinal''s Tome','Cardinal''s Tome','SID_枢機卿の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, deals 10 damage to foe as their combat begins (effects that reduce damage during combat do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1) and inflicts Atk/Res-5 on foe during their combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br>Restores 10 HP to allies within 3 spaces of unit after their combat.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, unit deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and restores 10 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Cardinals Tome SPD','Cardinal''s Tome','Cardinal''s Tome','SID_枢機卿の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, deals 10 damage to foe as their combat begins (effects that reduce damage during combat do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1) and inflicts Atk/Res-5 on foe during their combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Caring Conch','Caring Conch','Caring Conch','SID_深き優しさの聖器','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack, and also, after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Guard】on target and foes within 2 spaces of target. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Caring Magic','Caring Magic','Caring Magic','SID_慈愛の王女の魔力','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 20% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first follow-up attack during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe''s next attack.','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Carnage Amatsu','Carnage Amatsu','Carnage Amatsu','SID_修羅アマツ','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If unit is not adjacent to an ally and unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Carnage Amatsu ATK','Carnage Amatsu','Carnage Amatsu','SID_修羅アマツ_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Spd+3. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,18,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Carnage Amatsu DEF','Carnage Amatsu','Carnage Amatsu','SID_修羅アマツ_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Spd+3. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Carnage Amatsu RES','Carnage Amatsu','Carnage Amatsu','SID_修羅アマツ_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Spd+3. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Carnage Amatsu SKILL1','Carnage Amatsu','Carnage Amatsu','SID_修羅アマツ_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Spd+3. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" and【Null Follow-Up】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of enemy phase (except for in Pawns of Loki), applies【Divine Vein (Flame)】to unit''s space and spaces within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit when unit deals damage to foe during combat.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>【Divine Vein (Flame)】<br>Applies the following effects on space: Acts as difficult terrain for foes with Range = 2 (moving over this space costs +1 movement; does not apply to "cannot be slowed by terrain" effects; movement cost cannot exceed unit''s allowed movement). At start of enemy phase, deals 7 damage to foe, and also, as combat begins, deals an additional 7 damage to foe (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Carnage Amatsu SPD','Carnage Amatsu','Carnage Amatsu','SID_修羅アマツ_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Spd+3. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,6,0,0',null,null,null),
