  ('Cherches Axe SKILL1','Cherche''s Axe','Cherche''s Axe','SID_セルジュの恐斧_恐','weapon',1,'skill1','Inflicts Spd-5. If unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice.<br>At start of turn, converts bonuses on foes in cardinal directions with HP < unit''s HP into penalties through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',11,'3,11,-5,0,0',null,null,null),
