  ('Clever Dagger','Clever Dagger','Clever Dagger','SID_攻防の暗器','weapon',2,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat and reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 30%.<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ５】<br><br>【Dagger ５】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-５ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Steel Dagger','Clever Dagger Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
