  ('Command Lance SKILL1','Command Lance','Command Lance','SID_神使親衛隊隊長の槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40%.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = number of allies within 3 spaces × 2, + 4; max 10), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
