  ('Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙','weapon',1,null,'Grants Def+3. If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+3 to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','Adult Cavalry',null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,3,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Covert Cat Fang 2 ATK','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙2_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+4 to allies within 3 spaces during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,0,3,0',null,null,null),
