  ('Covert Cat Fang 2 RES','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙2_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+4 to allies within 3 spaces during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,3,4',null,null,null),
  ('Covert Cat Fang 2 SKILL1','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙2_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+4 to allies within 3 spaces during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and deals damage = number of allies within 3 spaces × 5. (Excluding area-of-effect Specials; max 15.)',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Covert Cat Fang 2 SPD','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙2_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+4 to allies within 3 spaces during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Covert Cat Fang ATK','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+4 to allies within 3 spaces during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Covert Cat Fang DEF','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+4 to allies within 3 spaces during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,7,0',null,null,null),
  ('Covert Cat Fang RES','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+4 to allies within 3 spaces during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,3,4',null,null,null),
  ('Covert Cat Fang SKILL1','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+4 to allies within 3 spaces during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and deals damage = number of allies within 3 spaces × 5. (Excluding area-of-effect Specials; max 15.)',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Covert Cat Fang SPD','Covert Cat Fang','Covert Cat Fang','SID_柔なる戦猫の爪牙_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+4 to allies within 3 spaces during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Covert Duality','Covert Duality','Covert Duality','SID_傭兵忍の双刃','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>If unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice.<br><br>At start of turn and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Spd/Def-7, 【Sabotage】, and【Exposure】on closest foes and any foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 3, + 5 (max 14), neutralizes foe''s bonuses, unit deals +X × 5 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X × 3 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of Bonus effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses + number of Penalty effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties; max 5).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Silver Dagger',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',9,'0,9,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Covetous One','Covetous One','Covetous One','SID_求めるは知のみ','passivec',null,null,'Enables【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】.<br><br>When Canto triggers, enables unit to use 【Smite】on ally (this effect is not treated as an Assist skill; if similar effects are active, this effect does not trigger).<br><br>At start of turn and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Res-7, 【Exposure】, and【Discord】on those foes through their next actions.<br><br>If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit, deals 1 damage to target ally and grants any Bonus effects active on unit to target ally for 1 turn (excluding stat bonuses; once per turn).<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn (min. １; if unit used a movement skill that warped them, unit can move １ space(s)). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Smite】<br>Range = 1. Pushes target ally 2 spaces away.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Coyotes Lance','Coyote''s Lance','Coyote''s Lance','SID_草原の狼の白槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and the following effect to unit and cavalry allies within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn: "If unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack." If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40%, and deals damage = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 3 (max: 9). (Except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials.)','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Cozy Candles','Cozy Candles','Cozy Candles','SID_艶なる姉二人の燭台','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Disables foe''s effects that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>For unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X (for unit, X = 15; for allies, X = 5) and grants Special cooldown count-1 before each of their attacks during combat (including when they attack twice or perform a follow-up attack), and restores 7 HP after combat.<br><br>Unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Crafty Fighter 1','Crafty Fighter 1','Crafty Fighter','SID_抑止隊形1','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 75% and foe initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,'Crafty Fighter 2',false,60,'Armored',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Crafty Fighter 2','Crafty Fighter 2','Crafty Fighter','SID_抑止隊形2','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 50% and foe initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Crafty Fighter 1','Crafty Fighter 3',false,120,'Armored',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Crafty Fighter 3','Crafty Fighter 3','Crafty Fighter','SID_抑止隊形3','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 25% and foe initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Crafty Fighter 2',null,false,240,'Armored',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Cravers Tome','Craver''s Tome','Craver''s Tome','SID_放浪の賢者の書','weapon',2,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and also, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally and unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by difference between stats during combat (max 20; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base'),
  ('Cravers Tome ATK','Craver''s Tome','Craver''s Tome','SID_放浪の賢者の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and also, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally and unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by difference between stats during combat (max 20; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Cravers Tome DEF','Craver''s Tome','Craver''s Tome','SID_放浪の賢者の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and also, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally and unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by difference between stats during combat (max 20; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Cravers Tome RES','Craver''s Tome','Craver''s Tome','SID_放浪の賢者の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and also, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally and unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by difference between stats during combat (max 20; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Cravers Tome SKILL1','Craver''s Tome','Craver''s Tome','SID_放浪の賢者の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and also, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally and unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by difference between stats during combat (max 20; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Res, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Res, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Cravers Tome SPD','Craver''s Tome','Craver''s Tome','SID_放浪の賢者の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and also, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally and unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by difference between stats during combat (max 20; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Creation Pulse','Creation Pulse','Creation Pulse','SID_開闢の鼓動','passivec',null,null,'If【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd+3 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-X to unit before unit''s first attack during combat (X = number of 【Penalty】effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties; max 2).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Times Pulse 3',null,false,300,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Creator Sword','Creator Sword','Creator Sword','SID_天帝の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). During combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks, prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe, or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Creator Sword ATK','Creator Sword','Creator Sword','SID_天帝の剣_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). During combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks, prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe, or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Creator Sword DEF','Creator Sword','Creator Sword','SID_天帝の剣_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). During combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks, prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe, or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Creator Sword RES','Creator Sword','Creator Sword','SID_天帝の剣_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). During combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks, prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe, or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Creator Sword SKILL1','Creator Sword','Creator Sword','SID_天帝の剣_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). During combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks, prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe, or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat. If Special triggers, neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Creator Sword SPD','Creator Sword','Creator Sword','SID_天帝の剣_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). During combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks, prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe, or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Crimean Scepter','Crimean Scepter','Crimean Scepter','SID_クリミア女王の王笏','weapon',2,null,'Calculates damage from staff like other weapons. Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1; max cooldown count cannot be reduced below 1). At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and the following status to unit and allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn: "If unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack." If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit and grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = highest respective Atk/Spd bonuses among unit and allies within 2 spaces × 1.5 (calculates each stat bonus independently).','Assault',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
