  ('Crimson Axe SKILL1','Crimson Axe','Crimson Axe','SID_紅姫の斧_消','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP = 100% at start of combat, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
