  ('Dark Monograph RES','Dark Monograph','Dark Monograph','SID_闇魔道の研究書_RES','weapon',2,'res','If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-5 on foe, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Dark Monograph SKILL1','Dark Monograph','Dark Monograph','SID_闇魔道の研究書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-5 on foe, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Panic】, and【Deep Wounds】 on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-5 on foe, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd/Res, and unit makes guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
