  ('Dark Scripture','Dark Scripture','Dark Scripture','SID_暗黒の聖書','weapon',2,null,'Grants Atk+3. If unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, and if foe does not have "effective against dragons," unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.','Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dark Scripture ATK','Dark Scripture','Dark Scripture','SID_暗黒の聖書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Atk+3. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Sabotage】, 【Deep Wounds】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or if unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-4 on foe and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Dark Scripture DEF','Dark Scripture','Dark Scripture','SID_暗黒の聖書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Atk+3. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Sabotage】, 【Deep Wounds】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or if unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-4 on foe and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,17,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Dark Scripture RES','Dark Scripture','Dark Scripture','SID_暗黒の聖書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Atk+3. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Sabotage】, 【Deep Wounds】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or if unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-4 on foe and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,17,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Dark Scripture SKILL1','Dark Scripture','Dark Scripture','SID_暗黒の聖書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Atk+3. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Sabotage】, 【Deep Wounds】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or if unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-4 on foe and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-4 on foe, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and unit deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Dark Scripture SPD','Dark Scripture','Dark Scripture','SID_暗黒の聖書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Atk+3. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Sabotage】, 【Deep Wounds】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or if unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-4 on foe and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,17,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Dark Spikes Tau','Dark Spikes Τ','Dark Spikes Τ','SID_ダークスパイクΤ','weapon',2,null,'Effective against cavalry foes. Grants Spd+3. At the start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 during combat. If unit''s HP < 100% and unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,'cavalry','random_owner'),
  ('Dark Spikes Tau ATK','Dark Spikes Τ','Dark Spikes Τ','SID_ダークスパイクΤ_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Effective against cavalry foes. Grants Spd+3. At the start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 during combat. If unit''s HP < 100% and unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,3,0,0',null,'cavalry',null),
  ('Dark Spikes Tau DEF','Dark Spikes Τ','Dark Spikes Τ','SID_ダークスパイクΤ_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Effective against cavalry foes. Grants Spd+3. At the start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 during combat. If unit''s HP < 100% and unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,3,3,0',null,'cavalry',null),
  ('Dark Spikes Tau RES','Dark Spikes Τ','Dark Spikes Τ','SID_ダークスパイクΤ_RES','weapon',2,'res','Effective against cavalry foes. Grants Spd+3. At the start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 during combat. If unit''s HP < 100% and unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,3,0,3',null,'cavalry',null),
  ('Dark Spikes Tau SKILL1','Dark Spikes Τ','Dark Spikes Τ','SID_ダークスパイクΤ_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against cavalry foes. Grants Spd+3. At the start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 during combat. If unit''s HP < 100% and unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of turn, grants the following status to unit for 1 turn and deals 1 damage to unit: "Unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces." If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat and Special cooldown charge +1 per unit''s attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',-1,'cavalry',null),
  ('Dark Spikes Tau SPD','Dark Spikes Τ','Dark Spikes Τ','SID_ダークスパイクΤ_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Effective against cavalry foes. Grants Spd+3. At the start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 during combat. If unit''s HP < 100% and unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,5,0,0',null,'cavalry',null),
  ('Darkling Dragon','Darkling Dragon','Darkling Dragon','SID_闇の樹海の竜神','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Def/Res+6 and【Warp Bubble】to unit for 1 turn. At start of turn, grants Def/Res+6 and【Warp Bubble】to any support partner within 2 spaces of unit or, if unit is not on a team with unit''s support partner, to ally with the highest Def within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials). If a foe uses bow, dagger, magic, or staff and initiates combat against an ally within 2 spaces of unit, triggers【Savior】on unit. If unit triggers Savior, grants Atk/Def/Res+4 during combat.<br><br>【Warp Bubble】<br>Foes cannot warp into spaces within 4 spaces of unit. (Does not affect foes with Pass skills or warp effects from structures, like camps and fortresses in Rival Domains.)<br><br>【Savior】<br>Unit takes ally''s space, enters combat in ally''s place, and receives all after-combat effects.<br><br>Savior will not trigger if ally is on terrain that unit cannot move to or if multiple units are able to use Savior during the same combat. If Savior triggers, after-combat movement effects do not occur.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Darkling Guard II','Darkling Guard II','Darkling Guardian','SID_闇の樹海の守…・承','passivec',null,null,'Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6, "foe cannot make a follow-up attack," "neutralizes ''effective against flying'' bonuses,"【Warp Bubble】, and【Bulwark】to unit and target allies within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn. (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Def on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes penalties to unit''s Atk, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Warp Bubble】<br>Foes cannot warp into spaces within 4 spaces of unit. (Does not affect foes with Pass skills or warp effects from structures, like camps and fortresses in Rival Domains.)<br><br>【Bulwark】<br>Foes with Range = 1 cannot move through spaces adjacent to unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills).<br><br>Foes with Range = 2 cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills).','Darkling Guardian',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Darkling Guardian','Darkling Guardian','Darkling Guardian','SID_闇の樹海の守護竜','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Def/Res+6, "foe cannot make a follow-up attack," and【Warp Bubble】to unit for one turn.<br><br>【Warp Bubble】<br>Foes cannot warp into spaces within 4 spaces of unit. (Does not affect foes with Pass skills or warp effects from structures, like camps and fortresses in Rival Domains.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Darkness Tome','Darkness Tome','Darkness Tome','SID_深き淵の書','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Anathema】,【Draconic Hex】, and【Hexblade】 to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Anathema】<br>Inflicts Spd/Def/Res-4 on foes within 3 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>【Draconic Hex】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foe during combat and inflicts penalty on each of those stats = 5 - current penalty on each of those stats during combat for 1 turn (min 0; calculates each stat penalty independently).<br><br>【Hexblade】<br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res during combat for 1 turn (including damage dealt by Specials before combat).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Darkness Tome ATK','Darkness Tome','Darkness Tome','SID_深き淵の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Anathema】,【Draconic Hex】, and【Hexblade】 to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Anathema】<br>Inflicts Spd/Def/Res-4 on foes within 3 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>【Draconic Hex】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foe during combat and inflicts penalty on each of those stats = 5 - current penalty on each of those stats during combat for 1 turn (min 0; calculates each stat penalty independently).<br><br>【Hexblade】<br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res during combat for 1 turn (including damage dealt by Specials before combat).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Darkness Tome DEF','Darkness Tome','Darkness Tome','SID_深き淵の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Anathema】,【Draconic Hex】, and【Hexblade】 to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Anathema】<br>Inflicts Spd/Def/Res-4 on foes within 3 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>【Draconic Hex】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foe during combat and inflicts penalty on each of those stats = 5 - current penalty on each of those stats during combat for 1 turn (min 0; calculates each stat penalty independently).<br><br>【Hexblade】<br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res during combat for 1 turn (including damage dealt by Specials before combat).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,null),
