  ('Darkness Tome SKILL1','Darkness Tome','Darkness Tome','SID_深き淵の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Anathema】,【Draconic Hex】, and【Hexblade】 to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Anathema】<br>Inflicts Spd/Def/Res-4 on foes within 3 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>【Draconic Hex】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foe during combat and inflicts penalty on each of those stats = 5 - current penalty on each of those stats during combat for 1 turn (min 0; calculates each stat penalty independently).<br><br>【Hexblade】<br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res during combat for 1 turn (including damage dealt by Specials before combat).<br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+10 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-X to unit before unit''s first attack during combat (X = number of allies on the map with the Anathema effect active, including unit; max 3).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
