  ('Dauntless','Dauntless','Dauntless',null,'captain',null,null,'At the start of turns 2 through 5, grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack to captain and allies within 2 spaces of captain for 1 turn and inflicts【Guard】on foes in cardinal directions of captain through their next actions.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,false,0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
