  ('Dawn Suzu','Dawn Suzu','Dawn Suzu','SID_暁天の神楽鈴','weapon',2,null,'Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Atk+3. Disables unit''s and foe''s skills that change attack priority.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Dawning Light','Dawning Light','Dawning Light','SID_暁暗の光','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against armored and cavalry foes.<br><br>Unit can move through foes'' spaces. Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of any ally within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Potent Follow】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>After start-of-turn effects trigger on player phase, and after start-of-turn effects trigger on enemy phase (except for in Summoner Duels), for unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit, converts penalties on that unit or ally into bonuses, and neutralizes two Penalty effects (does not apply to Penalty effects that are applied at the same time; neutralizes the first applicable Penalty effects on unit''s or ally''s list of active effects).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Potent Follow】<br>If decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 25 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow-ups), triggers【Potent Follow X%】during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'armored,cavalry','random_owner'),
  ('Dawnsweet Box','Dawnsweet Box','Dawnsweet Box','SID_白夜の王子の菓子箱','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and inflicts Atk/Spd-4 and Atk/Spd-X on foe during combat (X = 3 × number of allies within 2 spaces of unit whose Atk at start of combat ≥ unit''s Atk-4; max 6), and also, the following effects will occur based on the value of unit''s Spd minus foe''s Spd: if ≥ -4, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 30%; if ≥ 0, when unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to unit (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt); if ≥ 4, foe''s attack can trigger foe''s Special, and unit has weapon-triangle advantage, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe before foe''s first attack during combat. (Cannot exceed foe''s maximum Special cooldown.)','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
