  ('Daybreak Lance SKILL1','Daybreak Lance','Daybreak Lance','SID_払暁の槍_構','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>If foe initiates combat, grants Atk/Def+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
