  ('Daydream Egg','Daydream Egg','Daydream Egg','SID_春に揺蕩う白夢の卵','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3. If【Penalty】is active on any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-5 and Special cooldown charge -1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) on those foes during their combat. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75% or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
