  ('Deep-Blue Bow ATK','Deep-Blue Bow','Deep-Blue Bow','SID_絶海の蒼弓_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Spd+3. Effective against flying and armored foes. If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,15,3,0,0',null,'armored,flying',null),
