  ('DefRes Scowl 1','Def/Res Scowl 1','Def/Res Scowl','SID_守備魔防の竜眼1','passivea',null,null,'If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Def/Res+2 to unit during combat, and also, if foe''s attack can trigger foe''s Special and unit''s Res ≥ foe''s Res+15 during combat, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe before foe''s first attack. (Cannot exceed the foe''s maximum Special cooldown.)',null,'DefRes Scowl 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
