  ('Demonic Force','Demonic Force','Demonic Force','SID_魔の神髄・不屈','passiveb',null,null,'Inflicts Spd/Res-4 on foe, neutralizes unit''s penalties, unit deals damage = unit''s max Special cooldown count value × 5 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by unit''s max Special cooldown count value × 3 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.','Magic Gambit 3',null,false,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Demonic Tome','Demonic Tome','Demonic Tome','SID_魔獣の書','weapon',2,null,'Effective against dragon and beast foes. Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat.','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'dragon,beast','random_owner'),
  ('Demonic Tome ATK','Demonic Tome','Demonic Tome','SID_魔獣の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against dragon and beast foes.<br><br>Enables【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】.<br><br>Allies within 2 spaces and dragon and beast allies within 6 spaces of unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>For dragon and beast allies, when Canto triggers, if ally is within 6 spaces of unit, ally can move to a space within 2 spaces of unit, even if that movement exceeds the Canto distance limit.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn (min. １; if unit used a movement skill that warped them, unit can move １ space(s)). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,'dragon,beast',null),
