  ('Diplomacy Staff','Diplomacy Staff','Diplomacy Staff','SID_軍師の諫言の杖','weapon',2,null,'Calculates damage from staff like other weapons. At start of turn, grants Atk/Def/Res+6 and the following status to unit''s support partner (if any): "If unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack." At start of turn, if at least one ally has been defeated, grants Special cooldown count-2 and the following status to unit''s support partner (if any): "Foe cannot make a follow-up attack."','Assault',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dire Breidablik','Dire Breidablik','Dire Breidablik','SID_ブレイザブリク','weapon',2,null,'Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to allies within 2 spaces during combat. Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-4 on foes within 2 spaces during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Dire Thunder','Dire Thunder','Dire Thunder','SID_ダイムサンダ','weapon',2,null,'Inflicts Spd-5. If unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice.','Thoron',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',9,'0,9,-5,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Disarm Rumor','Disarm Rumor','Disarm Rumor','SID_罠解除・流言','passiveb',null,null,'At start of turn, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Spd/Def-7 and 【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Inflicts Spd/Def-4 on foes, unit deals +15 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).<br><br>While attacking in Aether Raids, if unit ends movement on a space with a Bolt Trap or a Heavy Trap, cancels trap''s effect; if unit ends movement on a space with a Hex Trap, reduces trap''s trigger condition by 10 HP.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).','Disarm Trap 3',null,false,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Disarm Trap 1','Disarm Trap 1','Disarm Trap','SID_罠解除1','passiveb',null,null,'While attacking in Aether Raids, if unit ends movement on a space with a Bolt Trap or a Heavy Trap and that trap''s level ≤ 1, cancels trap''s effect.',null,'Disarm Trap 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Disarm Trap 2','Disarm Trap 2','Disarm Trap','SID_罠解除2','passiveb',null,null,'While attacking in Aether Raids, if unit ends movement on a space with a Bolt Trap or a Heavy Trap and that trap''s level ≤ 3, cancels trap''s effect.','Disarm Trap 1','Disarm Trap 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Disarm Trap 3','Disarm Trap 3','Disarm Trap','SID_罠解除3','passiveb',null,null,'While attacking in Aether Raids, if unit ends movement on a space with a Bolt Trap or a Heavy Trap, cancels trap''s effect.','Disarm Trap 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Disarm Trap 4','Disarm Trap 4','Disarm Trap','SID_罠解除4','passiveb',null,null,'Inflicts Spd/Def-4 on foe during combat, and if unit initiates combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. While attacking in Aether Raids, if unit ends movement on a space with a Bolt Trap or a Heavy Trap, cancels trap''s effect; if unit ends movement on a space with a Hex Trap, reduces trap''s trigger condition by 10 HP.','Disarm Trap 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Discord Bow','Discord Bow','Discord Bow','SID_不和の弓','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and 【Discord】on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat, and if【Discord】is inflicted on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).','Steel Bow','Discord Bow Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,'flying','random_owner'),
  ('Discord Bow Plus','Discord Bow+','Discord Bow+','SID_不和の弓＋','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and 【Discord】on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat, and if【Discord】is inflicted on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).','Discord Bow',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,'flying','random_owner'),
  ('Discord Bow Plus ATK','Discord Bow+','Discord Bow+','SID_不和の弓＋_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Effective against flying foes. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and 【Discord】on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat, and if【Discord】is inflicted on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',12,'2,13,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Discord Bow Plus DEF','Discord Bow+','Discord Bow+','SID_不和の弓＋_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Effective against flying foes. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and 【Discord】on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat, and if【Discord】is inflicted on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',12,'2,12,0,3,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Discord Bow Plus RES','Discord Bow+','Discord Bow+','SID_不和の弓＋_RES','weapon',2,'res','Effective against flying foes. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and 【Discord】on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat, and if【Discord】is inflicted on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',12,'2,12,0,0,3',null,'flying',null),
  ('Discord Bow Plus SPD','Discord Bow+','Discord Bow+','SID_不和の弓＋_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Effective against flying foes. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and 【Discord】on those foes through their next actions. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat, and if【Discord】is inflicted on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',12,'2,12,2,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Disguise Lance','Disguise Lance','Disguise Lance','SID_謎の闘技者の槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit or targets unit, inflicts Spd/Def-7, 【Sabotage】, and【Panic】on closest foes to both unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally after movement and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 3, + 5 (max 14), unit deals +X × 5 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X × 3 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional X × 3 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of Bonus effects active on unit and foe, excluding stat bonuses; max 5), and also, if Future Witness is active on unit or unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, unit attacks twice during combat.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
