  ('Dive-Bomb 1','Dive-Bomb 1','Dive-Bomb','SID_空からの急襲1','passiveb',null,null,'At start of combat, if both unit''s and foe''s HP = 100% and unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.',null,'Dive-Bomb 2',false,60,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dive-Bomb 2','Dive-Bomb 2','Dive-Bomb','SID_空からの急襲2','passiveb',null,null,'At start of combat, if both unit''s and foe''s HP ≥ 90% and unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.','Dive-Bomb 1','Dive-Bomb 3',false,120,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dive-Bomb 3','Dive-Bomb 3','Dive-Bomb','SID_空からの急襲3','passiveb',null,null,'At start of combat, if both unit''s and foe''s HP ≥ 80% and unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.','Dive-Bomb 2',null,false,240,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Divine Brawn','Divine Brawn','Divine Brawn','SID_神獣の逞しき肉体','passiveb',null,null,'Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Removes the condition to transform. If defending in Aether Raids, at the start of enemy turn 1, if unit can transform, unit transforms.<br><br>After start-of-turn effects trigger on player phase or enemy phase, neutralizes any 【Penalty】on unit (does not apply to【Penalty】effects that are applied at the same time).<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s Atk ≥ foe''s Atk-5, inflicts Atk/Def-7 on foe during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s Def ≥ foe''s Def-5, inflicts Atk/Def-7 on foe during combat.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Divine Breath','Divine Breath','Divine Breath','SID_神竜王のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. Effective against dragon foes. Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X during combat. (X = number of dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 2 spaces ×3. Maximum bonus of +9 to each stat.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,'dragon','random_owner'),
  ('Divine Breath ATK','Divine Breath','Divine Breath','SID_神竜王のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3. Effective against dragon foes. Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+3 to dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit and Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat. (X = number of dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit × 3. Maximum bonus of +9 to each stat.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
  ('Divine Breath DEF','Divine Breath','Divine Breath','SID_神竜王のブレス_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3. Effective against dragon foes. Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+3 to dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit and Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat. (X = number of dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit × 3. Maximum bonus of +9 to each stat.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,'dragon',null),
  ('Divine Breath RES','Divine Breath','Divine Breath','SID_神竜王のブレス_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Atk+3. Effective against dragon foes. Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+3 to dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit and Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat. (X = number of dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit × 3. Maximum bonus of +9 to each stat.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,0,0,4',null,'dragon',null),
  ('Divine Breath SKILL1','Divine Breath','Divine Breath','SID_神竜王のブレス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk+3. Effective against dragon foes. Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+3 to dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit and Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat. (X = number of dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit × 3. Maximum bonus of +9 to each stat.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 25% during combat, and also, if unit''s Atk > foe''s Res, unit''s first attack during combat deals damage = 25% of unit''s Atk minus foe''s Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,19,0,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
  ('Divine Breath SPD','Divine Breath','Divine Breath','SID_神竜王のブレス_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Atk+3. Effective against dragon foes. Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+3 to dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit and Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat. (X = number of dragon allies and allies that have "effective against dragons" within 4 spaces of unit × 3. Maximum bonus of +9 to each stat.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
  ('Divine Deceit','Divine Deceit','Divine Deceit','SID_神杖天空を偽る','passivec',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes in cardinal directions of unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts【Gravity】on those foes. At start of player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts【Ploy】and【Exposure】on those foes through their next actions. After start-of-turn effects trigger on player phase or enemy phase, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns have ≥ 3 Bonus effects active, excluding stat bonuses, neutralizes those effects (excludes Bonus effects being applied at the same time). If foe has any Penalty effects active, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Ploy】<br>Neutralizes Bonus Doubler, Treachery, and【Grand Strategy】effects active on unit during combat through unit''s next action.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Grand Strategy】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of unit''s stats × 2 for 1 turn. (Example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+14, for a net bonus of Atk+7.) Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>Unit''s negative effects that last "through unit''s next action" will remain in effect until this status (Grand Strategy) is neutralized.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Divine Draught','Divine Draught','Divine Draught','SID_喉潤す神竜の杯','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit is within 3 spaces of support partner, unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of that ally. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit is within 2 spaces of support partner, or 【Penalty】is active on foe, grants the following effects to unit during combat based on how many of those 3 conditions apply: if ≥ 2, unit attacks twice; if = 3, deals damage = 15% of the greater of unit''s Atk or foe''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Divine Fang','Divine Fang','Divine Fang','SID_神竜王の牙','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, grants "effective against dragons" to adjacent allies for 1 turn.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Divine Fang Plus','Divine Fang+','Divine Fang','SID_神竜王の牙・神','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, grants "effective against dragons" to adjacent allies for 1 turn. At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and the following status to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn: "If unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack."','Divine Fang',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Divine God Fang','Divine God Fang','Divine God Fang','SID_神竜王の大牙','passivec',null,null,'Allies within 2 spaces of unit can move to any space within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants "effective against dragons," "neutralizes ''effective against dragons'' bonuses," and 【Empathy】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Empathy】<br>Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of types of【Bonus】effects, excluding stat bonuses, and【Penalty】effects, excluding stat penalties, active on player team and enemy team during combat (max 7).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
