  ('Divine Mist SKILL1','Divine Mist','Divine Mist','SID_神霧のブレス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Effective against dragon foes. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk = 75% of total bonuses on unit''s Def and Res during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
