  ('Dracofalchion SPD','Dracofalchion','Dracofalchion','SID_竜剣ファルシオン_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Effective against dragon foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of turn, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
