  ('Draconic Poleax SKILL1','Draconic Poleax','Draconic Poleax','SID_傭兵団の戦斧_指','weapon',1,'skill1','If unit has weapon-triangle advantage, boosts Atk by 20%. If unit has weapon-triangle disadvantage, reduces Atk by 20%.<br>At start of turn, grants Res+6 to allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn. Granted only if number of that ally''s movement type on current team ≤ 2.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
