  ('Draconic Rage','Draconic Rage','Draconic Rage','SID_水の飛沫','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If the number of allies within 2 spaces (excluding unit) > the number of foes within 2 spaces (excluding target), grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Water Breath',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Draconic Rage ATK','Draconic Rage','Draconic Rage','SID_水の飛沫_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 40%. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Draconic Rage DEF','Draconic Rage','Draconic Rage','SID_水の飛沫_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 40%. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
