  ('Draconic Rage SKILL1','Draconic Rage','Draconic Rage','SID_水の飛沫_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 40%. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 and Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
