  ('Dragon Blast','Dragon Blast','Dragon Blast','SID_絆・神竜破','special',null,null,'Boosts Special damage by 50% of unit''s Spd. If unit is on a team with their support partner, when unit''s or unit''s support partner''s Special triggers (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills. If unit is within 3 spaces of their support partner and unit or foe''s Special is ready or triggered before or during this combat, reduces damage from foe''s next attack by 40% (once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Glimmer',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,3,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Dragon Bouquet','Dragon Bouquet','Dragon Bouquet','SID_竜血継ぐ花嫁の花','weapon',2,null,'Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 during combat, grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat, and also, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
