  ('Dragonbloom Plus RES','Dragonbloom+','Dragonbloom+','SID_竜石のブーケ＋_RES','weapon',1,'res','If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by X% during combat (if it is unit''s first combat initiated by unit or first combat initiated by foe that turn, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40; "first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes). If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',14,'5,14,0,0,4',null,null,null),
