  ('Dragons Ire 4','Dragon''s Ire 4','Dragon''s Ire','SID_竜の逆鱗4','passiveb',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-4 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and also, if foe initiates combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks.','Dragons Ire 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dragons Roar','Dragon''s Roar','Dragon''s Roar','SID_竜の咆哮','special',null,null,'Boosts Special damage by 40% of unit''s Res when Special triggers. If unit''s or foe''s Special is ready, or if unit''s or foe''s Special triggered before or during this combat, and also, if unit''s Res ≥ foe''s Res-4 during combat, reduces damage from foe''s next attack by 40% (once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Iceberg',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',null,null,3,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Dragons Scales','Dragon''s Scales','Dragon''s Scales','SID_竜の堅鱗','passiveb',null,null,'If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-X on foe (X = 4 + the greater of the difference between Def stats or difference between Res stats (unit''s Def/Res minus foe''s Def/Res); max 11; if either of unit''s stats < foe''s stat, difference is treated as 0), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before foe''s first attack, and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Dragons Ire 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base'),
  ('Dragons Stone','Dragon''s Stone','Dragon''s Stone','SID_辰年の御子の竜石','weapon',1,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Fire Breath Plus','Dragons Stone Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,null),
