  ('Dragoon Axe','Dragoon Axe','Dragoon Axe','SID_赤い竜騎士の斧','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if foe''s HP = 100%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Dragoon Axe ATK','Dragoon Axe','Dragoon Axe','SID_赤い竜騎士の斧_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Dragoon Axe DEF','Dragoon Axe','Dragoon Axe','SID_赤い竜騎士の斧_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Dragoon Axe RES','Dragoon Axe','Dragoon Axe','SID_赤い竜騎士の斧_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Dragoon Axe SKILL1','Dragoon Axe','Dragoon Axe','SID_赤い竜騎士の斧_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and the following status to unit and allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn: "Grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)." If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Dragoon Axe SPD','Dragoon Axe','Dragoon Axe','SID_赤い竜騎士の斧_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Dragoon Pillar','Dragoon Pillar','Dragoon Pillar','SID_真・赤い竜騎士','passivea',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Atk Liberate】,【Spd Liberate】, and "neutralizes ''effective against flying'' bonuses" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+9 to unit, unit deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown count-X to unit before unit''s first attack and before unit''s first follow-up attack during combat (X = number of staff and flying allies on the map, including unit; max 3). Restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Atk Liberate】<br>Grants bonus to Atk during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, + 4 (max 8).<br><br>【Spd Liberate】<br>Grants bonus to Spd during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, + 4 (max 8).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dragoon Shield','Dragoon Shield','Dragoon Shield','SID_赤い竜騎士の盾','passivea',null,null,'Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. Grants Atk/Spd/Def+3.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,3,3,3,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Draw Back','Draw Back','Draw Back','SID_引き寄せ','assist',1,null,'Unit moves 1 space away from target ally. Ally moves to unit''s previous space.',null,null,false,150,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,null,null,'random_all,random_inherit_base'),
  ('Draw Back Gait','Draw Back Gait','Draw Back Gait','SID_引き寄せ・歩法','assist',1,null,'Unit moves 1 space away from target ally. Ally moves to unit''s previous space.<br><br>If unit uses an Assist skill on the current turn, enables【Canto (１)】.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Draw Back',null,false,400,'Infantry,  Armored',null,null,null,null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dream Deliverer','Dream Deliverer','Dream Deliverer','SID_人に安らかな夢を','passivec',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, neutralizes any 【Penalty】that takes effect on unit or allies within 2 spaces of unit at this time. At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Def/Res+6 and【Resonance: Shields】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Def/Res+4 to unit and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br><br>【Resonance: Shields】<br>Grants Def/Res+4 during combat and the following effect for 1 turn: "During unit''s first combat in player phase or enemy phase, foe cannot make a follow-up attack."',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dream Deliverer Plus','Dream Deliverer+','Dream Deliverer','SID_人に安らかな…・神','passivec',null,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, neutralizes any【Penalty】that takes effect on unit or allies within 2 spaces of unit at this time.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Def/Res+6,【Fringe Bonus】,【Imbue】, and 【Resonance: Shields】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br><br>【Fringe Bonus】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest bonus on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Imbue】<br>Reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and restores 40% of unit''s maximum HP as unit''s combat begins for 1 turn (triggers after effects that deal damage as combat begins; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Resonance: Shields】<br>Grants Def/Res+4 during combat and the following effect for 1 turn: "During unit''s first combat in player phase or enemy phase, foe cannot make a follow-up attack."<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Dream Deliverer',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dream Horn','Dream Horn','Dream Horn','SID_夢の王の角','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe (X = 50% of highest total bonuses among unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit +6), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by 30%. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.','Adult Cavalry',null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dream Horn ATK','Dream Horn','Dream Horn','SID_夢の王の角_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe (X = 50% of highest total bonuses among unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit + 6), unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by 40%.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, inflicts Atk/Def-Y on foe during combat (Y = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if Y ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Dream Horn DEF','Dream Horn','Dream Horn','SID_夢の王の角_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe (X = 50% of highest total bonuses among unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit + 6), unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by 40%.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, inflicts Atk/Def-Y on foe during combat (Y = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if Y ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Dream Horn RES','Dream Horn','Dream Horn','SID_夢の王の角_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe (X = 50% of highest total bonuses among unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit + 6), unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by 40%.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, inflicts Atk/Def-Y on foe during combat (Y = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if Y ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Dream Horn SKILL1','Dream Horn','Dream Horn','SID_夢の王の角_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe (X = 50% of highest total bonuses among unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit + 6), unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by 40%.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, inflicts Atk/Def-Y on foe during combat (Y = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if Y ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.<br>For unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5, neutralizes penalties, and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit or ally before foe''s first attack during combat.<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Dream Horn SPD','Dream Horn','Dream Horn','SID_夢の王の角_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe (X = 50% of highest total bonuses among unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit + 6), unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by 40%.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, inflicts Atk/Def-Y on foe during combat (Y = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if Y ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Dreamflake','Dreamflake','Dreamflake','SID_白き夢のかけら','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3. If【Penalty】is active on any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk-5 on those foes during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Silver Dagger',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Dreaming Spear','Dreaming Spear','Dreaming Spear','SID_夢想の翼槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5. If unit is on a team with two allies in a support-partner pair (excluding unit), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,21,5,5,5',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Dreamlike Night','Dreamlike Night','Dreamlike Night','SID_あまいよるのゆめ','assist',1,null,'Grants another action to target ally, and if Canto has already been triggered by target ally, re-enables Canto. Inflicts Atk/Def/Res-7, 【Frozen】, and【Sabotage】on closest foes to target ally and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions (cannot target an ally with Sing or Dance; this skill treated as Sing or Dance).<br><br>【Frozen】<br>Reduces inflicted unit''s follow-up ability and increases foe''s follow-up ability through unit''s next action:<br><br>Increases Spd difference necessary for unit to make a follow-up attack by X and decreases Spd difference necessary for foe to make a follow-up attack by X during combat (if foe''s Def > unit''s Def, X = 10 + difference between Def stats × 2; otherwise, X = 10). (For example, if Spd difference necessary increases by 10, Spd must be ≥ 15 more than foe''s Spd to make a follow-up attack; stacks with similar skills.)<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.','Dance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,null,null,'random_owner'),
