  ('Earthfire Boost 3','Earthfire Boost 3','Earthfire Boost','SID_生命の業火大地3','passivea',null,null,'Grants HP+5. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Def+7 to unit during combat, and also, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally with HP ≥ 50%, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).','Fire Boost 3;Earth Boost 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'5,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Earthly Gae Bolg','Earthly Gáe Bolg','Earthly Gáe Bolg','SID_地槍ゲイボルグ','weapon',1,null,'Grants Def+3. In combat against an infantry, armored, or cavalry foe, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,3,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Earthly Gae Bolg ATK','Earthly Gáe Bolg','Earthly Gáe Bolg','SID_地槍ゲイボルグ_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Def+3. In combat against an infantry, armored, or cavalry foe, or if unit''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.), and deals damage = 10% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials) during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,18,0,3,0',null,null,null),
