  ('Earthly Gae Bolg SKILL1','Earthly Gáe Bolg','Earthly Gáe Bolg','SID_地槍ゲイボルグ_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Def+3. In combat against an infantry, armored, or cavalry foe, or if unit''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.), and deals damage = 10% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials) during combat.<br>If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Def during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,3,0',null,null,null),
