  ('Edged Scales','Edged Scales','Edged Scales','SID_竜の鋭鱗','passiveb',null,null,'If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, inflicts Spd/Def/Res-4 on foe, deals damage = 15% of foe''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 10 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and increases the Spd difference necessary for foe to make a follow-up attack by 10 during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.','Dragons Wrath 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
