  ('Even Recovery 1','Even Recovery 1','Even Recovery','SID_快癒・偶数1','passivec',null,null,'At start of even-numbered turns, restores 5 HP to allies within 2 spaces of unit and neutralizes any【Penalty】on those allies (excluding penalties inflicted at start of turn).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,'Even Recovery 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
