  ('Execution Breath','Execution Breath','Execution Breath','SID_理の蛇毒・呼吸','passiveb',null,null,'If unit initiates combat, deals 7 damage to foe as combat begins (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1), inflicts Spd/Def-4 on foe, deals damage = 20% of the greater of foe''s Spd or Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and foe cannot recover HP during or after combat.','Poison Strike 3',null,false,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
