  ('Exotic Fruit Juice RES','Exotic Fruit Juice','Exotic Fruit Juice','SID_楽園の果汁_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Atk+3. Inflicts Spd/Res-6 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) and unit deals damage = 15% of foe''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Exotic Fruit Juice SKILL1','Exotic Fruit Juice','Exotic Fruit Juice','SID_楽園の果汁_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Atk+3. Inflicts Spd/Res-6 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) and unit deals damage = 15% of foe''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 5 spaces of a foe, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Hexblade】to unit and allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of turn, inflicts Spd/Res-7 and status preventing counterattacks on nearest foes within 5 spaces of unit and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Spd/Res-5 on foe, and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>【Hexblade】<br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res during combat for 1 turn (including damage dealt by Specials before combat).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
