  ('Expiration SKILL1','Expiration','Expiration','SID_邪竜のブレス_消','weapon',1,'skill1','Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
