  ('Fair-Fury Axe SKILL1','Fair-Fury Axe','Fair-Fury Axe','SID_荒ぶる女子力の斧_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk.<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6,【Desperation】, and "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 10% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Desperation】<br>Grants the following effect for 1 turn: "If unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack."',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Fair-Fury Axe SPD','Fair-Fury Axe','Fair-Fury Axe','SID_荒ぶる女子力の斧_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Faith in Humanity','Faith in Humanity','Faith in Humanity','SID_人の可能性を信じる','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of allies other than dragon or beast allies, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit and those allies for 1 turn. If 2 or more allies on your current team other than dragon or beast allies have total bonuses ≥ 10 (excluding unit), neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
