  ('Faithful Breath','Faithful Breath','Faithful Breath','SID_神舞のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. If Sing or Dance is used, inflicts Def/Res-6 on nearest foes within 4 spaces of both unit and target ally through their next actions. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 40%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and also, if unit initiates combat and has weapon-triangle advantage or【Penalty】is active on foe, foe cannot counterattack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Faithful Breath ATK','Faithful Breath','Faithful Breath','SID_神舞のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If Sing or Dance is used, inflicts Def/Res-7, 【Exposure】, and【Panic】on closest foes to unit and target ally and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 10% of unit''s Spd at start of combat and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit has weapon-triangle advantage or Penalty is active on foe, foe cannot counterattack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Faithful Breath DEF','Faithful Breath','Faithful Breath','SID_神舞のブレス_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If Sing or Dance is used, inflicts Def/Res-7, 【Exposure】, and【Panic】on closest foes to unit and target ally and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 10% of unit''s Spd at start of combat and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit has weapon-triangle advantage or Penalty is active on foe, foe cannot counterattack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Faithful Breath RES','Faithful Breath','Faithful Breath','SID_神舞のブレス_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If Sing or Dance is used, inflicts Def/Res-7, 【Exposure】, and【Panic】on closest foes to unit and target ally and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 10% of unit''s Spd at start of combat and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit has weapon-triangle advantage or Penalty is active on foe, foe cannot counterattack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Faithful Breath SKILL1','Faithful Breath','Faithful Breath','SID_神舞のブレス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If Sing or Dance is used, inflicts Def/Res-7, 【Exposure】, and【Panic】on closest foes to unit and target ally and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 10% of unit''s Spd at start of combat and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit has weapon-triangle advantage or Penalty is active on foe, foe cannot counterattack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.<br>Enables【Canto (Rem. +1; Min ２)】.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, unit deals +X × 5 damage (max 25; excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of Bonus effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses + number of Penalty effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (Rem. +1; Min ２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn +1 (min ２; if unit used a movement skill that warped them, unit can move ２ space(s)). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,19,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Faithful Breath SPD','Faithful Breath','Faithful Breath','SID_神舞のブレス_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If Sing or Dance is used, inflicts Def/Res-7, 【Exposure】, and【Panic】on closest foes to unit and target ally and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 10% of unit''s Spd at start of combat and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit has weapon-triangle advantage or Penalty is active on foe, foe cannot counterattack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Faithful Loyalty','Faithful Loyalty','Faithful Loyalty','SID_信じつづける誓い','passiveb',null,null,'If armored or cavalry foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack. Neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. After combat, grants 【Vantage】to unit.<br><br>【Vantage】<br>If foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack for 1 turn.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Faithful Loyalty II','Faithful Loyalty II','Faithful Loyalty','SID_信じつづける…・承','passiveb',null,null,'If armored or cavalry foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def-5 on foe and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if foe is armored or cavalry, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X (including from area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials; X = highest total bonuses among unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit), and if foe is not armored or cavalry, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% of X during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).<br><br>After combat, restores 7 HP to unit and grants【Vantage】to unit for 1 turn.<br><br>【Vantage】<br>If foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack for 1 turn.','Faithful Loyalty',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
