  ('Fanged Basilikos ATK','Fanged Basilikos','Fanged Basilikos','SID_狂牙バシリコス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
