  ('Fierce Beast','Fierce Beast','Fierce Beast','SID_猛獣','special',null,null,'Boosts Special damage by X% of unit''s Atk when Special triggers (if transformed, X = 25; otherwise, X = 20). If Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from non-Special skills.','Dragon Fang',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,2,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
