  ('Fiery Bolganone','Fiery Bolganone','Fiery Bolganone','SID_嘲謔ボルガノン','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3. At start of turn, if unit is within 4 spaces of a foe, grants【Dominance】 to unit and inflicts Atk/Res-6 on nearest foes through their next actions. If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Dominance】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total penalties on foe for 1 turn.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Fiery Bolganone ATK','Fiery Bolganone','Fiery Bolganone','SID_嘲謔ボルガノン_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Res+3 to unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Dominance】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Panic】, and【Res Shackle】 on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Dominance】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total penalties on foe for 1 turn.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Fiery Bolganone DEF','Fiery Bolganone','Fiery Bolganone','SID_嘲謔ボルガノン_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Res+3 to unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Dominance】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Panic】, and【Res Shackle】 on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Dominance】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total penalties on foe for 1 turn.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,3',null,null,null),
