  ('Fiery Bolganone SKILL1','Fiery Bolganone','Fiery Bolganone','SID_嘲謔ボルガノン_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Res+3 to unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Dominance】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Panic】, and【Res Shackle】 on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Dominance】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total penalties on foe for 1 turn.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+10 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Fiery Bolganone SPD','Fiery Bolganone','Fiery Bolganone','SID_嘲謔ボルガノン_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Res+3 to unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Dominance】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Panic】, and【Res Shackle】 on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Dominance】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total penalties on foe for 1 turn.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Fiery Fang','Fiery Fang','Fiery Fang','SID_炎虎の爪牙','weapon',1,null,'Grants Def+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Def+6 to unit during combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Def during combat = 20% of unit''s Def at start of combat, and foe cannot make a follow-up attack. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.','Adult Infantry',null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Fiery War Sword','Fiery War Sword','Fiery War Sword','SID_戦神の烈剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses × 3, + 5; max 17), neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr Morn','Fimbulvetr Morn','Fimbulvetr Morn','SID_造物フィンブル','weapon',2,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr Morn ATK','Fimbulvetr Morn','Fimbulvetr Morn','SID_造物フィンブル_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr Morn DEF','Fimbulvetr Morn','Fimbulvetr Morn','SID_造物フィンブル_DEF','weapon',2,'def','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr Morn RES','Fimbulvetr Morn','Fimbulvetr Morn','SID_造物フィンブル_RES','weapon',2,'res','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr Morn SKILL1','Fimbulvetr Morn','Fimbulvetr Morn','SID_造物フィンブル_一','weapon',2,'skill1','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+6,【Essence Drain】, and 【Bonus Doubler】to unit and target allies for 1 turn (if support partner is on player team, targets any support partner within 2 spaces of unit; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Atk within 2 spaces of unit).<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Essence Drain】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, grants any 【Bonus】effects active on target and foes within 2 spaces of target to unit and allies with the Essence Drain effect, and neutralizes any【Bonus】active on target and foes within 2 spaces of target (excluding Bonus effects being granted at the same time). After combat, if foe was defeated in combat, restores 10 HP to unit and allies with the Essence Drain effect.<br><br>【Bonus Doubler】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of unit''s stats for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr Morn SPD','Fimbulvetr Morn','Fimbulvetr Morn','SID_造物フィンブル_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr weapon','Fimbulvetr','Fimbulvetr','SID_フィンブル','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if【Penalty】 is active on unit or if unit''s HP < 100%, neutralizes penalties on unit and grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Thoron',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Fimbulvetr weapon ATK','Fimbulvetr','Fimbulvetr','SID_フィンブル_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if【Penalty】 is active on unit, unit''s HP ≤ 99%, or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes unit''s penalties during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr weapon DEF','Fimbulvetr','Fimbulvetr','SID_フィンブル_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if【Penalty】 is active on unit, unit''s HP ≤ 99%, or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes unit''s penalties during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,3',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr weapon RES','Fimbulvetr','Fimbulvetr','SID_フィンブル_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if【Penalty】 is active on unit, unit''s HP ≤ 99%, or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes unit''s penalties during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,6',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr weapon SKILL1','Fimbulvetr','Fimbulvetr','SID_フィンブル_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if【Penalty】 is active on unit, unit''s HP ≤ 99%, or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes unit''s penalties during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and inflicts Atk/Res-X on foe during combat (X = 10 - foe''s max Special cooldown count value × 2; min 2; if foe does not have a Special skill, penalty = 2). If unit is within 3 spaces of support partner, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Fimbulvetr weapon SPD','Fimbulvetr','Fimbulvetr','SID_フィンブル_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if【Penalty】 is active on unit, unit''s HP ≤ 99%, or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes unit''s penalties during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Final Say','Final Say','Final Say','SID_傷をつけたわね','passivea',null,null,'Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+9.<br><br>Unit can move through foes'' spaces.<br><br>Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of any ally within 2 spaces or any ally within 5 spaces that has entered combat or used an Assist skill during the current turn.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Creation Pulse】and【Anathema】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit''s Res > foe''s Res or unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, unit attacks twice during combat.<br><br>Unit deals damage during combat = number of times unit has attacked in the current combat × 5 (excluding area-of-effect Specials; including current attack).<br><br>If unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP (once per combat; does not stack with non-Special effects that allow unit to survive with 1 HP if foe''s attack would reduce HP to 0).<br><br>【Creation Pulse】<br>If unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-X before unit''s first attack during combat (X = number of Penalty effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties; max 2).<br>(For 1 turn.)<br><br>【Anathema】<br>Inflicts Spd/Def/Res-4 on foes within 3 spaces of unit during combat.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,9,9,9,9',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Final Sword','Final Sword','Final Sword','SID_終着の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Def+6,【Imbue】, and【Reflex】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants Atk+X to unit, inflicts Atk-X on foe (X = 20% of unit''s Def at start of combat, + 6), unit deals +Y damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by Y (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by Y (excluding area-of-effect Specials; if foe''s HP ≥ 70% at start of combat, Y = 16; otherwise Y = 10), and neutralizes【Deep Wounds】during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Imbue】<br>Reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and restores 40% of unit''s maximum HP as unit''s combat begins for 1 turn (triggers after effects that deal damage as combat begins; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Reflex】<br>Reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes) and unit''s next attack deals damage = total damage reduced from foe''s first attack (by any source, including other skills; resets at end of combat). (For 1 turn.)<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
