  ('Firelight Lance','Firelight Lance','Firelight Lance','SID_炎と風舞う霊槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, deals damage = 15% of foe''s Atk, and also, if unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd-4, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.) At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit and allies within 4 spaces of unit after combat.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Firemans Hook','Fireman''s Hook','Fireman''s Hook','SID_火消しの暗刃','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and grants unit Special cooldown charge +1 per unit''s attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Silver Dagger',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Firemans Hook ATK','Fireman''s Hook','Fireman''s Hook','SID_火消しの暗刃_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>When unit is in combat, foes'' Savior effects will not trigger.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Firemans Hook DEF','Fireman''s Hook','Fireman''s Hook','SID_火消しの暗刃_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>When unit is in combat, foes'' Savior effects will not trigger.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Firemans Hook RES','Fireman''s Hook','Fireman''s Hook','SID_火消しの暗刃_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>When unit is in combat, foes'' Savior effects will not trigger.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,null),
  ('Firemans Hook SKILL1','Fireman''s Hook','Fireman''s Hook','SID_火消しの暗刃_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>When unit is in combat, foes'' Savior effects will not trigger.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.<br>For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, foe suffers +10 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and foe cannot counterattack during combat.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and unit deals +20 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
