  ('Flame Wall','Flame Wall','Flame Wall','SID_壁炎','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by 70% of unit''s Def when Special triggers.<br><br>If unit''s or foe''s Special is ready, or unit''s or foe''s Special triggered before or during this combat, and also, if unit''s Def ≥ foe''s Def-10, reduces damage from foe''s next attack by 40% (once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Ignis',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,4,null,'offensive_special,random_owner'),
  ('Flamefrost Bow','Flamefrost Bow','Flamefrost Bow','SID_炎と氷の王女の輝弓','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. Grants Def/Res+5 and inflicts Spd-8 on unit. Unit attacks twice. (Even if foe initiates combat, unit attacks twice.) Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Def/Res during combat = 70% of the highest value between the total bonuses of target and the total bonuses of an ally within 2 spaces of unit.','Silver Bow',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',8,'0,8,-8,5,5',-1,'flying',null),
  ('Flamelick Breath','Flamelick Breath','Flamelick Breath','SID_絶炎のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Deep Wounds】on target and foes within 2 spaces of target. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Flamelick Breath ATK','Flamelick Breath','Flamelick Breath','SID_絶炎のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Enables Canto (Rem. +1; Min 2).<br>Grants Atk+3. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Deep Wounds on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat, deals 7 damage to foe as combat begins (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1), and also, if unit attacked, applies【Divine Vein (Flame)】on 5 spaces in a line centered on foe''s space and on the 5 spaces behind those spaces (oriented left to right based on the direction unit is facing) for 1 turn after combat.<br><br>【Divine Vein (Flame)】<br>Applies the following effects on space: Acts as difficult terrain for foes with Range = 2 (moving over this space costs +1 movement; does not apply to "cannot be slowed by terrain" effects; movement cost cannot exceed unit''s allowed movement). At start of enemy phase, deals 7 damage to foe, and also, as combat begins, deals an additional 7 damage to foe (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Flamelick Breath DEF','Flamelick Breath','Flamelick Breath','SID_絶炎のブレス_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Enables Canto (Rem. +1; Min 2).<br>Grants Atk+3. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Deep Wounds on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat, deals 7 damage to foe as combat begins (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1), and also, if unit attacked, applies【Divine Vein (Flame)】on 5 spaces in a line centered on foe''s space and on the 5 spaces behind those spaces (oriented left to right based on the direction unit is facing) for 1 turn after combat.<br><br>【Divine Vein (Flame)】<br>Applies the following effects on space: Acts as difficult terrain for foes with Range = 2 (moving over this space costs +1 movement; does not apply to "cannot be slowed by terrain" effects; movement cost cannot exceed unit''s allowed movement). At start of enemy phase, deals 7 damage to foe, and also, as combat begins, deals an additional 7 damage to foe (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
