  ('Flower of Caring','Flower of Caring','Flower of Caring','SID_親愛の花','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). For allies in cardinal directions of unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 to ally during their combat and restores 5 HP to ally after their combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 40%, and restores 5 HP to unit after combat, and also, if an ally is in a cardinal direction of unit, grants an additional Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Flower of Ease','Flower of Ease','Flower of Ease','SID_微睡の花の剣','weapon',1,null,'Grants Res+3. If【Penalty】is active on any foes within 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-3 on those foes during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,'random_owner'),
