  ('Flower of Sorrow','Flower of Sorrow','Flower of Sorrow','SID_不幸の花','weapon',2,null,'Grants Atk+3. Inflicts Def/Res-4 on any foe in a cardinal direction from unit during that foe''s combat.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Flower of Sorrow ATK','Flower of Sorrow','Flower of Sorrow','SID_不幸の花_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Atk+3. Inflicts Def/Res-5 on foes in cardinal directions of unit during their combat. If foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat or if another foe is within 2 spaces of that foe, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-4 on foe during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Flower of Sorrow DEF','Flower of Sorrow','Flower of Sorrow','SID_不幸の花_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Atk+3. Inflicts Def/Res-5 on foes in cardinal directions of unit during their combat. If foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat or if another foe is within 2 spaces of that foe, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-4 on foe during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Flower of Sorrow RES','Flower of Sorrow','Flower of Sorrow','SID_不幸の花_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Atk+3. Inflicts Def/Res-5 on foes in cardinal directions of unit during their combat. If foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat or if another foe is within 2 spaces of that foe, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-4 on foe during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Flower of Sorrow SKILL1','Flower of Sorrow','Flower of Sorrow','SID_不幸の花_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Atk+3. Inflicts Def/Res-5 on foes in cardinal directions of unit during their combat. If foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat or if another foe is within 2 spaces of that foe, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-4 on foe during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-4 on foe and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and also, after combat, if unit attacked, deals 10 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Flower of Sorrow SPD','Flower of Sorrow','Flower of Sorrow','SID_不幸の花_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Atk+3. Inflicts Def/Res-5 on foes in cardinal directions of unit during their combat. If foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat or if another foe is within 2 spaces of that foe, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-4 on foe during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Flower of Tribute','Flower of Tribute','Flower of Tribute','SID_犠牲の花','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, deals 5 damage to foe as their combat begins (effects that reduce damage during combat do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1) and inflicts Spd/Def-5 on foe during their combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Flowery Scroll','Flowery Scroll','Flowery Scroll','SID_艶花忍法帳','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Grants Def/Res+5 and inflicts Spd-8 on unit. Unit attacks twice. (Even if foe initiates combat, unit attacks twice.) If foe initiates combat and unit''s Res > foe''s Res, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',8,'0,8,-8,5,5',-1,null,null),
  ('Flowing Lance','Flowing Lance','Flowing Lance','SID_風見鶏の槍','weapon',1,null,'If unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.','Steel Lance','Flowing Lance Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,null),
