  ('Folkvangr SKILL1','Fólkvangr','Fólkvangr','SID_フォルクヴァング_相','weapon',1,'skill1','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 80%, grants Atk/Def+7 during combat.<br>If unit has weapon-triangle advantage, boosts Atk by 20%. If unit has weapon-triangle disadvantage, reduces Atk by 20%.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
