  ('Gae Bolg SKILL1','Gáe Bolg','Gáe Bolg','SID_ゲイボルグ_騎','weapon',1,'skill1','In combat against an infantry, armored, or cavalry foe, grants Atk/Def+5 during combat.<br>If there is a sword, lance, axe, or cavalry ally on your team (excluding unit), grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat. Grants Atk/Def+5 to sword, lance, axe, and cavalry allies within 3 spaces of unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
