  ('Geyser Dance 2','Geyser Dance 2','Geyser Dance','SID_大地静水の舞い2','passiveb',null,null,'If Sing or Dance is used, grants Def/Res+4 to target.','Geyser Dance 1',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Ghostly Lanterns','Ghostly Lanterns','Ghostly Lanterns','SID_赤と青の奇なる鬼火','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk+6 to unit and inflicts Atk-6 on foe during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and also, if foe''s attack can trigger their Special and unit''s Res ≥ foe''s Res+5 during combat, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe before foe''s first attack. (Cannot exceed the foe''s maximum Special cooldown.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Giant Shuriken','Giant Shuriken','Giant Shuriken','SID_大手裏剣','weapon',2,null,'If unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge+X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge-X" on unit during combat.<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ５】<br><br>【Dagger ５】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-５ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Steel Dagger','Giant Shuriken Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',4,'0,4,0,0,0',null,null,null),
