  ('Glitnir','Glitnir','Glitnir','SID_グリトニル','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. If unit initiates combat and foe uses sword, lance, axe, dragonstone, or beast damage, grants Atk+6 during combat, and if unit initiates combat against a foe that can counter, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'enemy_only'),
  ('Glitter of Light','Glitter of Light','Glitter of Light','SID_輝映の聖光','special',null,null,'If an Assist skill is used, unit''s Special cooldown count does not go down. When Special triggers, boosts damage by 45% of foe''s Res (calculates damage from staff after combat damage is added). If this Special is triggered during combat, after combat, inflicts status on target and foes within 2 spaces of target preventing counterattacks through their next actions.','Miracle',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',null,null,3,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Glittering Anima','Glittering Anima','Glittering Anima','SID_煌めく理力','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6,【Canto (１)】, and the following status to unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn: "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat." At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Spd/Res-6,【Panic】, and【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 3 spaces of those foes through their next actions. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Glittering Breath','Glittering Breath','Glittering Breath','SID_綺羅星のブレス','weapon',1,null,'During combat, boosts unit''s Def/Res by number of allies within 2 spaces × 2. (Maximum bonus of +6 to each stat.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Fire Breath Plus','Glittering Breath Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,null),
