  ('Gloom Breath RES','Gloom Breath','Gloom Breath','SID_冥輝のブレス_RES','weapon',1,'res','At start of turn, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 on foes within 2 spaces through their next actions. After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Gloom Breath SKILL1','Gloom Breath','Gloom Breath','SID_冥輝のブレス_強','weapon',1,'skill1','At start of turn, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 on foes within 2 spaces through their next actions. After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of target''s stats. Calculates each stat bonus independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
