  ('Gray Illusion','Gray Illusion','Gray Illusion','SID_鈍色の迷夢','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Def/Res+9 to unit during combat, and if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, foe cannot counterattack. If unit initiates combat, after combat, inflicts the following status on foes with the highest Spd within 3 spaces of target foe (excluding target) through their next actions: "after start-of-turn skills trigger, action ends immediately" (for foes who have not yet taken an action in Summoner Duels, instead of inflicting this effect, ends their action immediately).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Gray Waves','Gray Waves','Gray Waves','SID_ユラリユルレリ','assist',1,null,'Grants another action to target ally, and if target is an infantry or flying ally, target can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack. Cannot target an ally with Sing or Dance. This skill treated as Sing or Dance.)','Sing',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Gray Waves II','Gray Waves II','Gray Waves II','SID_ユラリユルレリ・承','assist',1,null,'Grants another action to target ally, and if target is an infantry or flying ally, grants 【Null Panic】to target and target can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack. Cannot target an ally with Sing or Dance. This skill treated as Sing or Dance.)<br><br>【Null Panic】<br>If unit is inflicted with Panic (bonuses converted into penalties), neutralizes the "converts bonuses on target into penalties" effect for 1 turn. (Even though the effect is neutralized, the Panic status remains, and is treated as a Penalty status.)','Gray Waves',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('Great Aether','Great Aether','Great Aether','SID_覇克・天空','special',null,null,'When Special triggers, boosts damage by percentage of unit''s Atk = number of times foe has attacked during this combat × 10, + 40. If unit initiates combat, foe can counterattack before unit''s first attack. If foe can perform a follow-up attack, foe can make a follow-up attack before unit''s next attack during combat. Reduces damage from attacks by percentage = 40, - current Special cooldown count value × 10 during combat, but if unit receives consecutive attacks, reduces damage from foe''s second attack onward by percentage = 70, - current Special cooldown count value × 10. If this Special is triggered during combat, deals 5 damage to foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 (cannot exceed the foe''s maximum Special cooldown) on those foes, and restores X HP to unit after combat (X = number of foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 5, + 10; max: 50% of unit''s max HP).','Sol;Luna',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,4,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Great Flame','Great Flame','Great Flame','SID_神炎のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. If unit''s Def ≥ foe''s Def+5, foe cannot make a follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Great Flame ATK','Great Flame','Great Flame','SID_神炎のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3. If unit''s Def ≥ foe''s Def+1, foe cannot make a follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Great Flame DEF','Great Flame','Great Flame','SID_神炎のブレス_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3. If unit''s Def ≥ foe''s Def+1, foe cannot make a follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
