  ('Grim Brokkr','Grim Brokkr','Grim Brokkr','SID_魔銃ブロック','weapon',2,null,'Grants Atk+3. Enables【Canto (２)】during turns 1 through 4. If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Grim Brokkr ATK','Grim Brokkr','Grim Brokkr','SID_魔銃ブロック_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Enables Canto (2) during turns 1 through 4.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-5 on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Grim Brokkr DEF','Grim Brokkr','Grim Brokkr','SID_魔銃ブロック_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Enables Canto (2) during turns 1 through 4.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-5 on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Grim Brokkr RES','Grim Brokkr','Grim Brokkr','SID_魔銃ブロック_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Enables Canto (2) during turns 1 through 4.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-5 on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Grim Brokkr SKILL1','Grim Brokkr','Grim Brokkr','SID_魔銃ブロック_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Enables Canto (2) during turns 1 through 4.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-5 on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-7,【Sabotage】,and【Schism】 on closest foes and any foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Res during combat = 5 + number of foes within 3 spaces of target (including target), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X during combat, and also, when foe''s attack triggers foe''s Special, reduces damage by X (X = 3 × the total of the number of Bonus effects active on unit and the number of Penalty effects active on foe, excluding stat bonuses and stat penalties; max 12; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br><br>【Schism】<br>Neutralizes Triangle Attack, Dual Strike, and Pathfinder effects active on unit through unit''s next action. Unit is excluded from ally Triangle Attack and Dual Strike effects calculated using numbers of allies. When this status (Schism) is neutralized, Triangle Attack, Dual Strike, and Pathfinder effects are also neutralized.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Grim Brokkr SPD','Grim Brokkr','Grim Brokkr','SID_魔銃ブロック_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Enables Canto (2) during turns 1 through 4.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, inflicts Atk/Res-6 and Spd-5 on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Grimas Truth','Grima''s Truth','Grima''s Truth','SID_魔書ギムレー','weapon',2,null,'Grants Def+3. After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Atk/Spd-5 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions, and grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit and allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn.','Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,3,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Grimas Truth ATK','Grima''s Truth','Grima''s Truth','SID_魔書ギムレー_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Def+3. At start of turn, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-5 on nearest foes within 4 spaces through their next actions and grants Atk/Spd/Res+5 to unit for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Grimas Truth DEF','Grima''s Truth','Grima''s Truth','SID_魔書ギムレー_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Def+3. At start of turn, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-5 on nearest foes within 4 spaces through their next actions and grants Atk/Spd/Res+5 to unit for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,6,0',null,null,null),
  ('Grimas Truth RES','Grima''s Truth','Grima''s Truth','SID_魔書ギムレー_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Def+3. At start of turn, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-5 on nearest foes within 4 spaces through their next actions and grants Atk/Spd/Res+5 to unit for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,3',null,null,null),
  ('Grimas Truth SKILL1','Grima''s Truth','Grima''s Truth','SID_魔書ギムレー_弱','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Def+3. At start of turn, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-5 on nearest foes within 4 spaces through their next actions and grants Atk/Spd/Res+5 to unit for 1 turn.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = 4 + any current penalty on each of those stats. (Example: if foe has -7 penalty to Atk, inflicts Atk-11, for a net penalty of Atk-18 during combat.) Calculates each stat bonus independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Grimas Truth SPD','Grima''s Truth','Grima''s Truth','SID_魔書ギムレー_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Def+3. At start of turn, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-5 on nearest foes within 4 spaces through their next actions and grants Atk/Spd/Res+5 to unit for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Grimleal Text','Grimleal Text','Grimleal Text','SID_禁書ギムレー','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3. At start of turn, inflicts Def/Res-6,【Panic】, and【Discord】on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit with Res < unit''s Res through their next actions. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and unit deals +X damage (X = total number of【Penalty】 effects active on foe and any foe within 2 spaces of foe, excluding stat penalties, × 4; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Grimoire','Grimoire','Grimoire','SID_グリモワール','weapon',2,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 50%, unit can move to a space adjacent to an ally within 2 spaces.','Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
