  ('Guardian','Guardian','Guardian','SID_ガーディアン','assist',2,null,'This skill is treated as a Rally Assist skill.<br><br>Restores 8 HP to target ally, grants Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and target ally for 1 turn, and also, when there is no ally on the map with【Physical Twin Save】(including unit and target ally), grants【Physical Twin Save】 to target ally for 1 turn. (Using this skill has no effect on Special cooldown charge and unit does not gain EXP or SP.)<br><br>【Physical Twin Save】<br>If a sword, lance, axe, bow, dagger, or beast foe initiates combat against an ally within 2 spaces of unit, triggers Savior on unit (triggers only if unit is not equipped with a skill that can trigger another Savior effect; if unit is granted multiple statuses that enable "Savior" effects to trigger, Savior will not trigger).<br><br>If foe uses sword, lance, axe, bow, dagger, or beast damage, disables foe''s effects that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" (including area-of-effect Specials), and any "reduces damage by X%" effect that can be triggered only once per combat by unit''s equipped Special skill can be triggered up to twice per combat during combat (excludes boosted Special effects from engaging; only highest value applied; does not stack).','Mend','Guardian Plus',false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',null,null,null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Guardian Fang','Guardian Fang','Guardian Fang','SID_新年の戦猫の爪牙','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, deals damage = 70% of difference between stats. (Maximum bonus of +7 damage. Combos with Phantom Spd.) If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','Adult Cavalry',null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Guardian Fang 2 ATK','Guardian Fang','Guardian Fang','SID_新年の戦猫の爪牙2_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Spd+3. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, deals damage = 70% of difference between stats. (Maximum bonus of +7 damage. Combos with Phantom Spd.) If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%). If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Guardian Fang 2 DEF','Guardian Fang','Guardian Fang','SID_新年の戦猫の爪牙2_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Spd+3. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, deals damage = 70% of difference between stats. (Maximum bonus of +7 damage. Combos with Phantom Spd.) If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%). If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat + 3; max 6), and also, if X ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,4,0',null,null,null),
