  ('Guardians Bow SKILL1','Guardian''s Bow','Guardian''s Bow','SID_守護者の烈弓_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd-7 at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def-5 on foe and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, deals damage = 10% of unit''s Spd (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Def (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'flying',null),
