  ('Guarding Lance','Guarding Lance','Guarding Lance','SID_守護騎士の白槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>If a Rally or movement Assist skill (like Reposition, Shove, Pivot, etc.) is used by unit or targets unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def+6, 【Bonus Doubler】, and【Foe Penalty Doubler】to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat.<br><br>【Bonus Doubler】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of unit''s stats for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Foe Penalty Doubler】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = any current penalty on each of those stats for 1 turn.<br>Calculates each stat penalty independently.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Guidance 1','Guidance 1','Guidance','SID_空からの先導1','passivec',null,null,'If unit''s HP = 100%, infantry and armored allies within 2 spaces can move to a space adjacent to unit.',null,'Guidance 2',false,60,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('Guidance 2','Guidance 2','Guidance','SID_空からの先導2','passivec',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 50%, infantry and armored allies within 2 spaces can move to a space adjacent to unit.','Guidance 1','Guidance 3',false,120,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('Guidance 3','Guidance 3','Guidance','SID_空からの先導3','passivec',null,null,'Infantry and armored allies within 2 spaces can move to a space adjacent to unit.','Guidance 2',null,false,240,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('Guidance 4','Guidance 4','Guidance','SID_空からの先導4','passivec',null,null,'Infantry and armored allies within 2 spaces can move to a space within 2 spaces of unit. Grants Atk/Spd+3 to infantry and armored allies within 2 spaces of unit during combat, and also, if those allies'' Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that prevent those allies'' follow-up attacks during combat.','Guidance 3',null,false,300,'Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('Guides Hourglass','Guide''s Hourglass','Guide''s Hourglass','SID_導きの教師の砂時計','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants "unit cannot be slowed by terrain (does not apply to impassable terrain)" and 【Dodge】to unit for 1 turn. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat. If unit is within 2 spaces of any allies, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to those allies during combat.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Gullinbursti','Gullinbursti','Gullinbursti','SID_グリンブルスティ','sacredseal',null,null,'Enables【Canto (Rem.)】.<br><br>【Canto (Rem.)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn. (If unit used a movement skill that warped them, its remaining movement is 0.)<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,false,0,'Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'enemy_only'),
  ('Gullinkambi Egg','Gullinkambi Egg','Gullinkambi Egg','SID_グリンカムビの聖卵','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat and unit or an ally has already entered combat during the same phase, unit attacks twice.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Gullinkambi Egg ATK','Gullinkambi Egg','Gullinkambi Egg','SID_グリンカムビの聖卵_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit or an ally has already entered combat during the same phase or unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, if unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice during combat.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Gullinkambi Egg DEF','Gullinkambi Egg','Gullinkambi Egg','SID_グリンカムビの聖卵_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit or an ally has already entered combat during the same phase or unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, if unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice during combat.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Gullinkambi Egg RES','Gullinkambi Egg','Gullinkambi Egg','SID_グリンカムビの聖卵_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit or an ally has already entered combat during the same phase or unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, if unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice during combat.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,null),
  ('Gullinkambi Egg SKILL1','Gullinkambi Egg','Gullinkambi Egg','SID_グリンカムビの聖卵_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit or an ally has already entered combat during the same phase or unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, if unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice during combat.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>Enables【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】.<br><br>For unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X (for unit, X = 10; for allies, X = 5), grants Special cooldown count-1 before their first attack, and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn (min. １; if unit used a movement skill that warped them, unit can move １ space(s)). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Gullinkambi Egg SPD','Gullinkambi Egg','Gullinkambi Egg','SID_グリンカムビの聖卵_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit or an ally has already entered combat during the same phase or unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, if unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice during combat.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Gullveig weapon','Gullveig','Gullveig','SID_グルヴェイグ','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. If unit initiates combat and unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 60%. If unit initiates combat, grants another action to unit after combat, and inflicts "restricts movement to 1 space" on unit and Pair Up cohort through their next action. (Will not trigger again for 2 turns after triggering.)','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner,enemy_only'),
  ('Gurgurant','Gurgurant','Gurgurant','SID_グルグラント','weapon',1,null,'Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. Grants Def+3. Inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foes within 2 spaces during combat.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,3,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Gurgurant ATK','Gurgurant','Gurgurant','SID_グルグラント_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. Grants Def+3. Inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foes within 4 spaces of unit during combat, neutralizes those foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def during combat, those foes cannot make a follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on those foes per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,18,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Gurgurant DEF','Gurgurant','Gurgurant','SID_グルグラント_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. Grants Def+3. Inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foes within 4 spaces of unit during combat, neutralizes those foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def during combat, those foes cannot make a follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on those foes per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,7,0',null,null,null),
  ('Gurgurant RES','Gurgurant','Gurgurant','SID_グルグラント_RES','weapon',1,'res','Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. Grants Def+3. Inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foes within 4 spaces of unit during combat, neutralizes those foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def during combat, those foes cannot make a follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on those foes per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,3,4',null,null,null),
  ('Gurgurant SKILL1','Gurgurant','Gurgurant','SID_グルグラント_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. Grants Def+3. Inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foes within 4 spaces of unit during combat, neutralizes those foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def during combat, those foes cannot make a follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on those foes per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = 15% of unit''s Def at start of combat + 5) and reduces damage from attacks during combat by 30% (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Gurgurant SPD','Gurgurant','Gurgurant','SID_グルグラント_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. Grants Def+3. Inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foes within 4 spaces of unit during combat, neutralizes those foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def during combat, those foes cannot make a follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on those foes per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Gust','Gust','Gust','SID_陣風','special',null,null,'Boosts Special damage by 50% of unit''s Spd when Special triggers.<br><br>If unit''s or foe''s Special is ready or if unit''s or foe''s Special triggered before or during this combat, and if unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd-4, reduces damage from foe''s next attack during combat by 40% (once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Glimmer',null,false,500,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,null,3,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Gusty War Bow','Gusty War Bow','Gusty War Bow','SID_戦神の風弓','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against beast and flying foes. At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of an ally and unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by X% during combat (if in combat against a beast foe, or a cavalry or flying foe with Range = 2, X = 60; otherwise, X = 30), and also, if unit''s Special is ready or unit''s Special triggered before or during this combat, deals +7 damage during combat (except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials).','Silver Bow',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'beast,flying',null),
