  ('Hawk King Claw','Hawk King Claw','Hawk King Claw','SID_鷹王の嘴爪','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. If foe''s HP = 100% and if unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit transforms, grants Atk+2.','Adult Flier',null,true,400,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Hawk King Claw ATK','Hawk King Claw','Hawk King Claw','SID_鷹王の嘴爪_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3. If unit is transformed or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit transforms, grants Atk+2.',null,null,true,400,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,19,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Hawk King Claw DEF','Hawk King Claw','Hawk King Claw','SID_鷹王の嘴爪_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3. If unit is transformed or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit transforms, grants Atk+2.',null,null,true,400,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,17,0,4,0',null,null,null),
