  ('Heartbeat Lance SKILL1','Heartbeat Lance','Heartbeat Lance','SID_鎧好きの堅槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe during combat and reduces foe''s Atk during combat by X% of foe''s Atk at start of combat (X = number of unit''s base HP/Atk/Spd/Def/Res stats that are greater than foe''s stats at start of combat × 5, + 10).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
