  ('Helping Dagger','Helping Dagger','Helping Dagger','SID_合力の暗器','weapon',2,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit, grants Atk/Spd+X × 5 to unit (X = the number of allies with Atk ≥ 55 within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit + the number of allies with Spd ≥ 40 in the same area; max 3), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Effect:【Dagger ５】<br><br>【Dagger ５】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-５ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Steel Dagger','Helping Dagger Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
