  ('Hels Reaper','Hel''s Reaper','Hel''s Reaper','SID_死鎌ヘル','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. If foe does not use magic or staff, calculates damage using foe''s Res, and if unit’s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit’s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP. (Once per combat. Does not stack.)','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Hels Reaper ATK','Hel''s Reaper','Hel''s Reaper','SID_死鎌ヘル_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. If foe does not use magic or staff, calculates damage using foe''s Res, and also, if unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0 during combat, unit survives with 1 HP (once per combat; does not stack). If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Hels Reaper DEF','Hel''s Reaper','Hel''s Reaper','SID_死鎌ヘル_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. If foe does not use magic or staff, calculates damage using foe''s Res, and also, if unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0 during combat, unit survives with 1 HP (once per combat; does not stack). If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Hels Reaper RES','Hel''s Reaper','Hel''s Reaper','SID_死鎌ヘル_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. If foe does not use magic or staff, calculates damage using foe''s Res, and also, if unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0 during combat, unit survives with 1 HP (once per combat; does not stack). If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Hels Reaper SKILL1','Hel''s Reaper','Hel''s Reaper','SID_死鎌ヘル_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. If foe does not use magic or staff, calculates damage using foe''s Res, and also, if unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0 during combat, unit survives with 1 HP (once per combat; does not stack). If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% or 【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Hels Reaper SPD','Hel''s Reaper','Hel''s Reaper','SID_死鎌ヘル_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses. If foe does not use magic or staff, calculates damage using foe''s Res, and also, if unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0 during combat, unit survives with 1 HP (once per combat; does not stack). If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Heralding Horn','Heralding Horn','Heralding Horn','SID_新年を開く角','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk+6 to unit and inflicts Atk-6 on foe during combat, and also grants the following effects based on the number of allies within 3 spaces: if ≥ 1 ally, if unit has weapon-triangle advantage or if foe initiates combat, unit attacks twice; and if ≥ 2 allies, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 40%; and if ≥ 3 allies, foe cannot make a follow-up attack. At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.','Adult Infantry',null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
