  ('Hexblade Axe','Hexblade Axe','Hexblade Axe','SID_魔刃の斧','weapon',1,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants "unit cannot be slowed by terrain (does not apply to impassable terrain)" and 【Hexblade】to unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and deals damage = 10% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Hexblade】<br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res during combat for 1 turn (including damage dealt by Specials before combat).','Steel Axe','Hexblade Axe Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
