  ('Hotshot Lance SKILL1','Hotshot Lance','Hotshot Lance','SID_凄腕の鋭槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res based on the number of times unit has been enhanced using Dragonflowers during combat (five or more times grants +12, four times grants +10, three times grants +8, and two or fewer times grants +6).<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and unit has been enhanced using Dragonflowers three or more times, neutralizes foe''s bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)<br>For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def-5 and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, deals damage = number of times unit has been enhanced using Dragonflowers × 2, + 5 (max 25; excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Hotshot Lance SPD','Hotshot Lance','Hotshot Lance','SID_凄腕の鋭槍_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res based on the number of times unit has been enhanced using Dragonflowers during combat (five or more times grants +12, four times grants +10, three times grants +8, and two or fewer times grants +6).<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and unit has been enhanced using Dragonflowers three or more times, neutralizes foe''s bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Howling Bow','Howling Bow','Howling Bow','SID_狼騎士団の弓','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Spd/Def-7,【Discord】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Howling Bow ATK','Howling Bow','Howling Bow','SID_狼騎士団の弓_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Spd/Def-7,【Discord】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Howling Bow DEF','Howling Bow','Howling Bow','SID_狼騎士団の弓_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Spd/Def-7,【Discord】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Howling Bow RES','Howling Bow','Howling Bow','SID_狼騎士団の弓_RES','weapon',2,'res','Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Spd/Def-7,【Discord】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,'flying',null),
  ('Howling Bow SKILL1','Howling Bow','Howling Bow','SID_狼騎士団の弓_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Spd/Def-7,【Discord】, and a penalty that neutralizes non-Special "if foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP" effects on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Def, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area- of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
