  ('Hvitrdeer','Hvítrdeer','Hvítrdeer','SID_ヒータディア','weapon',2,null,'If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk+5 to unit, inflicts Atk-5 on foe, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Elstone','Hvitrdeer Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
