  ('Ice Dragonstone','Ice Dragonstone','Ice Dragonstone','SID_氷竜の竜石','weapon',1,null,'If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Fire Breath Plus','Ice Dragonstone Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,null),
