  ('Imbued Koma RES','Imbued Koma','Imbued Koma','SID_神宿りの独楽_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s Special is ready, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials) during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,null),
  ('Imbued Koma SKILL1','Imbued Koma','Imbued Koma','SID_神宿りの独楽_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s Special is ready, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials) during combat.<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and also, when Special triggers, unit deals damage = 15% of unit''s Def.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Imbued Koma SPD','Imbued Koma','Imbued Koma','SID_神宿りの独楽_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s Special is ready, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials) during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Imhullu','Imhullu','Imhullu','SID_マフー','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3. At the start of turn 3, deals 5 damage to non-magic foes within 5 columns centered on unit, and inflicts status on those foes preventing counterattacks through their next actions.','Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Imhullu ATK','Imhullu','Imhullu','SID_マフー_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Res+3. At the start of turn 3, deals 7 damage to non-magic foes within 5 columns centered on unit and inflicts status on those foes preventing counterattacks through their next actions. If unit initiates combat or unit is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Imhullu DEF','Imhullu','Imhullu','SID_マフー_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Res+3. At the start of turn 3, deals 7 damage to non-magic foes within 5 columns centered on unit and inflicts status on those foes preventing counterattacks through their next actions. If unit initiates combat or unit is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,3',null,null,null),
  ('Imhullu RES','Imhullu','Imhullu','SID_マフー_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Res+3. At the start of turn 3, deals 7 damage to non-magic foes within 5 columns centered on unit and inflicts status on those foes preventing counterattacks through their next actions. If unit initiates combat or unit is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,6',null,null,null),
  ('Imhullu SKILL1','Imhullu','Imhullu','SID_マフー_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Res+3. At the start of turn 3, deals 7 damage to non-magic foes within 5 columns centered on unit and inflicts status on those foes preventing counterattacks through their next actions. If unit initiates combat or unit is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat, and also, if foe is non-magic, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by 30% and foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Imhullu SPD','Imhullu','Imhullu','SID_マフー_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Res+3. At the start of turn 3, deals 7 damage to non-magic foes within 5 columns centered on unit and inflicts status on those foes preventing counterattacks through their next actions. If unit initiates combat or unit is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Immurement','Immurement','Immurement','SID_真・閉界','special',null,null,'When Special triggers, boosts damage by 70% of unit''s Atk and neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills.<br><br>At start of turn and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Spd/Res-7, 【Feud】, and【Discord】on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat, reduces damage from attacks by percentage = number of foes within 2 spaces of target with【Feud】active, including target, × 10, + 40 (max 80%; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Feud】<br>Disables all ally skills (excluding unit''s) during combat through unit''s next action.<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.','Reprisal',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,5,null,'offensive_special,random_owner'),
  ('Impenetrable Dark','Impenetrable Dark','Impenetrable Dark','SID_見通せぬ深き暗闇','passivec',null,null,'During combat, disables skills of all foes excluding foe in combat.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Impenetrable Void','Impenetrable Void','Impenetrable Dark','SID_見通せぬ深き…・神','passivec',null,null,'Disables skills of all foes excluding foe in combat, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foe, and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (example: a foe with a "reduce damage by 45%" skill would reduce damage by 23% instead).','Impenetrable Dark',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Imperial Astra','Imperial Astra','Imperial Astra','SID_剣皇の流星','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by 40% of unit''s Spd.','Astra',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,2,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Impetus Guard','Impetus Guard','Impetus Guard','SID_助走・キャンセル','passiveb',null,null,'If unit or foe initiates combat after moving to a different space, inflicts Spd/Def/Res-4 on foe, unit deals damage during combat = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 5 (max 20; including area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 10 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and if unit initiates combat and foe''s attack can trigger foe''s Special, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe before foe''s first attack during combat (cannot exceed the foe''s maximum Special cooldown).<br><br>If unit initiates combat after moving to a different space, triggers the following effects depending on unit''s equipped Special: if unit has an area-of-effect Special equipped, grants Special cooldown count-X to unit before Special triggers before combat (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials); if unit has a Special that triggers when unit attacks (excluding area-of-effect Specials), grants Special cooldown count-X to unit before unit''s first attack during combat (if number of spaces from start position to end position ≥ 3, X = 2; otherwise, X = 1).','Momentum 3',null,false,400,'Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Impregnable','Impregnable','Impregnable',null,'captain',null,null,'At start of turns 2-5, grants Assign Decoy to captain for 1 turn. (If foe''s Range = unit''s Range and foe initiates combat against an ally within 2 spaces of unit, triggers Savior on unit; triggers only if unit is not equipped with a skill that can trigger the Savior effect.)',null,null,false,0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null),
  ('In the Fold','In the Fold','In the Fold','SID_グループ','weapon',2,null,'For allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 and neutralizes penalties during their combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes penalties on unit, and deals +X damage during combat (max 15; excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 5; calculates damage from staff after combat damage is added).','Assault','In The Fold Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('In The Fold Plus','In The Fold+','In The Fold+','SID_グループ＋','weapon',2,null,'For allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 and neutralizes penalties during their combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes penalties on unit, and deals +X damage during combat (max 15; excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 5; calculates damage from staff after combat damage is added).','In the Fold',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('In The Fold Plus SKILL1','In The Fold+','In The Fold+','SID_グループ＋_神','weapon',2,'skill1','For allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 and neutralizes penalties during their combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes penalties on unit, and deals +X damage during combat (max 15; excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 5; calculates damage from staff after combat damage is added).<br>Calculates damage from staff like other weapons.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('In The Fold Plus SKILL2','In The Fold+','In The Fold+','SID_グループ＋_幻','weapon',2,'skill2','For allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 and neutralizes penalties during their combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes penalties on unit, and deals +X damage during combat (max 15; excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 5; calculates damage from staff after combat damage is added).<br>Foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Inaugural Vassal','Inaugural Vassal','Inaugural Vassal','SID_真開神の眷属','passivec',null,null,'Allies within 2 spaces can move to any space within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>If there are 3 or more allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, triggers the following: grants weapon-triangle advantage against and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on red, blue, and green foes during combat; neutralizes effects that boost values along with weapon-triangle advantage or reduce values along with weapon-triangle disadvantage (Triangle Adept) on unit and foe.<br><br>For unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Def/Res+5, deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit or ally during combat, and unit''s or ally''s next attack deals damage = 40% of foe''s first-attack damage prior to reductions during combat (resets at end of combat; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Inborn Idealism','Inborn Idealism','Inborn Idealism','SID_理想への天質','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if a dragon or beast ally is deployed, grants Atk/Spd/Def+6, 【Bonus Doubler】, and【Null Panic】to unit and ally with the highest Atk (excluding unit) for 1 turn.<br><br>【Bonus Doubler】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of unit''s stats for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Null Panic】<br>If unit is inflicted with Panic (bonuses converted into penalties), neutralizes the "converts bonuses on target into penalties" effect for 1 turn. (Even though the effect is neutralized, the Panic status remains, and is treated as a Penalty status.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Incipit Kvasir','Incipit Kvasir','Incipit Kvasir','SID_始端クワシル','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts penalty on foe''s Spd/Res = 15% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and also, if it is unit''s first combat initiated by unit or first combat initiated by foe that turn, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 70% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes). If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Panic】 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Incite AtkRes','Incite Atk/Res','Incite Atk/Res','SID_攻撃魔防の奮激4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 2, grants Atk/Res+6 and【Incited】 to unit for 1 turn. If number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Res+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Incited】<br>If unit initiates combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of spaces from start position to end position of unit during combat (max 3; that turn only).','Rouse AtkRes 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Cavalry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Incite AtkSpd','Incite Atk/Spd','Incite Atk/Spd','SID_攻撃速さの奮激4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 2, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Incited】 to unit for 1 turn. If number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Spd+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Incited】<br>If unit initiates combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of spaces from start position to end position of unit during combat (max 3; that turn only).','Rouse AtkSpd 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Cavalry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Incite SpdDef','Incite Spd/Def','Incite Spd/Def','SID_速さ守備の奮激4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 2, grants Spd/Def+6 and【Incited】 to unit for 1 turn. If number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Spd/Def+3 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Incited】<br>If unit initiates combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of spaces from start position to end position of unit during combat (max 3; that turn only).','Rouse SpdDef 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Cavalry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Incurable','Incurable','Incurable','SID_インキュアブル','weapon',2,null,'Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to and inflicts【Deep Wounds】on target.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Assault','Incurable Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Incurable Plus','Incurable+','Incurable+','SID_インキュアブル＋','weapon',2,null,'Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to and inflicts【Deep Wounds】on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Incurable',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Incurable Plus SKILL1','Incurable+','Incurable+','SID_インキュアブル＋_神','weapon',2,'skill1','Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to and inflicts【Deep Wounds】on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.<br>Calculates damage from staff like other weapons.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Incurable Plus SKILL2','Incurable+','Incurable+','SID_インキュアブル＋_幻','weapon',2,'skill2','Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to and inflicts【Deep Wounds】on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.<br>Foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Indignant Bow','Indignant Bow','Indignant Bow','SID_義憤の強弓','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes. Grants Res+3. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP = 100% at start of combat, grants Atk+6 to unit and inflicts Atk-6 on foe during combat, and also neutralizes penalties to unit''s Atk and bonuses to foe''s Atk (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.','Silver Bow',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,'flying','random_owner'),
  ('Indignant Bow ATK','Indignant Bow','Indignant Bow','SID_義憤の強弓_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Effective against flying foes. Grants Res+3.<br><br>Disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Def/Res+6 and Spd+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd/Res and foe''s bonuses to Atk/Spd (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.), and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, when unit''s Special triggers, calculates damage using 150% of unit''s Res instead of the value of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,15,0,0,3',null,'flying',null),
  ('Indignant Bow DEF','Indignant Bow','Indignant Bow','SID_義憤の強弓_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Effective against flying foes. Grants Res+3.<br><br>Disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Def/Res+6 and Spd+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd/Res and foe''s bonuses to Atk/Spd (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.), and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, when unit''s Special triggers, calculates damage using 150% of unit''s Res instead of the value of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,3,3',null,'flying',null),
  ('Indignant Bow RES','Indignant Bow','Indignant Bow','SID_義憤の強弓_RES','weapon',2,'res','Effective against flying foes. Grants Res+3.<br><br>Disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Def/Res+6 and Spd+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd/Res and foe''s bonuses to Atk/Spd (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.), and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, when unit''s Special triggers, calculates damage using 150% of unit''s Res instead of the value of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,0,6',null,'flying',null),
  ('Indignant Bow SKILL1','Indignant Bow','Indignant Bow','SID_義憤の強弓_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against flying foes. Grants Res+3.<br><br>Disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Def/Res+6 and Spd+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd/Res and foe''s bonuses to Atk/Spd (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.), and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, when unit''s Special triggers, calculates damage using 150% of unit''s Res instead of the value of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>For allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd/Res+5, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on ally, and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 during their combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 10 during combat (including from area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and also, when foe''s attack triggers foe''s Special, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by an additional 10 (including from area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,3',-1,'flying',null),
  ('Indignant Bow SPD','Indignant Bow','Indignant Bow','SID_義憤の強弓_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Effective against flying foes. Grants Res+3.<br><br>Disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Def/Res+6 and Spd+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd/Res and foe''s bonuses to Atk/Spd (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.), and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, when unit''s Special triggers, calculates damage using 150% of unit''s Res instead of the value of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,2,0,3',null,'flying',null),
