  ('Inf. Null Follow 1','Inf. Null Follow 1','Inf. Null Follow','SID_歩行の見切り追撃1','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, grants 【Null Follow-Up】to adjacent infantry allies.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.',null,'Inf. Null Follow 2',false,60,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
