  ('Initiate Seal Spd 3','Initiate Seal Spd 3','Initiate Seal Spd','SID_鍛錬の証_速さ3','sacredseal',null,null,'Grants Spd+3.','Initiate Seal Spd 2',null,false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Inner Wellspring','Inner Wellspring','Inner Wellspring','SID_内より溢れる魔力','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants【Null Follow-Up】to unit for 1 turn, and also, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and if Special triggers before or during combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 after combat.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Inner Wellspring ATK','Inner Wellspring','Inner Wellspring','SID_内より溢れる魔力_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants【Null Follow-Up】to unit for 1 turn, and also, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, if Special triggers before or during combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 after combat.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Inner Wellspring DEF','Inner Wellspring','Inner Wellspring','SID_内より溢れる魔力_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants【Null Follow-Up】to unit for 1 turn, and also, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, if Special triggers before or during combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 after combat.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Inner Wellspring RES','Inner Wellspring','Inner Wellspring','SID_内より溢れる魔力_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants【Null Follow-Up】to unit for 1 turn, and also, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, if Special triggers before or during combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 after combat.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,null),
  ('Inner Wellspring SKILL1','Inner Wellspring','Inner Wellspring','SID_内より溢れる魔力_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants【Null Follow-Up】to unit for 1 turn, and also, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, if Special triggers before or during combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 after combat.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.<br>Enables【Canto (１)】.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 5 + 10% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, unit deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Inner Wellspring SPD','Inner Wellspring','Inner Wellspring','SID_内より溢れる魔力_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants【Null Follow-Up】to unit for 1 turn, and also, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, if Special triggers before or during combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 after combat.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Inscribed Tome','Inscribed Tome','Inscribed Tome','SID_金石の書','weapon',2,null,'Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
