  ('Inscribed Tome RES','Inscribed Tome','Inscribed Tome','SID_金石の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Inscribed Tome SKILL1','Inscribed Tome','Inscribed Tome','SID_金石の書_特','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br>If foe initiates combat and uses sword, lance, axe, or beast damage, unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Inscribed Tome SPD','Inscribed Tome','Inscribed Tome','SID_金石の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Inseverable Spear','Inseverable Spear','Inseverable Spear','SID_母娘の静やかな祝福','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants the following effects to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn: "unit can move to a space adjacent to an ally within 2 spaces" and【Dual Strike】.  If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Dual Strike】<br>If unit initiates combat and is adjacent to an ally with Dual Strike (excluding unit), unit attacks twice. (That turn only. Does not stack.)','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Inspirited Spear','Inspirited Spear','Inspirited Spear','SID_舞い踊る満月の宝槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if any foe is within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Spd/Def+6 to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. At start of enemy phase, for foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts 【Guard】on foe, and also, if foe''s attack can trigger foe''s Special, foe''s Special cooldown count ≤ 1, and foe''s Def < unit''s Def, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe (cannot exceed foe''s maximum Special cooldown). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and inflicts Atk/Spd/Def-X on foe during combat (X = 15% of unit''s Def at start of combat), deals damage = 40% of unit''s Def when Special triggers (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
