  ('Inveterate Axe SKILL1','Inveterate Axe','Inveterate Axe','SID_老騎士の古斧_紋','weapon',1,'skill1','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe on the enemy team with the lowest Spd through its next action.<br>Grants Atk/Def+4 to infantry and cavalry allies within 2 spaces during combat. If unit is within 2 spaces of an infantry or cavalry ally, grants Atk/Def+4 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
