  ('Kumo Naginata','Kumo Naginata','Kumo Naginata','SID_白夜忍の薙刀','weapon',1,null,'Unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces. If unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.','Steel Lance','Kumo Naginata Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',6,'0,6,0,0,0',null,null,null),
