  ('Ladyblade RES','Ladyblade','Ladyblade','SID_レディソード_RES','weapon',1,'res','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat, unit attacks twice). Grants Atk/Def/Res+5 and inflicts Spd-5.<br><br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',11,'5,16,-5,5,9',null,null,null),
  ('Ladyblade SKILL1','Ladyblade','Ladyblade','SID_レディソード_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat, unit attacks twice). Grants Atk/Def/Res+5 and inflicts Spd-5.<br><br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+6 and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn, and also, grants "unit can move 1 extra space" to unit and flying allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn (does not stack).<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Def/Res = 10% of unit''s Def at start of combat + 5 and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',11,'3,16,-5,5,5',null,null,null),
  ('Ladyblade SPD','Ladyblade','Ladyblade','SID_レディソード_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat, unit attacks twice). Grants Atk/Def/Res+5 and inflicts Spd-5.<br><br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',11,'5,16,-2,5,5',null,null,null),
  ('Ladys Bow','Lady''s Bow','Lady''s Bow','SID_草原の公女の弓','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Effective against flying foes.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6,【Desperation】, and 【Preempt Pulse】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 20% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, if decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 25 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow-ups), triggers【Potent Follow X%】 during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>【Desperation】<br>Grants the following effect for 1 turn: "If unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack."<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).','Silver Bow',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'flying','random_owner'),
  ('Laevatein weapon','Laevatein','Laevatein','SID_レーヴァテイン','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Laevatein weapon ATK','Laevatein','Laevatein','SID_レーヴァテイン_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3. Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 50% or【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Laevatein weapon DEF','Laevatein','Laevatein','SID_レーヴァテイン_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3. Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 50% or【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Laevatein weapon RES','Laevatein','Laevatein','SID_レーヴァテイン_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Atk+3. Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 50% or【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,19,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Laevatein weapon SKILL1','Laevatein','Laevatein','SID_レーヴァテイン_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk+3. Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 50% or【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+6 to unit for 1 turn. At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of unit''s support partner (if any), grants Atk/Def+6 to unit''s support partner for 1 turn. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,19,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Laevatein weapon SPD','Laevatein','Laevatein','SID_レーヴァテイン_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Atk+3. Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 50% or【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Laguz Friend 1','Laguz Friend 1','Laguz Friend','SID_不動1','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s max Special cooldown count value ≥ 3 and unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, or if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, reduces the percentage of unit''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 5% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat. During combat, if unit''s max Special cooldown count value ≥ 3 and unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, when Special triggers, deals damage = 5% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials). During combat, if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, when Special triggers, unit''s next attack deals damage = 5% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (boost resets at end of combat).',null,'Laguz Friend 2',false,60,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Laguz Friend 2','Laguz Friend 2','Laguz Friend','SID_不動2','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s max Special cooldown count value ≥ 3 and unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, or if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, reduces the percentage of unit''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 10% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat. During combat, if unit''s max Special cooldown count value ≥ 3 and unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, when Special triggers, deals damage = 10% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials). During combat, if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, when Special triggers, unit''s next attack deals damage = 10% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (boost resets at end of combat).','Laguz Friend 1','Laguz Friend 3',false,120,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Laguz Friend 3','Laguz Friend 3','Laguz Friend','SID_不動3','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s max Special cooldown count value ≥ 3 and unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, or if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, reduces the percentage of unit''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat. During combat, if unit''s max Special cooldown count value ≥ 3 and unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, when Special triggers, deals damage = 15% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials). During combat, if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, when Special triggers, unit''s next attack deals damage = 15% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (boost resets at end of combat).','Laguz Friend 2',null,false,240,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Laguz Friend 4','Laguz Friend 4','Laguz Friend','SID_不動4','passiveb',null,null,'Inflicts Atk-5 on foe during combat. If unit''s max Special cooldown count value ≥ 3 and unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, or if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, reduces the percentage of unit''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat. During combat, if unit''s max Special cooldown count value ≥ 3 and unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, when Special triggers, deals damage = 20% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials). During combat, if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, when Special triggers, unit''s next attack deals damage = 20% of the greater of unit''s Def or Res and neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (resets at end of combat).','Laguz Friend 3',null,false,300,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Laguz Loyalty','Laguz Loyalty','Laguz Loyalty','SID_不動・刹那','passiveb',null,null,'Inflicts Atk/Spd-4 on foe during combat.<br><br>If unit''s max Special cooldown count value ≥ 3 and unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, or if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, reduces the percentage of unit''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, if foe initiates combat, decreases Spd difference necessary for unit to make a follow-up attack by 10 and unit deals +7 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Laguz Friend 3',null,false,300,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
