  ('Lance of Frelia','Lance of Frelia','Lance of Frelia','SID_フレリアの宝槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br> Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of an ally within 2 spaces. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, grants Def/Res+10 during combat.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
