  ('Lance of Heroics RES','Lance of Heroics','Lance of Heroics','SID_正義の直槍_RES','weapon',1,'res','If an ally''s HP ≤ 80%, unit can move to a space adjacent to that ally. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = 4 + X (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2; max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,null,null)
