  ('Lands Sword','Lands Sword','Lands Sword','SID_大地の剣','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, disables non-Special effects that "reduce damage by X%" (excluding those inflicted on unit''s area-of-effect Specials), prevents foe''s Specials that are triggered by unit''s attack, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Lands Sword ATK','Lands Sword','Lands Sword','SID_大地の剣_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and prevents foe''s Specials that are triggered by unit''s attack during combat, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
