  ('Lantern Breath','Lantern Breath','Lantern Breath','SID_提灯の竜石','weapon',1,null,'If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk+5 to unit, inflicts Atk-5 on foe, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Fire Breath Plus','Lantern Breath Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,null),
