  ('Larceis Edge','Larcei''s Edge','Larcei''s Edge','SID_ラクチェの流剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd or if foe''s HP = 100%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes foe''s bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
