  ('Life Unending','Life Unending','Life Unending','SID_永遠を生きるもの','special',null,null,'At the start of turn 1, grants Special cooldown count-5. When Special triggers, if unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit’s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP. After combat, if unit''s Special triggered, restores 99 HP. (Once per map.)','Miracle',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,5,null,'random_owner,defensive_special'),
  ('Life Unending II','Life Unending II','Life Unending II','SID_永遠を生きる…・承','special',null,null,'At the start of turn 1, grants Special cooldown count-5 to unit.<br><br>When Special triggers, if unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP.<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and unit''s next attack deals damage = total damage reduced from foe''s first attack (by any source, including other skills; resets at end of combat).<br><br>After combat, if unit''s Special triggered, restores 99 HP (neutralizes the effects of【Deep Wounds】and will not trigger again for 2 turns after triggering).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Life Unending',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,5,null,'defensive_special'),
