  ('Light Is Time','Light Is Time','Light Is Time','SID_光は時','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by 60% of foe''s Atk when Special triggers. Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat. If unit initiates combat, unit''s Special triggered, and unit survives, grants one of the following two effects after combat (once per turn): if there is only one ally with the highest HP among allies within 2 spaces of unit who have already acted, grants another action to that ally (allies with Sing or Dance can be granted this effect as well), and also, if that ally''s or their Pair Up cohort''s Range = 2, inflicts "restricts movement to 1 space" on that ally or that Pair Up cohort through their next action; otherwise, grants【Time''s Gate】 to unit.<br><br>【Time''s Gate】<br>Allies within 4 spaces of unit can move to a space adjacent to unit (that turn only).','Reprisal',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,5,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Light of Dawn','Light of Dawn','Light of Dawn','SID_暁の光','weapon',2,null,'Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Res+3. Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of target''s stats. Calculates each stat bonus independently.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,'armored,cavalry','random_owner'),
  ('Light of Dawn ATK','Light of Dawn','Light of Dawn','SID_暁の光_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75% or【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of target''s stats. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,3',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Light of Dawn DEF','Light of Dawn','Light of Dawn','SID_暁の光_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75% or【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of target''s stats. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,3',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Light of Dawn RES','Light of Dawn','Light of Dawn','SID_暁の光_RES','weapon',2,'res','Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75% or【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of target''s stats. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,6',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Light of Dawn SKILL1','Light of Dawn','Light of Dawn','SID_暁の光_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75% or【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of target''s stats. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Light of Dawn SPD','Light of Dawn','Light of Dawn','SID_暁の光_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75% or【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of target''s stats. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,3',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Light of Etruria','Light of Etruria','Light of Etruria','SID_エトルリアの光','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Spd/Res+6 and【Hexblade】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn, and also, if any foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit have Res < unit''s Res+5, inflicts Atk/Spd-7,【Guard】, and 【Exposure】on those foes through their next actions.<br><br>If foe initiates combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd during combat = 6 + 20% of unit''s Res at start of combat, and also, if unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP (once per combat; does not stack with non-Special effects that allow unit to survive with 1 HP if foe''s attack would reduce HP to 0).<br><br>【Hexblade】<br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res during combat for 1 turn (including damage dealt by Specials before combat).<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Lightburst Tome','Lightburst Tome','Lightburst Tome','SID_激雷の書','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def+6 and "unit cannot be slowed by terrain (does not apply to impassable terrain)" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, and if unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-X on foe during combat (X = 16, - foe''s max Special cooldown count value × 2; min 8; if foe does not have a Special skill, X = 8). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% and unit''s next attack deals damage = total damage reduced (by any source, including other skills; resets at end of combat), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Lightless Luna','Lightless Luna','Lightless Luna','SID_漆黒の月光','special',null,null,'Treats foe''s Def/Res as if reduced by 80% when Special triggers. If unit''s or foe''s Special is ready or triggered before or during this combat, reduces damage from foe''s next attack by 40% (once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Luna',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,3,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
