  ('Lights Restraint','Light''s Restraint','Light''s Restraint','SID_抑制の聖光','special',null,null,'If an Assist skill is used, unit''s Special cooldown count does not go down. When Special triggers, boosts damage by 25% of foe''s Res. (Calculates damage from staff after combat damage is added.) If Special is triggered during combat, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 and【Guard】 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target after combat (cannot exceed the foe''s maximum Special cooldown).<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Miracle',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',null,null,2,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Lilac-Jade Breath','Lilac-Jade Breath','Lilac-Jade Breath','SID_紫翠のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP = 100% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by 40%. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Lilac-Jade Breath ATK','Lilac-Jade Breath','Lilac-Jade Breath','SID_紫翠のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Enables Canto (2). Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from attacks and from area-of-effect Specials by 40% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (including from area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (including area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials). If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Lilac-Jade Breath DEF','Lilac-Jade Breath','Lilac-Jade Breath','SID_紫翠のブレス_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Enables Canto (2). Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from attacks and from area-of-effect Specials by 40% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (including from area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (including area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials). If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Lilac-Jade Breath RES','Lilac-Jade Breath','Lilac-Jade Breath','SID_紫翠のブレス_RES','weapon',1,'res','Enables Canto (2). Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from attacks and from area-of-effect Specials by 40% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (including from area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (including area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials). If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Lilac-Jade Breath SKILL1','Lilac-Jade Breath','Lilac-Jade Breath','SID_紫翠のブレス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Enables Canto (2). Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from attacks and from area-of-effect Specials by 40% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (including from area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (including area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials). If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>If a skill compares unit''s Res to a foe''s or ally''s Res, treats unit''s Res as if granted +5.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Empathy】,【Warp Bubble】, and "neutralizes ''effective against flying'' bonuses" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+10 during combat. If foe''s attack can trigger foe''s Special and unit''s Res ≥ foe''s Res+5, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe before foe''s first attack during combat (cannot exceed the foe''s maximum Special cooldown).<br><br>【Empathy】<br>Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of types of Bonus effects, excluding stat bonuses, and Penalty effects, excluding stat penalties, active on player team and enemy team during combat (max 7).<br><br>【Warp Bubble】<br>Foes cannot warp into spaces within 4 spaces of unit. (Does not affect foes with Pass skills or warp effects from structures, like camps and fortresses in Rival Domains.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Lilac-Jade Breath SPD','Lilac-Jade Breath','Lilac-Jade Breath','SID_紫翠のブレス_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Enables Canto (2). Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from attacks and from area-of-effect Specials by 40% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (including from area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (including area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials). If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
