  ('Loptous SKILL1','Loptous','Loptous','SID_ロプトウス_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Res+3. Skills with "effective against dragons" are effective against unit. If foe has no skills with "effective against dragons," inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of- effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br>At start of turn, if any foe''s Res < unit''s Res and that foe is adjacent to another foe, inflicts Atk/Res-5 on that foe through its next action. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-5 on foe during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
