  ('Lucky Bow','Lucky Bow','Lucky Bow','SID_おまじないの弓','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, grants an additional Atk+7 to unit and inflicts Atk-7 on foe, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Special cooldown count+2 on unit (cannot exceed the unit''s maximum Special cooldown).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Lucky Bow ATK','Lucky Bow','Lucky Bow','SID_おまじないの弓_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Effective against flying foes. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, grants an additional Atk+7 to unit and inflicts Atk-7 on foe, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Special cooldown count+2 on unit (cannot exceed the unit''s maximum Special cooldown).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Lucky Bow DEF','Lucky Bow','Lucky Bow','SID_おまじないの弓_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Effective against flying foes. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, grants an additional Atk+7 to unit and inflicts Atk-7 on foe, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Special cooldown count+2 on unit (cannot exceed the unit''s maximum Special cooldown).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Lucky Bow RES','Lucky Bow','Lucky Bow','SID_おまじないの弓_RES','weapon',2,'res','Effective against flying foes. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, grants an additional Atk+7 to unit and inflicts Atk-7 on foe, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Special cooldown count+2 on unit (cannot exceed the unit''s maximum Special cooldown).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,'flying',null),
  ('Lucky Bow SKILL1','Lucky Bow','Lucky Bow','SID_おまじないの弓_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against flying foes. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, grants an additional Atk+7 to unit and inflicts Atk-7 on foe, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Special cooldown count+2 on unit (cannot exceed the unit''s maximum Special cooldown).<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, neutralizes any【Penalty】on unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit (excluding penalties inflicted at start of turn), and restores 10 HP to unit and those allies. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Lucky Bow SPD','Lucky Bow','Lucky Bow','SID_おまじないの弓_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Effective against flying foes. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, grants an additional Atk+7 to unit and inflicts Atk-7 on foe, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Special cooldown count+2 on unit (cannot exceed the unit''s maximum Special cooldown).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,'flying',null),
