  ('Luin ATK','Lúin','Lúin','SID_ルーン_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (including area-of-effect Specials), and also, when Special triggers, deals additional damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd-7 during combat, foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Luin DEF','Lúin','Lúin','SID_ルーン_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (including area-of-effect Specials), and also, when Special triggers, deals additional damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd-7 during combat, foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Luin RES','Lúin','Lúin','SID_ルーン_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (including area-of-effect Specials), and also, when Special triggers, deals additional damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd-7 during combat, foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Luin SKILL1','Lúin','Lúin','SID_ルーン_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (including area-of-effect Specials), and also, when Special triggers, deals additional damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd-7 during combat, foe cannot counterattack.<br>Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Inflicts Spd/Def-5 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, neutralizes those foes'' bonuses to Spd/Def, and those foes suffer guaranteed follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Luin SPD','Lúin','Lúin','SID_ルーン_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (including area-of-effect Specials), and also, when Special triggers, deals additional damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd-7 during combat, foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
