  ('Maltet SKILL1','Maltet','Maltet','SID_マルテ_追','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Neutralizes "effective against armored" bonuses. If unit''s HP ≥ 25% and foe initiates combat, neutralizes unit''s penalties during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br>If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP = 100% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
