  ('Mercenary Lance SKILL1','Mercenary Lance','Mercenary Lance','SID_重歩傭兵の槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe, neutralizes penalties on unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe during combat (X = 5 + 15% of unit''s Def) and restores 10 HP to unit after combat, and also, if foe initiates combat, grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
