  ('Mermaid Bow','Mermaid Bow','Mermaid Bow','SID_海泳ぐ人魚の弓','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying and armored foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat and calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, and unit has weapon-triangle advantage, unit attacks twice.','Silver Bow',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,'armored,flying',null),
  ('Miasma Dagger','Miasma Dagger','Miasma Dagger','SID_毒煙の暗器','weapon',2,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat, and also, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target after combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ５】<br><br>【Dagger ５】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-５ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Steel Dagger','Miasma Dagger Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Miasma Dagger Plus','Miasma Dagger+','Miasma Dagger+','SID_毒煙の暗器＋','weapon',2,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat, and also, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target after combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Miasma Dagger',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Miasma Dagger Plus ATK','Miasma Dagger+','Miasma Dagger+','SID_毒煙の暗器＋_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat, and also, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target after combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',12,'2,13,0,0,0',null,null,null),
