  ('Mirage Falchion SKILL1','Mirage Falchion','Mirage Falchion','SID_幻影ファルシオン_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Effective against dragon foes. Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = 4 + number of allies who have already acted × 3; max 10). If foe initiates combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = 10 - number of foes who have already acted × 3; min 4). Restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,0,3,0',null,'dragon',null),
