  ('Moon Gradivus RES','Moon Gradivus','Moon Gradivus','SID_蒼月グラディウス_RES','weapon',1,'res','Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. Grants Special cooldown charge +1 per foe''s attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack. Special cooldown charge granted even if foe''s attack deals 0 damage.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Moon Gradivus SKILL1','Moon Gradivus','Moon Gradivus','SID_蒼月グラディウス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. Grants Special cooldown charge +1 per foe''s attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack. Special cooldown charge granted even if foe''s attack deals 0 damage.)<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), inflicts Def-5 on foe during combat, and neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Def (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Moon Gradivus SPD','Moon Gradivus','Moon Gradivus','SID_蒼月グラディウス_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. Grants Special cooldown charge +1 per foe''s attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack. Special cooldown charge granted even if foe''s attack deals 0 damage.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Moon-Twin Wing','Moon-Twin Wing','Moon-Twin Wing','SID_双姫の月翼','passiveb',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Spd-5 on foe during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Moon-Twin Wing Plus','Moon-Twin Wing+','Moon-Twin Wing','SID_双姫の月翼・神','passiveb',null,null,'If a skill compares unit''s Spd to a foe''s or ally''s Spd, treats unit''s Spd as if granted +7.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def-5 on foe, unit deals damage = 10% of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 5 (max 50%).','Moon-Twin Wing',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Moonbow','Moonbow','Moonbow','SID_月虹','special',null,null,'Treats foe''s Def/Res as if reduced by 30% during combat.','New Moon',null,false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,2,null,'random_all,offensive_special'),
  ('Moonless Breath','Moonless Breath','Moonless Breath','SID_暁闇のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally and deals damage to foe using a Special, restores 30% of unit''s maximum HP. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Moonless Breath ATK','Moonless Breath','Moonless Breath','SID_暁闇のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br>If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-5 on foe and reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and also, when Special triggers (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +10 damage and neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills, and also, if unit also deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Moonless Breath DEF','Moonless Breath','Moonless Breath','SID_暁闇のブレス_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br>If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-5 on foe and reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and also, when Special triggers (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +10 damage and neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills, and also, if unit also deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Moonless Breath RES','Moonless Breath','Moonless Breath','SID_暁闇のブレス_RES','weapon',1,'res','Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br>If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-5 on foe and reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and also, when Special triggers (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +10 damage and neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills, and also, if unit also deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Moonless Breath SKILL1','Moonless Breath','Moonless Breath','SID_暁闇のブレス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br>If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-5 on foe and reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and also, when Special triggers (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +10 damage and neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills, and also, if unit also deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Grants Atk/Def/Res+4 to allies within 2 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>For allies within 2 spaces of unit, if this unit''s Res ≥ ally''s foe''s Res+5 at start of combat and foe''s attack can trigger foe''s Special, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe before foe''s first attack during ally''s combat (cannot exceed foe''s maximum Special cooldown).<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-X on foe (X = 10% of unit''s Res at start of combat + 5) and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, if foe''s attack can trigger foe''s Special and unit''s Res ≥ foe''s Res+5, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on foe before foe''s first attack (cannot exceed the foe''s maximum Special cooldown).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Moonless Breath SPD','Moonless Breath','Moonless Breath','SID_暁闇のブレス_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br>If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def/Res-5 on foe and reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and also, when Special triggers (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit deals +10 damage and neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills, and also, if unit also deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Moonlight Bangle','Moonlight Bangle','Moonlight Bangle','SID_華月の腕輪','passiveb',null,null,'Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat. Deals damage = X% of foe''s Def when Special triggers (X = unit''s max Special cooldown count value × 10, + 20).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Moonlight Drop','Moonlight Drop','Moonlight Drop','SID_純白の月の雫','weapon',2,null,'Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat, and the following effects will occur based on the value of unit''s Res minus foe''s Res: If ≥ 5 and ≤ 14, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. If ≥ 15 and unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice.','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Moonlight Stone','Moonlight Stone','Moonlight Stone','SID_月夜の魔女の竜石','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At the start of turn 1, if foe''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-2. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per unit''s attack and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and reduces damage dealt to unit by 8 when foe''s attack triggers unit''s Special. (Excludes Miracle.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Moonlit Bangle F','Moonlit Bangle F','Moonlit Bangle F','SID_華月の腕輪・遠','passiveb',null,null,'Enables【Canto (１)】.<br><br>Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat. Deals damage = X% of foe''s Def when Special triggers (X = unit''s max Special cooldown count value × 10, + 20).<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Moonlit Bangle Q','Moonlit Bangle Q','Moonlit Bangle Q','SID_華月の腕輪・先','passiveb',null,null,'If foe initiates combat and unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd-4, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def-5 on foe during combat. Unit deals damage = 25% of foe''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack and Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first follow-up attack, and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Moonlit Slumber','Moonlit Slumber','Moonlit Slumber','SID_月を浴び地に眠る','passiveb',null,null,'Enables【Canto (Rem. +1; Min ２)】.<br><br>If unit can transform, transformation effects gain "if unit is within 2 spaces of a beast or dragon ally, or if number of adjacent allies other than beast or dragon allies ≤ 2" as a trigger condition (in addition to existing conditions).<br><br>If defending in Aether Raids, at the start of enemy turn 1, if conditions for transforming are met, unit transforms.<br><br>At start of turn, grants "reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special ''reduce damage by X%'' skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn and inflicts 【Spd Shackle】and【Def Shackle】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def-5 on foe, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit''s next attack deals damage = total damage reduced from foe''s first attack during combat (by any source, including other skills; resets at end of combat).<br><br>【Canto (Rem. +1; Min ２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn +1 (min ２; if unit used a movement skill that warped them, unit can move ２ space(s)). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Spd Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Spd during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br><br>【Def Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Def during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Moonstrike Breath','Moonstrike Breath','Moonstrike Breath','SID_誰彼のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk+6 to unit and inflicts Atk-6 on foe during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe using a Special, restores 30% of unit''s maximum HP. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Morph Fimbulvetr','Morph Fimbulvetr','Morph Fimbulvetr','SID_被造フィンブル','weapon',2,null,'Grants Atk+3. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-8 on foe during combat, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = total Atk+Res bonuses on ally with the highest total Atk+Res bonuses within 3 spaces. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, after combat, if unit attacked, deals 15 damage to nearest ally.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Morph Fimbulvetr ATK','Morph Fimbulvetr','Morph Fimbulvetr','SID_被造フィンブル_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-8 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk = highest total Atk/Res bonuses among allies within 3 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, after combat, if unit attacked, deals 15 damage to nearest ally.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, unit can use the following【Style】:<br>―――――――― Bolting Style ――――――――<br>Unit can attack foes within 5 spaces of unit and 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit regardless of unit''s range. Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 2, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br><br>Unit cannot move or attack structures, after-combat movement effects do not occur, unit''s area-of-effect Specials cannot be triggered, and remaining movement granted from Canto is treated as 0. Skill effect''s Range is treated as 2. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Morph Fimbulvetr DEF','Morph Fimbulvetr','Morph Fimbulvetr','SID_被造フィンブル_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-8 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk = highest total Atk/Res bonuses among allies within 3 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, after combat, if unit attacked, deals 15 damage to nearest ally.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, unit can use the following【Style】:<br>―――――――― Bolting Style ――――――――<br>Unit can attack foes within 5 spaces of unit and 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit regardless of unit''s range. Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 2, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br><br>Unit cannot move or attack structures, after-combat movement effects do not occur, unit''s area-of-effect Specials cannot be triggered, and remaining movement granted from Canto is treated as 0. Skill effect''s Range is treated as 2. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Morph Fimbulvetr RES','Morph Fimbulvetr','Morph Fimbulvetr','SID_被造フィンブル_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-8 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk = highest total Atk/Res bonuses among allies within 3 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, after combat, if unit attacked, deals 15 damage to nearest ally.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, unit can use the following【Style】:<br>―――――――― Bolting Style ――――――――<br>Unit can attack foes within 5 spaces of unit and 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit regardless of unit''s range. Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 2, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br><br>Unit cannot move or attack structures, after-combat movement effects do not occur, unit''s area-of-effect Specials cannot be triggered, and remaining movement granted from Canto is treated as 0. Skill effect''s Range is treated as 2. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Morph Fimbulvetr SKILL1','Morph Fimbulvetr','Morph Fimbulvetr','SID_被造フィンブル_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-8 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk = highest total Atk/Res bonuses among allies within 3 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, after combat, if unit attacked, deals 15 damage to nearest ally.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, unit can use the following【Style】:<br>―――――――― Bolting Style ――――――――<br>Unit can attack foes within 5 spaces of unit and 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit regardless of unit''s range. Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 2, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br><br>Unit cannot move or attack structures, after-combat movement effects do not occur, unit''s area-of-effect Specials cannot be triggered, and remaining movement granted from Canto is treated as 0. Skill effect''s Range is treated as 2. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.<br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Essence Drain】, "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat," and "reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special ''reduce damage by X%'' skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and certain target ally for 1 turn. (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Res at start of battle, excluding unit; "at start of battle" excludes increases to Res granted after ally is deployed, such as Legendary Effects, Mythic Effects, Bonus Heroes, Great Talent, etc.)<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Essence Drain】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, grants any Bonus effects active on target and foes within 2 spaces of target to unit and allies with the Essence Drain effect, and neutralizes any Bonus active on target and foes within 2 spaces of target (excluding Bonus effects being granted at the same time). After combat, if foe was defeated in combat, restores 10 HP to unit and allies with the Essence Drain effect.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Morph Fimbulvetr SPD','Morph Fimbulvetr','Morph Fimbulvetr','SID_被造フィンブル_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-8 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and grants bonus to unit''s Atk = highest total Atk/Res bonuses among allies within 3 spaces of unit during combat.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, after combat, if unit attacked, deals 15 damage to nearest ally.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, unit can use the following【Style】:<br>―――――――― Bolting Style ――――――――<br>Unit can attack foes within 5 spaces of unit and 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit regardless of unit''s range. Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 2, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br><br>Unit cannot move or attack structures, after-combat movement effects do not occur, unit''s area-of-effect Specials cannot be triggered, and remaining movement granted from Canto is treated as 0. Skill effect''s Range is treated as 2. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Mounting Fear','Mounting Fear','Mounting Fear','SID_恐山の妖術','passiveb',null,null,'At start of turn, inflicts【Panic】,【Exposure】, and【Deep Wounds】on foes with Res < unit''s Res and that are within 2 spaces of another foe through their next actions.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-5 on foe, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, for unit''s first attack during combat, if damage dealt prior to damage reduction calculation < foe''s HP - 1, sets damage before damage reduction as foe''s HP - 1 (excluding area-of-effect Specials; excluding certain foes, such as Røkkr).<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
