  ('Mulagir SKILL1','Mulagir','Mulagir','SID_ミュルグレ_強','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against flying foes. Grants Spd+3. Neutralizes bow, dagger, magic, or staff foe''s bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,'flying',null),
