  ('New-Sun Stone Plus RES','New-Sun Stone+','New-Sun Stone+','SID_辰年の幼姫の竜石＋_RES','weapon',1,'res','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 15% of unit''s Atk ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack). If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',14,'5,14,0,0,4',null,null,null),
