  ('Nimble Beast','Nimble Beast','Nimble Beast','SID_敏捷なる獣','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by X% of unit''s Spd when Special triggers (if transformed, X = 50; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>If both of the following conditions are met, reduces damage from foe''s next attack by 40% during combat:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- Unit''s or foe''s Special is ready, or unit''s<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;or foe''s Special triggered before or during<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;this combat.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- Unit is transformed or unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Spd-4.<br>(Once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Astra',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,3,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
