  ('Null C-Avoid','Null C-Avoid','Null C-Avoid','SID_真回避・見切り反撃','passiveb',null,null,'If a skill compares unit''s Spd to a foe''s or ally''s Spd, treats unit''s Spd as if granted +7.<br><br>Reduces damage from area-of-effect Specials by 80% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Spd-4 on foe, deals damage = difference between Spd stats + 5 (max 15; excluding area-of-effect Specials; if unit''s Spd < foe''s Spd, treats Spd difference as 0), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat.','Velocity 3',null,false,300,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
