  ('Null Pulse Follow','Null Pulse Follow','Null Pulse Follow','SID_追撃の鼓動・見切り','passivec',null,null,'Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = unit''s max Special cooldown count value + 2, unit deals +5 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 5 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before unit''s first follow-up during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.','Times Pulse 3',null,false,300,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
