  ('Ostian Backbone','Ostian Backbone','Ostian Backbone','SID_真オスティアの反撃','passivea',null,null,'Grants HP+5, Atk/Spd/Def/Res+9. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>For unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s or ally''s counterattacks during combat, and if foe initiates combat, unit and allies can make a follow-up attack before foe''s next attack during combat.<br><br>Unit deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and neutralizes effects that allow foe to make a follow-up attack before unit''s next attack during combat.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'5,9,9,9,9',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Ostian Counter','Ostian Counter','Ostian Counter','SID_オスティアの反撃','passivea',null,null,'Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe initiates combat, grants Atk/Def+4 during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Ostias Heart','Ostia''s Heart','Ostia''s Heart','SID_オスティアの心魂','passivea',null,null,'Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-8 on foe during combat, and also, when unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to unit (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Ostias Pulse','Ostia''s Pulse','Ostia''s Pulse','SID_オスティアの鼓動','passivec',null,null,'At the start of turn 1, grants Special cooldown count-1 to all allies. Granted only if number of those allies'' movement types on current team ≤ 2.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Ostias Pulse II','Ostia''s Pulse II','Ostia''s Pulse','SID_盟主の鼓動・承','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, grants Def/Res+6 to unit and allies for one turn, and also, if any unit or ally''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants them Special cooldown count-1. All effects granted only if the number of that unit or ally''s movement type on the current team is ≤ 2.','Ostias Pulse',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
