  ('Override','Override','Override','SID_オーバードライヴ','special',null,null,'If unit''s Special is ready, before combat this unit initiates, foes in an area near target take damage equal to 1.5 × (unit''s Atk minus foe''s Def or Res).<br><br>When unit deals damage to 2 or more foes at the same time using a Special (including target; including foes dealt 0 damage), grants another action to unit after combat (once per turn).<br><br>If unit''s or foe''s Special is ready or triggered before or during this combat, reduces damage from foe''s next attack by 40% during combat (once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Blazing Light',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,3,null,'random_owner,aoe_special'),
