  ('Persecution Bow','Persecution Bow','Persecution Bow','SID_被害妄想の弓','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if【Penalty】is active on unit or if unit''s HP < 100%, grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat, and if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Silver Bow',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,'flying','random_owner'),
  ('Persecution Bow ATK','Persecution Bow','Persecution Bow','SID_被害妄想の弓_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Effective against flying foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 99% or if【Penalty】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,18,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Persecution Bow DEF','Persecution Bow','Persecution Bow','SID_被害妄想の弓_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Effective against flying foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 99% or if【Penalty】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,17,0,3,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Persecution Bow RES','Persecution Bow','Persecution Bow','SID_被害妄想の弓_RES','weapon',2,'res','Effective against flying foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 99% or if【Penalty】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,17,0,0,3',null,'flying',null),
  ('Persecution Bow SKILL1','Persecution Bow','Persecution Bow','SID_被害妄想の弓_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against flying foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 99% or if【Penalty】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, deals 1 damage to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+X to unit (X = damage dealt to unit as of start of combat × 2, + 5; max 15) and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Persecution Bow SPD','Persecution Bow','Persecution Bow','SID_被害妄想の弓_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Effective against flying foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 99% or if【Penalty】is active on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,17,2,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Perspicacious','Perspicacious','Perspicacious','SID_軍略伝授の刃','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Grants Atk/Def/Res+4 and "reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special ''reduce damage by X%'' skills by 30% (excluding area-of-effect Specials)" to allies within 7 rows and 7 columns centered on unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Def = number of allies within 7 rows and 7 columns centered on unit × 3, + 6 (max 15), reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Silver Dagger',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
