  ('Petrify','Petrify','Petrify','SID_ストーン','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3. At start of turns 1 through 5, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 and【Gravity】on foe on the enemy team with the lowest specified stat (see below).<br><br>(Specified stats: Turn 1 = HP, Turn 2 = Atk, Turn 3 = Spd, Turn 4 = Def, Turn 5 = Res.)<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Petrify ATK','Petrify','Petrify','SID_ストーン_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Res+3. At start of turns 1 through 5, inflicts【Gravity】on foe on the enemy team with the lowest specified stat (see below), and also, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 and【Sabotage】 on that foe and foes within 2 spaces of that foe through their next actions.<br><br>(Specified stats: Turn 1 = HP, Turn 2 = Atk, Turn 3 = Spd, Turn 4 = Def, Turn 5 = Res.)<br><br>If unit initiates combat or the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Petrify DEF','Petrify','Petrify','SID_ストーン_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Res+3. At start of turns 1 through 5, inflicts【Gravity】on foe on the enemy team with the lowest specified stat (see below), and also, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 and【Sabotage】 on that foe and foes within 2 spaces of that foe through their next actions.<br><br>(Specified stats: Turn 1 = HP, Turn 2 = Atk, Turn 3 = Spd, Turn 4 = Def, Turn 5 = Res.)<br><br>If unit initiates combat or the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,3',null,null,null),
  ('Petrify RES','Petrify','Petrify','SID_ストーン_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Res+3. At start of turns 1 through 5, inflicts【Gravity】on foe on the enemy team with the lowest specified stat (see below), and also, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 and【Sabotage】 on that foe and foes within 2 spaces of that foe through their next actions.<br><br>(Specified stats: Turn 1 = HP, Turn 2 = Atk, Turn 3 = Spd, Turn 4 = Def, Turn 5 = Res.)<br><br>If unit initiates combat or the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,6',null,null,null),
  ('Petrify SKILL1','Petrify','Petrify','SID_ストーン_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Res+3. At start of turns 1 through 5, inflicts【Gravity】on foe on the enemy team with the lowest specified stat (see below), and also, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 and【Sabotage】 on that foe and foes within 2 spaces of that foe through their next actions.<br><br>(Specified stats: Turn 1 = HP, Turn 2 = Atk, Turn 3 = Spd, Turn 4 = Def, Turn 5 = Res.)<br><br>If unit initiates combat or the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res, unit deals +X damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = highest total penalties among target and foes within 2 spaces of target), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 30% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Petrify SPD','Petrify','Petrify','SID_ストーン_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Res+3. At start of turns 1 through 5, inflicts【Gravity】on foe on the enemy team with the lowest specified stat (see below), and also, inflicts Atk/Spd-7 and【Sabotage】 on that foe and foes within 2 spaces of that foe through their next actions.<br><br>(Specified stats: Turn 1 = HP, Turn 2 = Atk, Turn 3 = Spd, Turn 4 = Def, Turn 5 = Res.)<br><br>If unit initiates combat or the number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Gravity】<br>Restricts target''s movement to 1 space through its next action.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit through its next action. Calculates each stat penalty independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Petulant Lance','Petulant Lance','Petulant Lance','SID_苦労性の騎士の槍','weapon',1,null,'At start of turn, grants "unit can move 1 extra space" to unit and infantry and armored allies within 2 spaces (that turn only; does not stack).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit and neutralizes those foes'' bonuses during combat.<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Petulant Lance ATK','Petulant Lance','Petulant Lance','SID_苦労性の騎士の槍_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','At start of turn, grants "unit can move 1 extra space" to unit and infantry and armored allies within 2 spaces (that turn only; does not stack).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit and neutralizes those foes'' bonuses during combat.<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
