  ('Petulant Lance RES','Petulant Lance','Petulant Lance','SID_苦労性の騎士の槍_RES','weapon',1,'res','At start of turn, grants "unit can move 1 extra space" to unit and infantry and armored allies within 2 spaces (that turn only; does not stack).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit and neutralizes those foes'' bonuses during combat.<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Petulant Lance SKILL1','Petulant Lance','Petulant Lance','SID_苦労性の騎士の槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','At start of turn, grants "unit can move 1 extra space" to unit and infantry and armored allies within 2 spaces (that turn only; does not stack).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit and neutralizes those foes'' bonuses during combat.<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br>Enables【Canto (Rem. +1; Min ２)】.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>【Canto (Rem. +1; Min ２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn +1 (min ２; if unit used a movement skill that warped them, unit can move ２ space(s)). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
