  ('Quick Mulagir','Quick Mulagir','Quick Mulagir','SID_颯弓ミュルグレ','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd+5, foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
