  ('Quick Mulagir SKILL1','Quick Mulagir','Quick Mulagir','SID_颯弓ミュルグレ_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd+5, foe cannot counterattack.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and unit''s first attack during combat deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd, and also, if unit initiates combat and attacks, deals 7 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
