  ('Radiant Aether','Radiant Aether','Radiant Aether','SID_蒼の天空','special',null,null,'During combat, treats foe''s Def/Res as if reduced by 50%. Restores HP = 50% of damage dealt.','Sol;Luna',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,4,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Radiant Aether II','Radiant Aether II','Radiant Aether II','SID_蒼の天空・承','special',null,null,'At the start of turn 1, grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit. Treats foe''s Def/Res as if reduced by 50% during combat. Restores HP = 50% of damage dealt.','Radiant Aether',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,4,null,'offensive_special'),
  ('Radiant Aureola','Radiant Aureola','Radiant Aureola','SID_至光アーリアル','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against magic foes. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and disables foe''s effects that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" (excluding when dealing damage with an area-of-effect Special) during combat.','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'magic','random_owner'),
  ('Radiant Scrolls','Radiant Scrolls','Radiant Scrolls','SID_光炎の姉妹の忍法帖','weapon',2,null,'Enables【Canto (Rem.)】.<br><br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Unit attacks twice (even if foe initiates combat, unit attacks twice). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, deals damage = Y during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the effect of foe''s non-Special "reduces damage by X%" skills by percentage = Y × 4 during combat (Y = highest total penalties among target and foes within 2 spaces of target; example: if Y × 4 = 64, a foe with a "reduces damage by 45%" skill would reduce damage by 17% instead).<br><br>【Canto (Rem.)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn. (If unit used a movement skill that warped them, its remaining movement is 0.)<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',8,'0,8,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Raging Storm','Raging Storm','Raging Storm','SID_狂嵐','passiveb',null,null,'If unit initiates combat, grants another action to unit if unit is not adjacent to an ally after combat. (Once per turn. If a skill that moves unit after combat is used, references unit''s position after that movement occurs.) If foe uses dragonstone or beast damage and unit is not adjacent to an ally, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Raging Storm II','Raging Storm II','Raging Storm','SID_狂嵐・承','passiveb',null,null,'If unit initiates combat, grants another action to unit if unit is not adjacent to an ally after combat. (Once per turn. If a skill that moves unit after combat is used, references unit''s position after that movement occurs.) At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% or unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and also, if foe uses dragonstone or beast damage, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.','Raging Storm',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Raging Tempest','Raging Tempest','Raging Tempest','SID_真狂嵐','passiveb',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP = 100% or if any foe is within 3 columns or 3 rows centered on unit, grants "unit can move 1 extra space (that turn only; does not stack)" and【Charge】 to unit for 1 turn. If number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 1, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe during combat, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and if unit initiates combat, grants another action to unit after combat (once per turn; if a skill effect moves unit after combat, this effect occurs based on unit''s final placement after that movement).<br><br>【Charge】<br>Unit can move up to 3 spaces in any cardinal direction. (Cannot move through foes, terrain that blocks movement, or effects of skills like Obstruct. Granted movement treated as Warp movement.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
