  ('Ravager','Ravager','Ravager','SID_滅びの魔拳','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 per attack on foe and Atk/Def-6 on foe during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and also, if unit is transformed, grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack to unit during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack). If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat and foe initiates combat, reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 80% during combat ("follow-up attack" normally means only the second strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the third and fourth strikes). At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.','Adult Armored',null,true,400,'Armored','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Ravager ATK','Ravager','Ravager','SID_滅びの魔拳_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 80%, reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by an additional 25, and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Armored','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Ravager DEF','Ravager','Ravager','SID_滅びの魔拳_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 80%, reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by an additional 25, and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Armored','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Ravager RES','Ravager','Ravager','SID_滅びの魔拳_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 80%, reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by an additional 25, and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Armored','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Ravager SKILL1','Ravager','Ravager','SID_滅びの魔拳_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 80%, reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by an additional 25, and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Def+6,【Fringe Bonus】, and【Imbue】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-11 on foe, and unit deals +25 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Fringe Bonus】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest bonus on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Imbue】<br>Reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat, and restores 40% of unit''s maximum HP as unit''s combat begins for 1 turn (triggers after effects that deal damage as combat begins; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Armored','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Ravager SPD','Ravager','Ravager','SID_滅びの魔拳_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 80%, reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by an additional 25, and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Armored','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Raven King Beak','Raven King Beak','Raven King Beak','SID_鴉王の嘴爪','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, deals damage = 70% of difference between stats. (Maximum bonus of +7 damage. Combos with Phantom Spd.) At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit transforms, grants Atk+2.','Adult Flier',null,true,400,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Raven King Beak ATK','Raven King Beak','Raven King Beak','SID_鴉王の嘴爪_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit transforms, grants Atk+2.',null,null,true,400,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Raven King Beak DEF','Raven King Beak','Raven King Beak','SID_鴉王の嘴爪_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit transforms, grants Atk+2.',null,null,true,400,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Raven King Beak RES','Raven King Beak','Raven King Beak','SID_鴉王の嘴爪_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit transforms, grants Atk+2.',null,null,true,400,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Raven King Beak SKILL1','Raven King Beak','Raven King Beak','SID_鴉王の嘴爪_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit transforms, grants Atk+2.<br>If unit is transformed or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and the following effects will occur based on the value of unit''s Spd minus foe''s Spd: If ≥ 1, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per unit''s attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.) If ≥ 6, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks.',null,null,true,400,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Raven King Beak SPD','Raven King Beak','Raven King Beak','SID_鴉王の嘴爪_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Spd+3. If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.) If unit transforms, grants Atk+2.',null,null,true,400,'Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,6,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Raydream Horn','Raydream Horn','Raydream Horn','SID_夏夜の夢の角','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk+6 to unit, inflicts Atk-6 on foe during combat, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','Adult Cavalry',null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Razing Breath','Razing Breath','Razing Breath','SID_断絶のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Effective against dragon foes. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,'dragon','random_owner'),
  ('Razing Breath ATK','Razing Breath','Razing Breath','SID_断絶のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Effective against dragon foes. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,18,0,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
