  ('Razing Breath RES','Razing Breath','Razing Breath','SID_断絶のブレス_RES','weapon',1,'res','Effective against dragon foes. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,'dragon',null),
  ('Razing Breath SKILL1','Razing Breath','Razing Breath','SID_断絶のブレス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Effective against dragon foes. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = 4 + current bonus on each of unit''s stats (calculates each stat bonus independently), and also, if【Bonus】is active on unit, the following will occur based on who initiated combat: if unit initiated, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack; if foe initiated, foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
  ('Razing Breath SPD','Razing Breath','Razing Breath','SID_断絶のブレス_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Effective against dragon foes. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,3,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
  ('Realms United','Realms United','Realms United','SID_白夜と暗夜と共に','passivea',null,null,'Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-7 on foe and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 during combat (for standard attacks, "first attack" means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Rearguard','Rearguard','Rearguard','SID_守りの斧','weapon',1,null,'If foe initiates combat, grants Def+7 during combat.','Steel Axe','Rearguard Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Rearguard Lance','Rearguard Lance','Rearguard Lance','SID_狼騎士団後駆の槍','weapon',1,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Preempt Pulse】and【Atk Liberate】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit when unit deals damage to foe during combat.<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>【Atk Liberate】<br>Grants bonus to Atk during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, + 4 (max 8).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
