  ('Renewal 1','Renewal 1','Renewal','SID_回復1','passiveb',null,null,'At the start of every fourth turn, restores 10 HP.',null,'Renewal 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Renewal 2','Renewal 2','Renewal','SID_回復2','passiveb',null,null,'At the start of every third turn, restores 10 HP.','Renewal 1','Renewal 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Renewal 3','Renewal 3','Renewal','SID_回復3','passiveb',null,null,'At start of odd-numbered turns, restores 10 HP.','Renewal 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Renewed Fang','Renewed Fang','Renewed Fang','SID_賀正の人狼娘の爪牙','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit is within 2 spaces of support partner, inflicts Atk/Spd-6 on foe and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.) Grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack to support partners within 2 spaces. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 and deals +10 damage when Special triggers.','Adult Infantry',null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Renewed Fang ATK','Renewed Fang','Renewed Fang','SID_賀正の人狼娘の爪牙_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If an ally is within 3 spaces of unit, inflicts Atk/Spd-6 and Def-5 on foe, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>For certain target allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def+5, Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and Special cooldown count-2 before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when ally''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials). (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Def on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Renewed Fang DEF','Renewed Fang','Renewed Fang','SID_賀正の人狼娘の爪牙_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If an ally is within 3 spaces of unit, inflicts Atk/Spd-6 and Def-5 on foe, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>For certain target allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def+5, Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and Special cooldown count-2 before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when ally''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials). (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Def on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Renewed Fang RES','Renewed Fang','Renewed Fang','SID_賀正の人狼娘の爪牙_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If an ally is within 3 spaces of unit, inflicts Atk/Spd-6 and Def-5 on foe, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>For certain target allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def+5, Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and Special cooldown count-2 before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when ally''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials). (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Def on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Renewed Fang SKILL1','Renewed Fang','Renewed Fang','SID_賀正の人狼娘の爪牙_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If an ally is within 3 spaces of unit, inflicts Atk/Spd-6 and Def-5 on foe, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>For certain target allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def+5, Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and Special cooldown count-2 before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when ally''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials). (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Def on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def = number of foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 2, + 5 (max 11), neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Spd, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Renewed Fang SPD','Renewed Fang','Renewed Fang','SID_賀正の人狼娘の爪牙_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If an ally is within 3 spaces of unit, inflicts Atk/Spd-6 and Def-5 on foe, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>For certain target allies within 3 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def+5, Special cooldown charge +1 per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and Special cooldown count-2 before foe''s first attack during combat, and also, when ally''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials). (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Def on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
