  ('Renowned Bow SKILL1','Renowned Bow','Renowned Bow','SID_弓騎士の名弓_周','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against flying foes. Inflicts Spd-5. If unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice.<br>Inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foes within 2 spaces during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',9,'0,8,-5,0,0',null,'flying',null),
