  ('Reopening','Reopening','Reopening','SID_一新','passiveb',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk-5 on foe, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), deals damage = X% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; if unit can make a follow-up attack or if unit triggers the "unit attacks twice" effect, X = 10; otherwise, X = 20).','Guard 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Repair','Repair','Repair','SID_リペア','weapon',2,null,'Calculates damage from staff like other weapons. Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1; max cooldown count value cannot be reduced below 1). At start of turn, neutralizes any【Penalty】on unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit (excluding penalties inflicted at start of turn) and restores 20 HP to those units. Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to allies within 2 spaces during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Assault',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Repel 1','Repel 1','Repel','SID_回避・叩き込み1','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 2 (max 20%). If unit initiates combat, foe is moved 1 space away after combat.',null,'Repel 2',false,60,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Repel 2','Repel 2','Repel','SID_回避・叩き込み2','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 3 (max 30%). If unit initiates combat, foe is moved 1 space away after combat.','Repel 1','Repel 3',false,120,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Repel 3','Repel 3','Repel','SID_回避・叩き込み3','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%). If unit initiates combat, foe is moved 1 space away after combat.','Repel 2',null,false,240,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Repel 4','Repel 4','Repel','SID_回避・叩き込み4','passiveb',null,null,'Inflicts Spd/Def-4 on foe during combat. If a skill compares unit''s Spd to a foe''s or ally''s Spd, treats unit''s Spd as if granted +7. If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 5 (max 50%). If unit initiates combat, foe is moved 1 space away after combat.','Repel 3',null,false,300,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Reposition','Reposition','Reposition','SID_引き戻し','assist',1,null,'Target ally moves to opposite side of unit.',null,null,false,150,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,null,null,'random_all,random_inherit_base'),
  ('Reposition Gait','Reposition Gait','Reposition Gait','SID_引き戻し・歩法','assist',1,null,'Target ally moves to opposite side of unit.<br><br>If unit uses an Assist skill on the current turn, enables【Canto (１)】.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Reposition',null,false,400,'Infantry,  Armored',null,null,null,null,null,'random_owner'),
