  ('Resolute Blade SKILL1','Resolute Blade','Resolute Blade','SID_気鋭ワユの剣_差','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk+3. Deals +10 damage when Special triggers.<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, deals damage = 70% of difference between stats. (Maximum bonus of +7 damage. Combos with Phantom Spd.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,19,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Resolute Blade SPD','Resolute Blade','Resolute Blade','SID_気鋭ワユの剣_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Atk+3. Deals +10 damage when Special triggers.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Resolved Fang','Resolved Fang','Resolved Fang','SID_賀正の人狼王の爪牙','weapon',1,null,'Grants Def+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Def+5 to unit, inflicts Def-5 on foe during combat, and then, if unit''s Def > foe''s Def, deals damage = 70% of difference between stats. (Maximum bonus of +7 damage.)<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 and deals +10 damage when Special triggers.','Adult Infantry',null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Resolved Fang ATK','Resolved Fang','Resolved Fang','SID_賀正の人狼王の爪牙_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Def+3.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Def-5 on foe, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Def during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,16,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Resolved Fang DEF','Resolved Fang','Resolved Fang','SID_賀正の人狼王の爪牙_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Def+3.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Def-5 on foe, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Def during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,7,0',null,null,null),
  ('Resolved Fang RES','Resolved Fang','Resolved Fang','SID_賀正の人狼王の爪牙_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Def+3.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Def-5 on foe, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Def during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,0,3,4',null,null,null),
  ('Resolved Fang SKILL1','Resolved Fang','Resolved Fang','SID_賀正の人狼王の爪牙_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Def+3.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Def-5 on foe, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Def during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Def-5 on foe, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】on unit by 50% during combat.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, restores X HP to unit as unit''s combat begins (triggers after effects that deal damage as combat begins; if unit''s Def > foe''s Def, X = 20% of unit''s max HP + difference between stats × 4; otherwise, X = 20% of unit''s max HP; max 40% of unit''s max HP + damage dealt to unit as combat begins; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Resolved Fang SPD','Resolved Fang','Resolved Fang','SID_賀正の人狼王の爪牙_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Def+3.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Def-5 on foe, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Def during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,14,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Resolving Flame','Resolving Flame','Resolving Flame','SID_炎の決意','passivec',null,null,'After start-of-turn skills trigger, destroys enemy army''s Divine Vein ice effects (such as Ice or Icicle) applied on spaces within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit.<br><br>For unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X (X is highest bonus on each stat among allies on the map (including unit); calculates each stat bonus independently), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>Allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit deal +10 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Unit deals +Y damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 50% of Y (excluding area-of-effect Specials; Y = highest total bonuses among unit, foe, and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Resonance 1','Resonance 1','Resonance','SID_共鳴の黒魔法1','passiveb',null,null,'Deals damage to unit as combat begins = 20% of X (X = unit''s max HP before entering battle - 20; "max HP before entering battle" means unit''s max HP excluding HP increases from Legendary Effects, Mythic Effects, Bonus Heroes, etc.; activates only when unit can attack in combat; effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce unit''s HP below 1).<br><br>Unit deals damage = unit''s HP at start of combat - current HP, × 2 during combat (max 12, min 6; excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,'Resonance 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Resonance 2','Resonance 2','Resonance','SID_共鳴の黒魔法2','passiveb',null,null,'Deals damage to unit as combat begins = 20% of X (X = unit''s max HP before entering battle - 20; "max HP before entering battle" means unit''s max HP excluding HP increases from Legendary Effects, Mythic Effects, Bonus Heroes, etc.; activates only when unit can attack in combat; effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce unit''s HP below 1).<br><br>Unit deals damage = unit''s HP at start of combat - current HP, × 2 during combat (max 12, min 6; excluding area-of-effect Specials) and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by percentage = unit''s HP at start of combat - current HP, × 4 during combat (max 24%, min 12%; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Resonance 1','Resonance 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Resonance 3','Resonance 3','Resonance','SID_共鳴の黒魔法3','passiveb',null,null,'Deals damage to unit as combat begins = 20% of X (X = unit''s max HP before entering battle - 20; "max HP before entering battle" means unit''s max HP excluding HP increases from Legendary Effects, Mythic Effects, Bonus Heroes, etc.; activates only when unit can attack in combat; effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce unit''s HP below 1).<br><br>Unit deals damage = unit''s HP at start of combat - current HP, × 2 during combat (max 12, min 6; excluding area-of-effect Specials) and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by percentage = unit''s HP at start of combat - current HP, × 7 during combat (max 42%, min 21%; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Resonance 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Resonance 4','Resonance 4','Resonance','SID_共鳴の黒魔法4','passiveb',null,null,'Deals damage to unit as combat begins = 20% of X (X = unit''s max HP before entering battle - 20; "max HP before entering battle" means unit''s max HP excluding HP increases from Legendary Effects, Mythic Effects, Bonus Heroes, etc.; activates only when unit can attack in combat; effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce unit''s HP below 1).<br><br>Inflicts Spd/Res-4 on foe during combat.<br><br>Unit deals damage = unit''s HP at start of combat - current HP, × 2 during combat (max 12, min 6; excluding area-of-effect Specials) and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by percentage = unit''s HP at start of combat - current HP, × 10 during combat (max 60%, min 30%; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Resonance 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
