  ('Respite Plus SKILL1','Respite+','Respite+','SID_サンクチュアリ＋_神','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Def/Res+2 and “inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack” to allies within 2 spaces of unit during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br>Calculates damage from staff like other weapons.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
