  ('Reversal Axe','Reversal Axe','Reversal Axe','SID_強化反転の斧','weapon',1,null,'If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2 (calculates each stat penalty independently; example: if foe has +7 bonus to Atk, inflicts Atk-14, for a net penalty of Atk-7).','Steel Axe','Reversal Axe Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
