  ('Rite of Souls','Rite of Souls','Rite of Souls','SID_魂の秘儀','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, inflicts【Guard】on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit with Res < unit''s Res. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat through its next action. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Rite of Souls ATK','Rite of Souls','Rite of Souls','SID_魂の秘儀_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts【Guard】,【Discord】, and【Res Shackle】 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit with Res < unit''s Res+5 through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (including area-of-effect Specials), foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe during combat.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Rite of Souls DEF','Rite of Souls','Rite of Souls','SID_魂の秘儀_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts【Guard】,【Discord】, and【Res Shackle】 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit with Res < unit''s Res+5 through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (including area-of-effect Specials), foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe during combat.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Rite of Souls RES','Rite of Souls','Rite of Souls','SID_魂の秘儀_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts【Guard】,【Discord】, and【Res Shackle】 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit with Res < unit''s Res+5 through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (including area-of-effect Specials), foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe during combat.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,null),
  ('Rite of Souls SKILL1','Rite of Souls','Rite of Souls','SID_魂の秘儀_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts【Guard】,【Discord】, and【Res Shackle】 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit with Res < unit''s Res+5 through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (including area-of-effect Specials), foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe during combat.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 5 + 10% of unit''s Res at start of combat, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Rite of Souls SPD','Rite of Souls','Rite of Souls','SID_魂の秘儀_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts【Guard】,【Discord】, and【Res Shackle】 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit with Res < unit''s Res+5 through their next actions.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (including area-of-effect Specials), foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe during combat.<br><br>【Guard】<br>Inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on unit per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Rockslide Dance 1','Rockslide Dance 1','Rockslide Dance','SID_疾風大地の舞い1','passiveb',null,null,'If Sing or Dance is used, grants Spd+2 and Def+3 to target.','Gale Dance 1;Earth Dance 1','Rockslide Dance 2',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Rockslide Dance 2','Rockslide Dance 2','Rockslide Dance','SID_疾風大地の舞い2','passiveb',null,null,'If Sing or Dance is used, grants Spd+3 and Def+4 to target.','Rockslide Dance 1',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Rockslide Dance 3','Rockslide Dance 3','Rockslide Dance','SID_疾風大地の舞い3','passiveb',null,null,'If Sing or Dance is used, enables【Canto (１)】 on unit and grants Spd/Def+6 and【Dodge】 to target ally for 1 turn.<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).','Rockslide Dance 2',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Rogue Dagger','Rogue Dagger','Rogue Dagger','SID_盗賊の暗器','weapon',2,null,'After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-3 on foe through its next action. Grants unit Def/Res+3 for 1 turn.','Steel Dagger','Rogue Dagger Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',4,'0,4,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
