  ('Sea-Sear Lance','Sea-Sear Lance','Sea-Sear Lance','SID_炎海の灼槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe during combat, and also, if foe can make a follow-up attack, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 75%.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Seafoam Splitter','Seafoam Splitter','Seafoam Splitter','SID_蒼海割る裂帛の斧','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if number of allies adjacent to unit ≤ 2, grants "unit can move 1 extra space" to unit (that turn only; does not stack). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat.','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
