  ('Selenas Blade SKILL1','Selena''s Blade','Selena''s Blade','SID_ルーナの鋭剣_奥','weapon',1,'skill1','Effective against armored foes. At start of combat, if foe''s Atk ≥ unit''s Atk+3, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+3 during combat.<br>Deals +10 damage when Special triggers.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,'armored',null),
