  ('Serpentine Staff','Serpentine Staff','Serpentine Staff','SID_蛇の杖','weapon',2,null,'Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to and inflicts【Deep Wounds】on target.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Assault','Serpentine Staff Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Serpentine Staff Plus','Serpentine Staff+','Serpentine Staff+','SID_蛇の杖＋','weapon',2,null,'Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to and inflicts【Deep Wounds】on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.','Serpentine Staff',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Serpentine Staff Plus SKILL1','Serpentine Staff+','Serpentine Staff+','SID_蛇の杖＋_神','weapon',2,'skill1','Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to and inflicts【Deep Wounds】on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.<br>Calculates damage from staff like other weapons.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Serpentine Staff Plus SKILL2','Serpentine Staff+','Serpentine Staff+','SID_蛇の杖＋_幻','weapon',2,'skill2','Foe cannot recover HP during or after combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 7 damage to and inflicts【Deep Wounds】on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.<br>Foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Serpents Fang','Serpent''s Fang','Serpent''s Fang','SID_世界蛇の神牙','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Foes with Range = 1 cannot warp into spaces within 3 spaces of unit and foes with Range = 2 cannot warp into spaces within 4 spaces of unit (in either case, does not affect foes with Pass skills or warp effects from structures, like camps and fortresses in Rival Domains).<br><br>For unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X (for unit, X = 15; for allies, X = 5), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack), and also, if unit''s or ally''s Def ≥ foe''s Def+5, disables unit''s and foe''s or ally''s and foe''s skills that change attack priority during combat.<br><br>Unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (including area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 (including area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.','Adult Armored',null,true,400,'Armored','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Serving Knife','Serving Knife','Serving Knife','SID_給仕のナイフ','weapon',1,null,'If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit, grants another action to unit (once per turn; if another effect that grants action to unit has been activated at the same time, this effect is also considered to have been triggered).<br><br>If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit or targets unit, grants【Incited】and "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)" to allies within 2 spaces of both unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally after movement for 1 turn (including unit and target).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit deals +X × 5 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of Bonus effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses + number of Penalty effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties; max 5).<br><br>【Incited】<br>If unit initiates combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of spaces from start position to end position of unit during combat (max 3; that turn only).','Steel Sword','Serving Knife Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Serving Knife Plus','Serving Knife+','Serving Knife+','SID_給仕のナイフ＋','weapon',1,null,'If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit, grants another action to unit (once per turn; if another effect that grants action to unit has been activated at the same time, this effect is also considered to have been triggered).<br><br>If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit or targets unit, grants【Incited】and "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)" to allies within 2 spaces of both unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally after movement for 1 turn (including unit and target).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit deals +X × 5 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of Bonus effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses + number of Penalty effects active on foe, excluding stat penalties; max 5).<br><br>【Incited】<br>If unit initiates combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of spaces from start position to end position of unit during combat (max 3; that turn only).','Serving Knife',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
