  ('Setsunas Yumi','Setsuna''s Yumi','Setsuna''s Yumi','SID_セツナの緩弓','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes. If foe uses bow, dagger, magic, or staff, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
