  ('Shadow Shift 2','Shadow Shift 2','Shadow Shift','SID_影助・引き戻し2','passivec',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 50%, when Canto triggers, enables unit to use【Reposition】on ally (this effect is not treated as an Assist skill; if similar effects are active, this effect does not trigger).<br><br>【Reposition】<br>Range = 1. Target moves to opposite side of unit.','Shadow Shift 1','Shadow Shift 3',false,120,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
