  ('Shadow Shove 1','Shadow Shove 1','Shadow Shove','SID_影助・体当たり1','passivec',null,null,'If unit''s HP = 100%, when Canto triggers, enables unit to use【Shove】on ally (this effect is not treated as an Assist skill; if similar effects are active, this effect does not trigger).<br><br>【Shove】<br>Range = 1. Pushes target ally 1 space away.',null,'Shadow Shove 2',false,60,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
