  ('Shadow Smite 4','Shadow Smite 4','Shadow Smite','SID_影助・ぶちかまし4','passivec',null,null,'When Canto triggers, enables unit to use 【Smite】on ally (this effect is not treated as an Assist skill; if similar effects are active, this effect does not trigger).<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+3 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Smite】<br>Range = 1. Pushes target ally 2 spaces away.','Shadow Smite 3',null,false,300,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
