  ('Sharp War Sword','Sharp War Sword','Sharp War Sword','SID_戦神の鋭剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If a skill compares unit''s Spd to a foe''s or ally''s Spd, treats unit''s Spd as if granted +10. At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants【Null Follow-Up】and【Dodge】to unit for 1 turn. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Shatter Slash','Shatter Slash','Shatter Slash','SID_ブレイクラッシュ','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by 80% of the greater of unit''s Spd or Def when Special triggers.<br><br>Inflicts penalty on foe’s Atk/Def = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target (calculates each stat penalty independently) and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).','Ignis',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,null,4,null,'offensive_special,random_owner'),
  ('Shatterproof','Shatterproof','Shatterproof','SID_金剛不壊','passivea',null,null,'Grants Atk/Def+8. Inflicts Res-8.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, neutralizes【Panic】and any penalties to unit''s Atk/Def that take effect on unit at that time.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.','Solid Ground 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,8,0,8,-8',null,null,'random_owner'),
