  ('Silence Ward 1','Silence Ward 1','Silence Ward','SID_サイレスガード1','passivec',null,null,'For allies within 2 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Res+1 and neutralizes effects that prevent ally''s counterattacks during combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+1 to unit and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat.',null,'Silence Ward 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Silence Ward 2','Silence Ward 2','Silence Ward','SID_サイレスガード2','passivec',null,null,'For allies within 2 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Res+2 and neutralizes effects that prevent ally''s counterattacks during combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+2 to unit and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat.','Silence Ward 1','Silence Ward 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Silence Ward 3','Silence Ward 3','Silence Ward','SID_サイレスガード3','passivec',null,null,'For allies within 2 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Res+3 and neutralizes effects that prevent ally''s counterattacks during combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+3 to unit and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat.','Silence Ward 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Silence Ward 4','Silence Ward 4','Silence Ward','SID_サイレスガード4','passivec',null,null,'For allies within 2 spaces of unit, grants Atk/Res+4 and neutralizes effects that prevent ally''s counterattacks during combat, and also, if ally''s attack can trigger ally''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-1 to ally before ally''s first attack during combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+4 to unit and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat, and also, if unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.','Silence Ward 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Flying','Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Silent Breath','Silent Breath','Silent Breath','SID_透魔竜のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe (X = current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2; example: if foe has +7 bonus to Spd, inflicts Spd-14, for a net penalty of Spd-7; calculates each stat penalty independently), deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s first attacks by 7 during combat ("follow-up attack" normally means only the second strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the third and fourth strikes). If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Silent Power','Silent Power','Silent Power','SID_透魔竜の力','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. Unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of support partner. At start of turn, if unit is within 3 spaces of support partner, grants【Null Follow-Up】to unit and that ally for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 during combat. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.','Water Breath',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Silent Yule Knife','Silent Yule Knife','Silent Yule Knife','SID_見えざる聖夜の刃','weapon',2,null,'Enables【Canto (Dist.; Max ３)】.<br><br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 9 - number of allies adjacent to unit × 2 (min 0), neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by percentage = X × 30 and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by percentage = X × 30 during combat (X = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat, max 3; if any space within 2 spaces of unit has a Divine Vein effect applied or counts as difficult terrain, excluding impassable terrain, value is treated as 3; "first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes). After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-7 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.<br><br>【Canto (Dist.; Max ３)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = number of spaces from start position to end position unit moved prior to taking action (max ３).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Silver Dagger',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Silesse Frost','Silesse Frost','Silesse Frost','SID_シレジアの氷晶','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit is within 2 spaces of support partner and initiates combat, unit attacks twice.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Silesse Frost ATK','Silesse Frost','Silesse Frost','SID_シレジアの氷晶_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3.<br>Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit is within 4 spaces of a certain target ally, unit attacks twice during combat. (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Spd on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Silesse Frost DEF','Silesse Frost','Silesse Frost','SID_シレジアの氷晶_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3.<br>Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit is within 4 spaces of a certain target ally, unit attacks twice during combat. (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Spd on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Silesse Frost RES','Silesse Frost','Silesse Frost','SID_シレジアの氷晶_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Atk+3.<br>Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit is within 4 spaces of a certain target ally, unit attacks twice during combat. (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Spd on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,19,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Silesse Frost SKILL1','Silesse Frost','Silesse Frost','SID_シレジアの氷晶_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk+3.<br>Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit is within 4 spaces of a certain target ally, unit attacks twice during combat. (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Spd on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6, "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and【Dodge】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 10% of unit''s Spd at start of combat + 5 and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,19,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Silesse Frost SPD','Silesse Frost','Silesse Frost','SID_シレジアの氷晶_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Atk+3.<br>Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit is within 4 spaces of a certain target ally, unit attacks twice during combat. (If support partner is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Spd on player team, excluding unit.)<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,null,null),
