  ('Snaking Sword','Snaking Sword','Snaking Sword','SID_巳年の神蛇の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Allies within 2 spaces of unit can move to any space within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>If unit has entered combat or used an Assist skill during the current turn, allies can move to a space within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 3, + 5 (max 14), deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 20% of unit''s Spd during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Sneering Axe','Sneering Axe','Sneering Axe','SID_笑面の斧','weapon',1,null,'Inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2. (Example: if foe has +7 bonus to Atk, inflicts Atk-14, for a net penalty of Atk-7.) Calculates each stat penalty independently. After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Panic】<br>on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
