  ('Solemn Axe','Solemn Axe','Solemn Axe','SID_荘厳なる祝福の聖斧','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s attack can trigger their Special, the following effects will occur based on foe''s HP at start of combat: if ≥ 20%, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40%; and if ≥ 40%, reduces foe''s Atk/Spd by 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat, -8 (max 10, min 0); and if ≥ 60%, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
