  ('Solitary Dream','Solitary Dream','Solitary Dream','SID_ひとりぼっちのゆめ','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and unit can move 1 extra space. (That turn only. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Songful Essence','Songful Essence','Songful Essence','SID_うたうせいひつ','assist',2,null,'Grants another action to target ally, and if Canto has already been triggered by target ally, re-enables Canto.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Draconic Hex】and【Preempt Pulse】to unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of turn, grants "unit can move 1 extra space" (that turn only; does not stack) to target allies within 3 spaces of unit (if support partner other than cavalry with a Range = 2 is on player team, targets any support partner; otherwise, targets ally with the highest Atk at start of battle, excluding unit and cavalry allies with Range = 2; "at start of battle" excludes increases to Atk granted after ally is deployed, such as Legendary Effects, Mythic Effects, Bonus Heroes, Great Talent, etc.).<br><br>(Cannot target an ally with Sing or Dance. This skill treated as Sing or Dance.)<br><br>【Draconic Hex】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on foe during combat and inflicts penalty on each of those stats = 5 - current penalty on each of those stats during combat for 1 turn (min 0; calculates each stat penalty independently).<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.','Sing',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sonic Sword','Sonic Sword','Sonic Sword','SID_ソニックソード','weapon',1,null,'Effective against flying foes. Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and unit deals +20 damage during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>――――――― Range: 2 Style ―――――――<br>Unit can attack foes 2 spaces away (unit cannot attack adjacent foes).<br><br>Cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of foe that has triggered the Bulwark effect (does not apply if unit has a Pass skill). Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 1, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br>After-combat movement effects do not occur.<br>Skill effect''s Range is treated as 1. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,'flying',null)
