  ('Sonic Sword ATK','Sonic Sword','Sonic Sword','SID_ソニックソード_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Effective against flying foes. Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and unit deals +20 damage during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>――――――― Range: 2 Style ―――――――<br>Unit can attack foes 2 spaces away (unit cannot attack adjacent foes).<br><br>Cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of foe that has triggered the Bulwark effect (does not apply if unit has a Pass skill). Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 1, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br>After-combat movement effects do not occur.<br>Skill effect''s Range is treated as 1. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,18,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Sonic Sword DEF','Sonic Sword','Sonic Sword','SID_ソニックソード_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Effective against flying foes. Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and unit deals +20 damage during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>――――――― Range: 2 Style ―――――――<br>Unit can attack foes 2 spaces away (unit cannot attack adjacent foes).<br><br>Cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of foe that has triggered the Bulwark effect (does not apply if unit has a Pass skill). Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 1, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br>After-combat movement effects do not occur.<br>Skill effect''s Range is treated as 1. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,4,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Sonic Sword RES','Sonic Sword','Sonic Sword','SID_ソニックソード_RES','weapon',1,'res','Effective against flying foes. Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and unit deals +20 damage during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>――――――― Range: 2 Style ―――――――<br>Unit can attack foes 2 spaces away (unit cannot attack adjacent foes).<br><br>Cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of foe that has triggered the Bulwark effect (does not apply if unit has a Pass skill). Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 1, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br>After-combat movement effects do not occur.<br>Skill effect''s Range is treated as 1. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,'flying',null),
  ('Sonic Sword SKILL1','Sonic Sword','Sonic Sword','SID_ソニックソード_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Effective against flying foes. Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and unit deals +20 damage during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>――――――― Range: 2 Style ―――――――<br>Unit can attack foes 2 spaces away (unit cannot attack adjacent foes).<br><br>Cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of foe that has triggered the Bulwark effect (does not apply if unit has a Pass skill). Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 1, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br>After-combat movement effects do not occur.<br>Skill effect''s Range is treated as 1. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.<br>Enables【Canto (Rem. +1; Min ２)】.<br><br>For unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 and neutralizes penalties during combat, and if unit''s or ally''s Spd > foe''s Spd, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s or ally''s follow-up attacks.<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (Rem. +1; Min ２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn +1 (min ２; if unit used a movement skill that warped them, unit can move ２ space(s)). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Sonic Sword SPD','Sonic Sword','Sonic Sword','SID_ソニックソード_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Effective against flying foes. Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, and unit deals +20 damage during combat (including area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>――――――― Range: 2 Style ―――――――<br>Unit can attack foes 2 spaces away (unit cannot attack adjacent foes).<br><br>Cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of foe that has triggered the Bulwark effect (does not apply if unit has a Pass skill). Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 1, foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range, or foe''s Range is the same as the distance between unit and foe.<br>After-combat movement effects do not occur.<br>Skill effect''s Range is treated as 1. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,0,0',null,'flying',null),
  ('Soothing Scent','Soothing Scent','Soothing Scent','SID_影潜む密偵の香水瓶','weapon',2,null,'Enables【Canto (Ally 2)】.<br><br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, foe cannot counterattack. If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat and unit attacks, after combat, deals 10 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Canto (Ally 2)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces.<br><br>(Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Granted movement treated as Warp movement.)','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Sorcery Blade 1','Sorcery Blade 1','Sorcery Blade','SID_魔道の刃1','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP = 100% and unit is adjacent to a magic ally, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,'Sorcery Blade 2',false,60,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sorcery Blade 2','Sorcery Blade 2','Sorcery Blade','SID_魔道の刃2','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 50% and unit is adjacent to a magic ally, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Sorcery Blade 1','Sorcery Blade 3',false,120,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sorcery Blade 3','Sorcery Blade 3','Sorcery Blade','SID_魔道の刃3','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit is adjacent to a magic ally, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Sorcery Blade 2',null,false,240,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sothiss Wrath','Sothis''s Wrath','Sothis''s Wrath','SID_神祖の怒り','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts【Panic】, 【Spd Shackle】, and【Res Shackle】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>―――――― Sothis''s Wrath Style ――――――<br>Unit can attack foes 3 spaces away (unit cannot attack foes 2 spaces away).<br><br>Unit deals +10 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Cannot move through spaces within 3 spaces of foe that has triggered the Bulwark effect (does not apply if unit has a Pass skill). Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 2 or foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range.<br><br>After-combat movement effects do not occur.<br>Skill effect''s Range is treated as 2. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties.<br><br>【Spd Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Spd during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Soul of Zofia','Soul of Zofia','Soul of Zofia','SID_ソフィアの魂','passiveb',null,null,'Neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks or prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. If unit''s HP ≤ 75% and unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Soul of Zofia II','Soul of Zofia II','Soul of Zofia','SID_ソフィアの魂・承','passiveb',null,null,'Neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat. If unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Spd-5 on foe and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (example: a foe with a "reduce damage by 45%" skill would reduce damage by 23% instead).','Soul of Zofia',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Soulful Lance','Soulful Lance','Soulful Lance','SID_強面の怖槍','weapon',1,null,'For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes penalties on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Soulful Lance ATK','Soulful Lance','Soulful Lance','SID_強面の怖槍_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes penalties on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Soulful Lance DEF','Soulful Lance','Soulful Lance','SID_強面の怖槍_DEF','weapon',1,'def','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes penalties on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Soulful Lance RES','Soulful Lance','Soulful Lance','SID_強面の怖槍_RES','weapon',1,'res','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes penalties on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Soulful Lance SKILL1','Soulful Lance','Soulful Lance','SID_強面の怖槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes penalties on unit during combat.<br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Soulful Lance SPD','Soulful Lance','Soulful Lance','SID_強面の怖槍_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes penalties on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Sparking Tome','Sparking Tome','Sparking Tome','SID_慕炎の書','weapon',2,null,'Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, inflicts Spd/Res-6 on foe during combat and inflicts penalty on foe''s Spd/Res during combat = current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2. (Example: if foe has +7 bonus to Spd, inflicts Spd-20, for a net penalty of Spd-13.) Calculates each stat penalty independently.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sparking Tome ATK','Sparking Tome','Sparking Tome','SID_慕炎の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, inflicts Atk-5 and Spd/Res-6 on foe, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2 (calculates each stat penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 25 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow- ups), triggers【Potent Follow X%】during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Sparking Tome DEF','Sparking Tome','Sparking Tome','SID_慕炎の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, inflicts Atk-5 and Spd/Res-6 on foe, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2 (calculates each stat penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 25 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow- ups), triggers【Potent Follow X%】during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Sparking Tome RES','Sparking Tome','Sparking Tome','SID_慕炎の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, inflicts Atk-5 and Spd/Res-6 on foe, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2 (calculates each stat penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 25 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow- ups), triggers【Potent Follow X%】during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,3,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Sparking Tome SKILL1','Sparking Tome','Sparking Tome','SID_慕炎の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, inflicts Atk-5 and Spd/Res-6 on foe, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2 (calculates each stat penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 25 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow- ups), triggers【Potent Follow X%】during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and "reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special ''reduce damage by X%'' skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials)" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Spd/Res-5 on foe, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Sparking Tome SPD','Sparking Tome','Sparking Tome','SID_慕炎の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 50% at start of combat, inflicts Atk-5 and Spd/Res-6 on foe, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2 (calculates each stat penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat, and also, if decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 25 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow- ups), triggers【Potent Follow X%】during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,5,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Sparkling Boost','Sparkling Boost','Sparkling Boost','SID_生命の輝き','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, restores 10 HP to ally that has been dealt the most damage. (Excludes unit.)',null,'Sparkling Boost Plus',true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sparkling Boost Plus','Sparkling Boost+','Sparkling Boost','SID_生命の輝き・神','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, restores 20 HP to ally that has been dealt the most damage. (Excludes unit.) At start of any ally''s combat, if ally''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Res+5 to ally during combat. (Excludes unit.)','Sparkling Boost',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sparkling Fang','Sparkling Fang','Sparkling Fang','SID_賀正の妹猫の爪牙','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, grants Special cooldown charge +1 per unit''s attack (only highest value applied; does not stack) and deals +5 damage to foe per unit''s attack, including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or if unit is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, and if unit initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','Adult Cavalry',null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Sparkling Sun','Sparkling Sun','Sparkling Sun','SID_真夏の生命の輝き','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-X on foe (X = 30% of unit''s HP at start of combat + 6; max 18) and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, reduces damage from area-of-effect Specials by 75% (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and restores 10 HP to unit after combat, and also, if foe can make a follow-up attack during combat, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 75%.','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
