  ('Spd Smoke 4','Spd Smoke 4','Spd Smoke','SID_速さの紫煙4','passivec',null,null,'After combat, inflicts Spd-7 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions, and grants Spd+6 and【Dodge】 to unit for 1 turn.<br><br>【Dodge】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).','Spd Smoke 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
