  ('Spear of Shadow SKILL1','Spear of Shadow','Spear of Shadow','SID_影の英雄の槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, neutralizes unit''s penalties, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def-5 on foe, and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, when unit deals damage to foe, restores 7 HP to unit (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
