  ('Speedtaker 1','Speedtaker 1','Speedtaker','SID_速さの吸収1','passiveb',null,null,'At start of turn, grants Spd【Great Talent】+1 to unit.<br><br>After combat, if unit attacked, grants Spd【Great Talent】+1 to unit.<br><br>Deals damage = 5% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>(This skill grants max of【Great Talent】+5.)<br><br>【Great Talent】<br>Adds value of Great Talent (+X) to specified stats (until end of battle; max value of X is determined by the stat reaching the limit of 99, each stat calculated separately and cannot exceed max value for each skill; stat increases are not treated as Bonus effects).',null,'Speedtaker 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
