  ('Spirit Breath','Spirit Breath','Spirit Breath','SID_精霊のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Grants Def+3. If unit initiates combat and unit''s Def ≥ foe''s Def+5, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Spirit Breath ATK','Spirit Breath','Spirit Breath','SID_精霊のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Def+3. At start of combat, if unit''s Def > foe''s Def or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk+5 to unit and inflicts Atk-5 on foe during combat, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,18,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Spirit Breath DEF','Spirit Breath','Spirit Breath','SID_精霊のブレス_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Def+3. At start of combat, if unit''s Def > foe''s Def or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk+5 to unit and inflicts Atk-5 on foe during combat, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,0,7,0',null,null,null),
  ('Spirit Breath RES','Spirit Breath','Spirit Breath','SID_精霊のブレス_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Def+3. At start of combat, if unit''s Def > foe''s Def or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk+5 to unit and inflicts Atk-5 on foe during combat, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,0,3,4',null,null,null),
  ('Spirit Breath SKILL1','Spirit Breath','Spirit Breath','SID_精霊のブレス_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Def+3. At start of combat, if unit''s Def > foe''s Def or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk+5 to unit and inflicts Atk-5 on foe during combat, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk+5 to unit and inflicts Atk-5 on foe during combat, and also, if foe initiates combat, reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 70% ("follow-up attack" normally means only the second strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the third and\nfourth strikes).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Spirit Breath SPD','Spirit Breath','Spirit Breath','SID_精霊のブレス_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Def+3. At start of combat, if unit''s Def > foe''s Def or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk+5 to unit and inflicts Atk-5 on foe during combat, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,16,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Spirit Forest Writ','Spirit Forest Writ','Spirit Forest Writ','SID_精霊の森の秘本','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Effective against dragon foes. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res," and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res during combat = 80% of difference between Res stats at start of combat. (Maximum penalty of -12.)','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'dragon','random_owner'),
  ('Spirit Forest Writ ATK','Spirit Forest Writ','Spirit Forest Writ','SID_精霊の森の秘本_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Effective against dragon foes.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res during combat = difference between Res stats at start of combat (max 16).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,'dragon',null),
  ('Spirit Forest Writ DEF','Spirit Forest Writ','Spirit Forest Writ','SID_精霊の森の秘本_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Effective against dragon foes.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res during combat = difference between Res stats at start of combat (max 16).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,'dragon',null),
  ('Spirit Forest Writ RES','Spirit Forest Writ','Spirit Forest Writ','SID_精霊の森の秘本_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Effective against dragon foes.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res during combat = difference between Res stats at start of combat (max 16).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,'dragon',null),
  ('Spirit Forest Writ SKILL1','Spirit Forest Writ','Spirit Forest Writ','SID_精霊の森の秘本_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Effective against dragon foes.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res during combat = difference between Res stats at start of combat (max 16).<br>At start of turn, and at start of enemy phase (except for in Summoner Duels), if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6 and "neutralizes unit''s penalties during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn, and also, for unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>For allies within 2 spaces of unit, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value after combat, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat, and also, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'dragon',null),
  ('Spirit Forest Writ SPD','Spirit Forest Writ','Spirit Forest Writ','SID_精霊の森の秘本_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Effective against dragon foes.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res at start of combat, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res during combat = difference between Res stats at start of combat (max 16).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,'dragon',null),
  ('Spirited Axe','Spirited Axe','Spirited Axe','SID_士気旺盛の斧','weapon',1,null,'If【Bonus】is active on unit, grants Atk/Def+4 and Special cooldown charge +1 per foe''s attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack. Special cooldown charge granted even if foe''s attack deals 0 damage.)<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','Steel Axe','Spirited Axe Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
