  ('Splashy Bucket','Splashy Bucket','Splashy Bucket','SID_神泉の風呂桶','weapon',2,null,'Effective against dragon foes. Disables foe''s skills that "calculate damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res" and "calculate damage from staff like other weapons." After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-5 on foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.','Steel Dagger','Splashy Bucket Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
