  ('Spooky Lantern','Spooky Lantern','Spooky Lantern','SID_妖精の悪戯の明かり','weapon',2,null,'Enables【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】. Grants Spd+3.<br><br>At start of turn, grants【Canto (１)】 to allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>For allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd+5, neutralizes penalties on ally, and ally deals +10 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials) during combat, and restores 7 HP to ally after combat.<br><br>If there is an ally within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 3, + 5 (max 14), unit deals +10 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 10 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>【Canto (Rem.; Min １)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move spaces = any movement not already used that turn (min. １; if unit used a movement skill that warped them, unit can move １ space(s)). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Spring Dawning','Spring Dawning','Spring Dawning','SID_春暁の優しき光','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants 【Empathy】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>After start-of-turn effects trigger on player phase, and after start-of-turn effects trigger on enemy phase (except for in Summoner Duels), for unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit, converts stat penalties into bonuses and neutralizes two Penalty effects (does not apply to Penalty effects that are applied at the same time; neutralizes the first applicable Penalty effects on unit''s or ally''s list of active effects).<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and deals damage = unit''s max Special cooldown count value × 12 when Special triggers during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>―――― Spring Dawning Style ――――<br>Unit can attack foes 3 spaces away (unit cannot attack foes 2 spaces away).<br><br>Unit deals +10 damage and neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from non-Special skills when unit''s Special triggers during combat (excluding when dealing damage with an area-of-effect Special).<br><br>Cannot move through spaces within 3 spaces of foe that has triggered the Bulwark effect (does not apply if unit has a Pass skill). Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 2 or foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range.<br><br>After-combat movement effects do not occur. Skill effect''s Range is treated as 2. This Style can be used only once per turn.<br>――――――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Empathy】<br>Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of types of Bonus effects, excluding stat bonuses, and Penalty effects, excluding stat penalties, active on player team and enemy team during combat (max 7).<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Spring Hare Egg','Spring Hare Egg','Spring Hare Egg','SID_春兎の卵','weapon',2,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Res+6,【Preempt Pulse】, and "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 10 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.','Elwind','Spring Hare Egg Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',8,'0,8,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Spring Hare Egg Plus','Spring Hare Egg+','Spring Hare Egg+','SID_春兎の卵＋','weapon',2,null,'At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Res+6,【Preempt Pulse】, and "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 10 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.','Spring Hare Egg',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Spring Hare Egg Plus ATK','Spring Hare Egg+','Spring Hare Egg+','SID_春兎の卵＋_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Res+6,【Preempt Pulse】, and "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 10 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Preempt Pulse】<br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',12,'2,13,0,0,0',null,null,null),
