  ('Spy-Song Bow SKILL1','Spy-Song Bow','Spy-Song Bow','SID_邪な曲弓_邪','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If foe''s Def ≥ foe''s Res+5, deals +7 damage.<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of two allies in a support-partner pair (excluding unit), grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 5 HP to unit. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'flying',null),
