  ('Staff of Twelve Plus SKILL1','Staff of Twelve+','Staff of Twelve+','SID_聖祭の杖＋_神','weapon',2,'skill1','At start of turn, restores 10 HP to ally that has been dealt the most damage. (Excludes unit.)<br>Calculates damage from staff like other weapons.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
