  ('Stark Naglfar','Stark Naglfar','Stark Naglfar','SID_黒白ナグルファル','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>At start of turn, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts【Atk Shackle】, 【Res Shackle】, and【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>As combat begins, deals damage to foe = X% of the greater of unit''s or foe''s Atk (if unit has weapon-triangle advantage or if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, X = 40; otherwise, X = 20; activates only when unit can attack in combat; effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1).<br><br>Grants Atk/Def/Res+16 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Atk Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br><br>【Res Shackle】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Res during combat = number of Penalty effects active on unit + 4, excluding stat penalties (max 8).<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5).','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Starlight Stone','Starlight Stone','Starlight Stone','SID_星夜の魔術師の竜石','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk+6 to unit and inflicts Atk-6 on foe during combat, inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), restores 7 HP to unit when unit deals damage to foe during combat (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt), and also, if foe can make a follow-up attack, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 75%. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Starpoint Lance','Starpoint Lance','Starpoint Lance','SID_海角の星槍','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. During unit''s first combat in player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and restores 10 HP to unit after combat.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Starpoint Lance ATK','Starpoint Lance','Starpoint Lance','SID_海角の星槍_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and if it is unit''s first combat initiated by foe or first combat initiated by unit that turn, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 80% during combat, otherwise, by 40% (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Restores 10 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,18,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Starpoint Lance DEF','Starpoint Lance','Starpoint Lance','SID_海角の星槍_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and if it is unit''s first combat initiated by foe or first combat initiated by unit that turn, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 80% during combat, otherwise, by 40% (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Restores 10 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,3,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Starpoint Lance RES','Starpoint Lance','Starpoint Lance','SID_海角の星槍_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and if it is unit''s first combat initiated by foe or first combat initiated by unit that turn, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 80% during combat, otherwise, by 40% (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Restores 10 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,3,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Starpoint Lance SKILL1','Starpoint Lance','Starpoint Lance','SID_海角の星槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and if it is unit''s first combat initiated by foe or first combat initiated by unit that turn, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 80% during combat, otherwise, by 40% (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Restores 10 HP to unit after combat.<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an armored ally, an infantry ally with Range = 1, or a flying ally with Range = 1, grants Atk/Spd+6, "unit can move 1 extra space (that turn only; does not stack),"【Canto (１)】, and "Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)" to unit and those allies for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and unit deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Starpoint Lance SPD','Starpoint Lance','Starpoint Lance','SID_海角の星槍_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and if it is unit''s first combat initiated by foe or first combat initiated by unit that turn, reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 80% during combat, otherwise, by 40% (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Restores 10 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,6,0,0',null,null,null),
