  ('Stoutheart Lance','Stoutheart Lance','Stoutheart Lance','SID_自信家の長槍','weapon',1,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = current penalty on each of those stats × 2, + 4; example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+18, for a net bonus of Atk+11 during combat; calculates each stat bonus independently), and the following effects will occur based on unit''s HP at start of combat: if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack; if unit''s HP ≥ 75%, deals +7 damage during combat as well (except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
