  ('Stoutheart Lance DEF','Stoutheart Lance','Stoutheart Lance','SID_自信家の長槍_DEF','weapon',1,'def','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = current penalty on each of those stats × 2, + 4; example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+18, for a net bonus of Atk+11 during combat; calculates each stat bonus independently), and the following effects will occur based on unit''s HP at start of combat: if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack; if unit''s HP ≥ 75%, deals +7 damage during combat as well (except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Stoutheart Lance RES','Stoutheart Lance','Stoutheart Lance','SID_自信家の長槍_RES','weapon',1,'res','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = current penalty on each of those stats × 2, + 4; example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+18, for a net bonus of Atk+11 during combat; calculates each stat bonus independently), and the following effects will occur based on unit''s HP at start of combat: if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack; if unit''s HP ≥ 75%, deals +7 damage during combat as well (except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Stoutheart Lance SKILL1','Stoutheart Lance','Stoutheart Lance','SID_自信家の長槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = current penalty on each of those stats × 2, + 4; example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+18, for a net bonus of Atk+11 during combat; calculates each stat bonus independently), and the following effects will occur based on unit''s HP at start of combat: if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack; if unit''s HP ≥ 75%, deals +7 damage during combat as well (except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials).<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40%, and foe cannot make a follow-up attack during combat, and also, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Stoutheart Lance SPD','Stoutheart Lance','Stoutheart Lance','SID_自信家の長槍_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = current penalty on each of those stats × 2, + 4; example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+18, for a net bonus of Atk+11 during combat; calculates each stat bonus independently), and the following effects will occur based on unit''s HP at start of combat: if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack; if unit''s HP ≥ 75%, deals +7 damage during combat as well (except when dealing damage with area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Strat Assault 1','Strat Assault 1','Strat Assault','SID_計略・一斉突撃1','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if any foe is within 3 columns or 3 rows centered on unit, grants 【True Charge】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def/Res-2 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, and those foes suffer +1 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【True Charge】<br>Unit can move up to 3 spaces in any cardinal direction without being affected by movement obstruction effects from skills. (Cannot move through foes or terrain that blocks movement. Granted movement treated as Warp movement.)',null,'Strat Assault 2',false,60,'Armored,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Strat Assault 2','Strat Assault 2','Strat Assault','SID_計略・一斉突撃2','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if any foe is within 3 columns or 3 rows centered on unit, grants 【True Charge】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def/Res-3 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, and those foes suffer +2 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【True Charge】<br>Unit can move up to 3 spaces in any cardinal direction without being affected by movement obstruction effects from skills. (Cannot move through foes or terrain that blocks movement. Granted movement treated as Warp movement.)','Strat Assault 1','Strat Assault 3',false,120,'Armored,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Strat Assault 3','Strat Assault 3','Strat Assault','SID_計略・一斉突撃3','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if any foe is within 3 columns or 3 rows centered on unit or if unit''s HP = 100%, grants【True Charge】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def/Res-4 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, and those foes suffer +3 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【True Charge】<br>Unit can move up to 3 spaces in any cardinal direction without being affected by movement obstruction effects from skills. (Cannot move through foes or terrain that blocks movement. Granted movement treated as Warp movement.)','Strat Assault 2',null,false,240,'Armored,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Strat Assault 4','Strat Assault 4','Strat Assault','SID_計略・一斉突撃4','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if any foe is within 3 columns or 3 rows centered on unit or if unit''s HP = 100%, grants【True Charge】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn, and grants "unit can move 1 extra space" to unit (that turn only; does not stack).<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def/Res-4 on foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, and those foes suffer +5 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【True Charge】<br>Unit can move up to 3 spaces in any cardinal direction without being affected by movement obstruction effects from skills. (Cannot move through foes or terrain that blocks movement. Granted movement treated as Warp movement.)','Strat Assault 3',null,false,300,'Armored,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Strat Flame 1','Strat Flame 1','Strat Flame','SID_計略・猛火計1','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+3 to unit and unit deals +1 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit initiates combat, deals 7 damage to foe as combat begins (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1), and applies【Divine Vein (Flame)】on 5 spaces in a line centered on foe''s space (oriented left to right based on the direction unit is facing) for 1 turn after combat.<br><br>【Divine Vein (Flame)】<br>Applies the following effects on space: Acts as difficult terrain for foes with Range = 2 (moving over this space costs +1 movement; does not apply to "cannot be slowed by terrain" effects; movement cost cannot exceed unit''s allowed movement). At start of enemy phase, deals 7 damage to foe, and also, as combat begins, deals an additional 7 damage to foe (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1). (Divine Vein effects do not stack; replaces any existing Divine Vein effect; Divine Vein effects applied simultaneously cancel each other out.)',null,'Strat Flame 2',false,60,'Armored,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Strat Flame 2','Strat Flame 2','Strat Flame','SID_計略・猛火計2','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit and unit deals +3 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit initiates combat, deals 7 damage to foe as combat begins (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1), and applies【Divine Vein (Flame)】on 5 spaces in a line centered on foe''s space (oriented left to right based on the direction unit is facing) for 1 turn after combat.<br><br>【Divine Vein (Flame)】<br>Applies the following effects on space: Acts as difficult terrain for foes with Range = 2 (moving over this space costs +1 movement; does not apply to "cannot be slowed by terrain" effects; movement cost cannot exceed unit''s allowed movement). At start of enemy phase, deals 7 damage to foe, and also, as combat begins, deals an additional 7 damage to foe (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1). (Divine Vein effects do not stack; replaces any existing Divine Vein effect; Divine Vein effects applied simultaneously cancel each other out.)','Strat Flame 1','Strat Flame 3',false,120,'Armored,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Strat Flame 3','Strat Flame 3','Strat Flame','SID_計略・猛火計3','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+7 to unit and unit deals +5 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>If unit initiates combat, deals 7 damage to foe as combat begins (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1), and applies【Divine Vein (Flame)】on 5 spaces in a line centered on foe''s space and on the 5 spaces behind those spaces (oriented left to right based on the direction unit is facing) for 1 turn after combat.<br><br>【Divine Vein (Flame)】<br>Applies the following effects on space: Acts as difficult terrain for foes with Range = 2 (moving over this space costs +1 movement; does not apply to "cannot be slowed by terrain" effects; movement cost cannot exceed unit''s allowed movement). At start of enemy phase, deals 7 damage to foe, and also, as combat begins, deals an additional 7 damage to foe (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1). (Divine Vein effects do not stack; replaces any existing Divine Vein effect; Divine Vein effects applied simultaneously cancel each other out.)','Strat Flame 2',null,false,240,'Armored,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Strat Flame 4','Strat Flame 4','Strat Flame','SID_計略・猛火計4','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+10 to unit and unit deals +5 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 5 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>If unit initiates combat, deals 7 damage to foe as combat begins (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1), and applies【Divine Vein (Flame)】on 5 spaces in a line centered on foe''s space and on the 5 spaces behind those spaces (oriented left to right based on the direction unit is facing) for 1 turn after combat.<br><br>【Divine Vein (Flame)】<br>Applies the following effects on space: Acts as difficult terrain for foes with Range = 2 (moving over this space costs +1 movement; does not apply to "cannot be slowed by terrain" effects; movement cost cannot exceed unit''s allowed movement). At start of enemy phase, deals 7 damage to foe, and also, as combat begins, deals an additional 7 damage to foe (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1). (Divine Vein effects do not stack; replaces any existing Divine Vein effect; Divine Vein effects applied simultaneously cancel each other out.)','Strat Flame 3',null,false,300,'Armored,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Striving Sword','Striving Sword','Striving Sword','SID_憧憬の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit during combat (X = 25% of foe''s Atk at start of combat, - 4; max 14; min 5) and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and also, when unit''s attack triggers unit''s Special, neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials). If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally and foe''s attack triggers unit''s Special, unit''s next attack neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (resets at end of combat). If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally and Special triggers before or during combat, grants Special cooldown count-2 after combat.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner')
