  ('Stronghold','Stronghold','Stronghold','SID_堅牢城塞','passivea',null,null,'Inflicts Atk-3. Grants Def/Res+7.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, neutralizes【Panic】and any penalties to unit''s Def/Res that take effect on unit at this time.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.','Fort. DefRes 2',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,-3,0,7,7',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Studied Forblaze','Studied Forblaze','Studied Forblaze','SID_業炎フォルブレイズ','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At the start of turn 1, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+6 during combat and disables unit''s and foe''s skills that change attack priority.','Bolganone;Fenrir',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Studied Forblaze ATK','Studied Forblaze','Studied Forblaze','SID_業炎フォルブレイズ_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat and disables unit''s and foe''s skills that change attack priority.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Studied Forblaze DEF','Studied Forblaze','Studied Forblaze','SID_業炎フォルブレイズ_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat and disables unit''s and foe''s skills that change attack priority.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Studied Forblaze RES','Studied Forblaze','Studied Forblaze','SID_業炎フォルブレイズ_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat and disables unit''s and foe''s skills that change attack priority.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,null,null),
  ('Studied Forblaze SKILL1','Studied Forblaze','Studied Forblaze','SID_業炎フォルブレイズ_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat and disables unit''s and foe''s skills that change attack priority.<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Res (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 30%.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Studied Forblaze SPD','Studied Forblaze','Studied Forblaze','SID_業炎フォルブレイズ_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat and disables unit''s and foe''s skills that change attack priority.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Sturdy Beast','Sturdy Beast','Sturdy Beast','SID_堅固なる獣','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by X% of unit''s Def when Special triggers (if transformed, X = 50; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>If both of the following conditions are met, reduces damage from foe''s next attack by 40% during combat:<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- Unit''s or foe''s Special is ready, or unit''s<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;or foe''s Special triggered before or during<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;this combat.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;- Unit is transformed or unit''s Def ≥ foe''s<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Def-4.<br>(Once per combat; excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Ignis',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,3,null,'random_inherit_base,offensive_special'),
  ('Sturdy Blow 1','Sturdy Blow 1','Sturdy Blow','SID_鬼神金剛の一撃1','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat, grants Atk/Def+2 during combat.','Armored Blow 1;Death Blow 1','Sturdy Blow 2',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Sturdy Blow 2','Sturdy Blow 2','Sturdy Blow','SID_鬼神金剛の一撃2','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat, grants Atk/Def+4 during combat.','Sturdy Blow 1',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Sturdy Flare','Sturdy Flare','Sturdy Flare','SID_鬼神金剛の炎撃3','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat, deals 7 damage to foe as combat begins (effects that reduce damage during combat do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1), grants Atk+7, Def+10 to unit during combat, and applies 【Divine Vein (Flame)】on 5 spaces in a line centered on foe''s space (oriented left to right based on the direction unit is facing) for 1 turn after combat.<br><br>【Divine Vein (Flame)】<br>Applies the following effects on space: Acts as difficult terrain for foes with Range = 2 (moving over this space costs +1 movement; does not apply to "cannot be slowed by terrain" effects; movement cost cannot exceed unit''s allowed movement). At start of enemy phase, deals 7 damage to foe, and also, as combat begins, deals an additional 7 damage to foe (effects that reduce damage "during combat" do not apply; will not reduce foe''s HP below 1). (Divine Vein effects do not stack; replaces any existing Divine Vein effect; Divine Vein effects applied simultaneously cancel each other out.)','Sturdy Blow 2',null,false,300,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sturdy Impact','Sturdy Impact','Sturdy Impact','SID_鬼神金剛の一撃3','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat, grants Atk+6, Def+10 during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','Sturdy Blow 2',null,false,300,'Infantry,Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sturdy Laguz','Sturdy Laguz','Sturdy Laguz','SID_堅固なる野獣','special',null,null,'When Special triggers, boosts damage by unit''s Def.<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).<br><br>If unit is transformed, grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).','Ignis',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,5,null,'offensive_special,random_owner'),
  ('Sturdy Stance 1','Sturdy Stance 1','Sturdy Stance','SID_鬼神金剛の構え1','passivea',null,null,'If foe initiates combat, grants Atk/Def+2 during combat.','Steady Stance 1;Fierce Stance 1','Sturdy Stance 2',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Sturdy Stance 2','Sturdy Stance 2','Sturdy Stance','SID_鬼神金剛の構え2','passivea',null,null,'If foe initiates combat, grants Atk/Def+4 during combat.','Sturdy Stance 1',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Sturdy Stance 3','Sturdy Stance 3','Sturdy Stance','SID_鬼神金剛の構え3','passivea',null,null,'If foe initiates combat, grants Atk/Def+6 during combat and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)','Sturdy Stance 2',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sturdy Surge','Sturdy Surge','Sturdy Surge','SID_鬼神金剛の迫撃3','passivea',null,null,'If unit initiates combat, grants Atk+7, Def+10 to unit during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe using a Special, restores HP = X% of unit''s max HP (X = unit''s max Special cooldown count value × 20, + 10; max 100). (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.)','Sturdy Blow 2',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sturdy War Sword','Sturdy War Sword','Sturdy War Sword','SID_戦神の剛なる鉄剣','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, and if unit''s attack can trigger their Special, the following effects will occur based on the number of allies within 4 spaces of unit: If ≥ 1, before unit''s first attack, grants Special cooldown count-X (X = 50% of unit''s max Special cooldown count value, rounded down) to unit. If ≥ 2, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by X% (X = unit''s max Special cooldown count value × 10). If ≥ 3, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Suave Blade','Suave Blade','Suave Blade','SID_珍獣騎士の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If a Rally or movement Assist skill (like Reposition, Shove, Pivot, etc.) is used by unit or targets unit, grants "reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special ''reduce damage by X%'' skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials)" and 【Bonus Doubler】to unit and target ally or unit and targeting ally for 1 turn.<br><br>If a Rally or movement Assist skill is used by unit, grants another action to unit (once per turn).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 5 + number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 3 (max 14), neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by number of 【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, × 3 during combat (max 15; excluding area-of-effect Specials; "first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).<br><br>【Bonus Doubler】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current bonus on each of unit''s stats for 1 turn. Calculates each stat bonus independently.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sublime Creator','Sublime Creator','Sublime Creator','SID_真覇天帝の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>For allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5, neutralizes penalties on ally, and when ally deals damage to foe, restores 7 HP to ally during combat.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 3, + 5 (max 14), neutralizes penalties on unit, unit deals +X × 5 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X × 3 (excluding area- of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by an additional X × 3 when foe''s attack triggers foe''s Special (excluding area-of-effect Specials; X = number of Bonus effects active on unit and foe, excluding stat bonuses; max 5), and when unit deals damage to foe, restores 7 HP to unit during combat.<br><br>Unit can use the following【Style】:<br>――――― Sublime Heaven Style ―――――<br>Unit can attack foes 3 spaces away (unit cannot attack adjacent foes).<br><br>Grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat. If foe uses dragon or beast damage and unit''s Special triggers, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>Cannot move through spaces within 3 spaces of foe that has triggered the【Bulwark】effect (does not apply if unit has a Pass skill). Unit suffers a counterattack if any of the following conditions are met: foe is armored with Range = 1 or foe can counterattack regardless of unit''s range.<br><br>After-combat movement effects do not occur.<br>Skill effect''s Range is treated as 1. Once used, this Style cannot be used for two turns.<br>――――――――――――――――――――<br><br>【Style】<br>Change Style using the Style button at the bottom of the screen.<br><br>A unit''s Style is only active when that unit is taking an action. Style use is disabled when unit is deployed using Pair Up or when unit is equipped with multiple skills that have a Style.<br><br>【Bulwark】<br>Foes with Range = 1 cannot move through spaces adjacent to unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills).<br><br>Foes with Range = 2 cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sublime Heaven','Sublime Heaven','Sublime Heaven','SID_覇天','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by 25% of unit''s Atk. If in combat against a dragon foe or beast foe, boosts damage by 50% instead of 25%. Disables non-Special skills that "reduce damage by X%."','Draconic Aura',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,2,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Sublime Heaven II','Sublime Heaven II','Sublime Heaven II','SID_覇天・承','special',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>Boosts Special damage by 30% of unit''s Atk. If in combat against a dragon foe or beast foe, boosts Special damage by 60% instead of 30%.<br><br>When Special triggers, neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from non-Special skills.','Sublime Heaven',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,2,null,'offensive_special'),
  ('Sublime Surge','Sublime Surge','Sublime Surge','SID_天帝の波動','weapon',1,null,'Neutralizes "effective against dragons" bonuses. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Sublime Surge ATK','Sublime Surge','Sublime Surge','SID_天帝の波動_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Neutralizes "effective against dragons" bonuses. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
