  ('Sublime Surge SKILL1','Sublime Surge','Sublime Surge','SID_天帝の波動_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Neutralizes "effective against dragons" bonuses. Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range. If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40%.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
