  ('Summers Breath','Summer''s Breath','Summer''s Breath','SID_真夏のブレス','weapon',1,null,'Effective against dragon foes. Grants Def+3. If foe initiates combat, grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.','Flametongue',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'0,16,0,3,0',null,'dragon',null),
  ('Summers Breath ATK','Summer''s Breath','Summer''s Breath','SID_真夏のブレス_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Effective against dragon foes. Grants Def+3. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat and Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.) If foe''s Range = 2, calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath',16,'5,18,0,3,0',null,'dragon',null),
