  ('Taciturn Axe','Taciturn Axe','Taciturn Axe','SID_寡黙なる忠義の斧','weapon',1,null,'If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, deals damage = X% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; if unit is within 3 spaces a certain target ally, X = 30; otherwise, X = 20; if support partner is on player team, targets support partner; if support partner is not on player team, targets ally with the highest Atk on player team, excluding unit).<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Taciturn Axe ATK','Taciturn Axe','Taciturn Axe','SID_寡黙なる忠義の斧_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, deals damage = X% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials; if unit is within 3 spaces a certain target ally, X = 30; otherwise, X = 20; if support partner is on player team, targets support partner; if support partner is not on player team, targets ally with the highest Atk on player team, excluding unit).<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
