  ('Thunder Armads','Thunder Armads','Thunder Armads','SID_天雷アルマーズ','weapon',1,null,'Grants Def+3. If the number of allies within 2 spaces (excluding unit) > the number of foes within 2 spaces (excluding target), foe cannot make a follow-up attack.','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,3,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Thunder Armads ATK','Thunder Armads','Thunder Armads','SID_天雷アルマーズ_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Def+3. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunder Armads DEF','Thunder Armads','Thunder Armads','SID_天雷アルマーズ_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Def+3. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,7,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunder Armads RES','Thunder Armads','Thunder Armads','SID_天雷アルマーズ_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Def+3. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,3,4',null,null,null),
  ('Thunder Armads SKILL1','Thunder Armads','Thunder Armads','SID_天雷アルマーズ_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Def+3. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.<br>If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe during combat and reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 40%.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunder Armads SPD','Thunder Armads','Thunder Armads','SID_天雷アルマーズ_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Def+3. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe during combat and foe cannot make a follow-up attack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderbrand','Thunderbrand','Thunderbrand','SID_雷霆','weapon',1,null,'Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Thunderbrand ATK','Thunderbrand','Thunderbrand','SID_雷霆_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Treachery】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe''s next attack.<br><br>【Treachery】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total bonuses on unit for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,18,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderbrand DEF','Thunderbrand','Thunderbrand','SID_雷霆_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Treachery】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe''s next attack.<br><br>【Treachery】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total bonuses on unit for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderbrand RES','Thunderbrand','Thunderbrand','SID_雷霆_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Treachery】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe''s next attack.<br><br>【Treachery】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total bonuses on unit for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderbrand SKILL1','Thunderbrand','Thunderbrand','SID_雷霆_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Treachery】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe''s next attack.<br><br>【Treachery】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total bonuses on unit for 1 turn.<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, if decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 25 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow-ups), triggers【Potent Follow X%】 during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40).<br><br>【Potent Follow X%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = X% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderbrand SPD','Thunderbrand','Thunderbrand','SID_雷霆_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Treachery】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe''s next attack.<br><br>【Treachery】<br>Unit deals additional damage = total bonuses on unit for 1 turn.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,6,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderer Tome','Thunderer Tome','Thunderer Tome','SID_怒雷の紫書','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At the start of turns 1 through 3 or if unit''s HP < 100% at start of turn, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. During turns 1-3, or if unit''s HP < 100% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, and also, if Special triggers (excluding area-of-effect Specials), deals +7 damage and neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from non-Special skills.','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Thunderhead','Thunderhead','Thunderhead','SID_雷旋トルネード','weapon',2,null,'Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Thunderhead ATK','Thunderhead','Thunderhead','SID_雷旋トルネード_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderhead DEF','Thunderhead','Thunderhead','SID_雷旋トルネード_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderhead RES','Thunderhead','Thunderhead','SID_雷旋トルネード_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderhead SKILL1','Thunderhead','Thunderhead','SID_雷旋トルネード_周','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat.<br>If unit or ally initiates combat against a foe within 2 spaces of unit, inflicts Spd/Res-5 on that foe during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunderhead SPD','Thunderhead','Thunderhead','SID_雷旋トルネード_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants bonus to unit’s Atk = total bonuses on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Thunders Fist','Thunder''s Fist','Thunder''s Fist','SID_雷神の右腕','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+7 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, if unit initiates combat, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 50% during combat, and if number of spaces from unit''s start position to end position ≥ 2, unit attacks twice.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Thunders Mjolnir','Thunder''s Mjölnir','Thunder''s Mjölnir','SID_雷神トールハンマー','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and also, if unit initiates combat and unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd+10, unit attacks twice.','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Ties of Crimea','Ties of Crimea','Ties of Crimea','SID_クリミアの絆','passivec',null,null,'Allies within 2 spaces of unit can move to any space within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>After foes'' start-of-turn skills trigger, if unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, for unit and allies within 3 spaces of unit, neutralizes stat penalties and two【Penalty】effects (does not apply to Penalty effects that are applied at the same time; neutralizes the first applicable Penalty effects on unit''s list of active effects).<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and also, when unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 7 HP to unit.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Tiger Spirit','Tiger Spirit','Tiger Spirit','SID_虎神・寅','weapon',2,null,'Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat, and also, after combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Panic】on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Tiger Spirit ATK','Tiger Spirit','Tiger Spirit','SID_虎神・寅_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Res+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and foe cannot make a follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Panic】 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger Spirit DEF','Tiger Spirit','Tiger Spirit','SID_虎神・寅_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Res+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and foe cannot make a follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Panic】 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger Spirit RES','Tiger Spirit','Tiger Spirit','SID_虎神・寅_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Res+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and foe cannot make a follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Panic】 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,6',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger Spirit SKILL1','Tiger Spirit','Tiger Spirit','SID_虎神・寅_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Res+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and foe cannot make a follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Panic】 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.<br>For foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5, neutralizes foe''s bonuses, and foe suffers guaranteed follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>Reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger Spirit SPD','Tiger Spirit','Tiger Spirit','SID_虎神・寅_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Res+3.<br><br>Grants Atk/Res+6 and Spd/Def+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and foe cannot make a follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts【Panic】 on target and foes within 2 spaces of target.<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Eye Axe','Tiger-Eye Axe','Tiger-Eye Axe','SID_虎目石の荒斧','weapon',1,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat, and unit''s next attack deals damage = 30% of foe''s attack damage prior to reductions (resets at end of combat; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Eye Axe ATK','Tiger-Eye Axe','Tiger-Eye Axe','SID_虎目石の荒斧_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat, and unit''s next attack deals damage = 30% of foe''s attack damage prior to reductions (resets at end of combat; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Eye Axe DEF','Tiger-Eye Axe','Tiger-Eye Axe','SID_虎目石の荒斧_DEF','weapon',1,'def','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat, and unit''s next attack deals damage = 30% of foe''s attack damage prior to reductions (resets at end of combat; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Eye Axe RES','Tiger-Eye Axe','Tiger-Eye Axe','SID_虎目石の荒斧_RES','weapon',1,'res','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat, and unit''s next attack deals damage = 30% of foe''s attack damage prior to reductions (resets at end of combat; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Eye Axe SKILL1','Tiger-Eye Axe','Tiger-Eye Axe','SID_虎目石の荒斧_一','weapon',1,'skill1','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat, and unit''s next attack deals damage = 30% of foe''s attack damage prior to reductions (resets at end of combat; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.<br>If any【Bonus】is active on unit or any【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def = highest penalty on each stat between target and foes within 2 spaces of target (calculates each stat penalty independently), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and unit deals damage = 10% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Eye Axe SPD','Tiger-Eye Axe','Tiger-Eye Axe','SID_虎目石の荒斧_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-7 and【Discord】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat, and unit''s next attack deals damage = 30% of foe''s attack damage prior to reductions (resets at end of combat; only highest value applied; does not stack).<br><br>【Discord】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on unit during combat (X = 2 + number of allies within 2 spaces of unit; max 5) through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Roar Axe','Tiger-Roar Axe','Tiger-Roar Axe','SID_虎の剛斧','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 during combat, and also, at start of combat, if foe''s HP = 100%, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Tiger-Roar Axe ATK','Tiger-Roar Axe','Tiger-Roar Axe','SID_虎の剛斧_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Roar Axe DEF','Tiger-Roar Axe','Tiger-Roar Axe','SID_虎の剛斧_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Roar Axe RES','Tiger-Roar Axe','Tiger-Roar Axe','SID_虎の剛斧_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Roar Axe SKILL1','Tiger-Roar Axe','Tiger-Roar Axe','SID_虎の剛斧_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br>If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 4 + number of foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 2 (max 10), inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Tiger-Roar Axe SPD','Tiger-Roar Axe','Tiger-Roar Axe','SID_虎の剛斧_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit initiates combat or unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Time and Light','Time and Light','Time and Light','SID_時と光','special',null,null,'Boosts Special damage by 30% of unit''s Spd when Special triggers.<br><br>Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br><br>If unit initiates combat, after combat, if unit''s Special triggered and unit survives, grants another action to unit and inflicts "restricts movement to 1 space" on unit and Pair Up cohort through their next action (once per turn). (This effect has priority over other similar effects; in such cases, these other similar effects are treated as not having triggered.)','Vengeance',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,2,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Time Is Light','Time Is Light','Time Is Light','SID_時は光','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by 45% of unit''s Spd when Special triggers. Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat. If unit initiates combat, after combat, if unit''s Special triggered and unit survives, grants another action to unit and inflicts "restricts movement to 1 space" on unit and Pair Up cohort through their next action (once per turn). (This effect has priority over other similar effects; in such cases, these other similar effects are treated as not having triggered.)','Vengeance',null,true,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,3,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Time Pulse Arms','Time Pulse Arms','Time Pulse Arms','SID_始まりの鼓動・鎧','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Def during combat = unit''s maximum Special cooldown count value + 2. If unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value after combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.','Times Pulse 3',null,false,300,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Time Pulse Echo','Time Pulse Echo','Time Pulse Echo','SID_響・始まりの鼓動','passivex',null,null,'At start of turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>After combat, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1.',null,null,false,0,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Time Pulse Edge','Time Pulse Edge','Time Pulse Edge','SID_始まりの鼓動・刃','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd during combat = unit''s maximum Special cooldown count value + 2, and also, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value after combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.','Times Pulse 3',null,false,300,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Time Pulse Helm','Time Pulse Helm','Time Pulse Helm','SID_始まりの鼓動・兜','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Res during combat = unit''s maximum Special cooldown count value + 2, and also, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value after combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.','Times Pulse 3',null,false,300,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Times Pulse 1','Time''s Pulse 1','Time''s Pulse','SID_始まりの鼓動1','passivec',null,null,'At the start of every third turn, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1.',null,'Times Pulse 2',false,60,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Times Pulse 2','Time''s Pulse 2','Time''s Pulse','SID_始まりの鼓動2','passivec',null,null,'At start of odd-numbered turns, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1.','Times Pulse 1','Times Pulse 3',false,120,'Infantry',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
