  ('Tome of Favors DEF','Tome of Favors','Tome of Favors','SID_寵愛の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','If foe does not use beast damage, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Favors RES','Tome of Favors','Tome of Favors','SID_寵愛の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','If foe does not use beast damage, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Favors SKILL1','Tome of Favors','Tome of Favors','SID_寵愛の書_愛','weapon',2,'skill1','If foe does not use beast damage, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br>Unit can move to a space adjacent to a beast ally that can equip Sing or Dance.<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of a beast ally that can equip Sing or Dance, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Favors SPD','Tome of Favors','Tome of Favors','SID_寵愛の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','If foe does not use beast damage, grants Atk/Res+5 to unit during combat and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Fury','Tome of Fury','Tome of Fury','SID_激情の炎の書','weapon',2,null,'Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Fury ATK','Tome of Fury','Tome of Fury','SID_激情の炎の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Fury DEF','Tome of Fury','Tome of Fury','SID_激情の炎の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Fury RES','Tome of Fury','Tome of Fury','SID_激情の炎の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Fury SKILL1','Tome of Fury','Tome of Fury','SID_激情の炎の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6, "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat," and【Hexblade】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat, and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Hexblade】<br>Calculates damage using the lower of foe''s Def or Res during combat for 1 turn (including damage dealt by Specials before combat).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Fury SPD','Tome of Fury','Tome of Fury','SID_激情の炎の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grado','Tome of Grado','Tome of Grado','SID_グラドの史書','weapon',2,null,'Grants Atk+3. If foe initiates combat or if foe''s HP = 100% at start of combat, inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe and neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Res during combat, and also, if foe is colorless and uses bow, dagger, magic, or staff, grants weapon-triangle advantage to unit and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on foe during combat.','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grado ATK','Tome of Grado','Tome of Grado','SID_グラドの史書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Atk+3 to unit.<br><br>Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grado DEF','Tome of Grado','Tome of Grado','SID_グラドの史書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Atk+3 to unit.<br><br>Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,17,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grado RES','Tome of Grado','Tome of Grado','SID_グラドの史書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Atk+3 to unit.<br><br>Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,17,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grado SKILL1','Tome of Grado','Tome of Grado','SID_グラドの史書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Atk+3 to unit.<br><br>Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants Atk/Res+6,【Empathy】, and【Cancel Affinity】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts【Triangle Adept】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes.<br><br>Grants Atk/Def/Res+11 to unit, and unit deals +20 damage during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Empathy】<br>Grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of types of Bonus effects, excluding stat bonuses, and Penalty effects, excluding stat penalties, active on player team and enemy team during combat (max 7).<br><br>【Cancel Affinity】<br>If unit has weapon-triangle disadvantage, reverses weapon-triangle advantage granted by foe''s skills for 1 turn.<br><br>【Triangle Adept】<br>If unit has weapon-triangle advantage, boosts Atk by 20% through its next action, and if unit has weapon-triangle disadvantage, reduces Atk by 20% through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grado SPD','Tome of Grado','Tome of Grado','SID_グラドの史書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Atk+3 to unit.<br><br>Grants weapon-triangle advantage against colorless foes, and inflicts weapon-triangle disadvantage on colorless foes during combat.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Res-6 on foe, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Res, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,17,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grief','Tome of Grief','Tome of Grief','SID_哀歌の書','weapon',2,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-7 and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grief ATK','Tome of Grief','Tome of Grief','SID_哀歌の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-7 and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grief DEF','Tome of Grief','Tome of Grief','SID_哀歌の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-7 and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grief RES','Tome of Grief','Tome of Grief','SID_哀歌の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-7 and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grief SKILL1','Tome of Grief','Tome of Grief','SID_哀歌の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-7 and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes penalties to unit''s Atk/Res, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Res (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Grief SPD','Tome of Grief','Tome of Grief','SID_哀歌の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Res-7 and status preventing counterattacks on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Atk/Res, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Luxuries','Tome of Luxuries','Tome of Luxuries','SID_豪奢な富書','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At the start of turn 1, grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit. At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants "if unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack" to unit for 1 turn. After start-of-turn skills trigger, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants any【Bonus】effects active on unit (including stat bonuses; excluding "unit can move 1 extra space" and【Pathfinder】) to allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Res (including when dealing damage with a Special triggered before combat).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).<br><br>【Pathfinder】<br>When an ally moves through unit''s space, that space is counted as 0 spaces moved instead of 1 space. (Unit''s space can be freely added to ally''s normal movement. Applies only to allies with movement types that allow movement through unit''s space.)','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
