  ('Tome of Reason','Tome of Reason','Tome of Reason','SID_純理の書','weapon',2,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Def/Res+6 to unit and allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
