  ('Tome of Reason RES','Tome of Reason','Tome of Reason','SID_純理の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Def/Res+6 to unit and allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Reason SKILL1','Tome of Reason','Tome of Reason','SID_純理の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Def/Res+6 to unit and allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat, and inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Res = 60% of total bonuses on unit''s Def and Res during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Reason SPD','Tome of Reason','Tome of Reason','SID_純理の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Def/Res+6 to unit and allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Reglay','Tome of Reglay','Tome of Reglay','SID_銀の魔道軍将の書','weapon',2,null,'Grants Atk+3. At start of turn, grants Special cooldown count-1 to any magic allies within two spaces of unit (including unit) that has their Special cooldown count at its maximum value. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Tome of Reglay ATK','Tome of Reglay','Tome of Reglay','SID_銀の魔道軍将の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd+6 and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn, and for unit and any support-partner, magic, or staff allies within 2 spaces of unit, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-2; if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value - 1, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Reglay DEF','Tome of Reglay','Tome of Reglay','SID_銀の魔道軍将の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd+6 and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn, and for unit and any support-partner, magic, or staff allies within 2 spaces of unit, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-2; if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value - 1, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Reglay RES','Tome of Reglay','Tome of Reglay','SID_銀の魔道軍将の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd+6 and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn, and for unit and any support-partner, magic, or staff allies within 2 spaces of unit, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-2; if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value - 1, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Reglay SKILL1','Tome of Reglay','Tome of Reglay','SID_銀の魔道軍将の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd+6 and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn, and for unit and any support-partner, magic, or staff allies within 2 spaces of unit, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-2; if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value - 1, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of allies within 3 spaces of unit × 2, + 5 (max 11; if support partner is within 3 spaces of unit, value is treated as 11), deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Reglay SPD','Tome of Reglay','Tome of Reglay','SID_銀の魔道軍将の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>At start of turn, grants Atk/Spd+6 and "neutralizes penalties on unit during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn, and for unit and any support-partner, magic, or staff allies within 2 spaces of unit, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-2; if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value - 1, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 7 ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,17,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Storms','Tome of Storms','Tome of Storms','SID_万雷の書','weapon',2,null,'Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.','Thoron',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Tome of Storms ATK','Tome of Storms','Tome of Storms','SID_万雷の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 15% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res, and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,15,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Storms DEF','Tome of Storms','Tome of Storms','SID_万雷の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 15% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res, and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Storms RES','Tome of Storms','Tome of Storms','SID_万雷の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 15% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res, and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,3,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Storms SKILL1','Tome of Storms','Tome of Storms','SID_万雷の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 15% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res, and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, foe cannot counterattack.<br>Enables【Canto (１)】.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Spd/Res-7 and【Exposure】on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat and deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tome of Storms SPD','Tome of Storms','Tome of Storms','SID_万雷の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Spd+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 6 + 15% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, neutralizes foe''s bonuses to Spd/Res, and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,5,0,0',null,null,null),
