  ('Trilemma Plus SKILL1','Trilemma+','Trilemma+','SID_トリレンマ＋_神','weapon',2,'skill1','After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts the following status on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions: "If unit has weapon-triangle advantage, boosts Atk by 20%. If unit has weapon-triangle disadvantage, reduces Atk by 20%."<br>Calculates damage from staff like other weapons.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Trilemma Plus SKILL2','Trilemma+','Trilemma+','SID_トリレンマ＋_幻','weapon',2,'skill2','After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts the following status on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions: "If unit has weapon-triangle advantage, boosts Atk by 20%. If unit has weapon-triangle disadvantage, reduces Atk by 20%."<br>Foe cannot counterattack.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',12,'0,12,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tropical Conch','Tropical Conch','Tropical Conch','SID_南国のホラ貝','weapon',1,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Def+6 to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and it is an even-numbered turn, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and it is an odd-numbered turn, grants Atk/Def+11 to unit during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and unit''s Def ≥ foe''s Def - 5, neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.','Steel Axe','Tropical Conch Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tropical Conch Plus','Tropical Conch+','Tropical Conch+','SID_南国のホラ貝＋','weapon',1,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Def+6 to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and it is an even-numbered turn, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and it is an odd-numbered turn, grants Atk/Def+11 to unit during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and unit''s Def ≥ foe''s Def - 5, neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.','Tropical Conch',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Tropical Conch Plus ATK','Tropical Conch+','Tropical Conch+','SID_南国のホラ貝＋_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Def+6 to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and it is an even-numbered turn, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and it is an odd-numbered turn, grants Atk/Def+11 to unit during combat.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and unit''s Def ≥ foe''s Def - 5, neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',14,'5,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
