  ('Urvan','Urvan','Urvan','SID_ウルヴァン','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit receives consecutive attacks, reduces damage from foe''s second attack onward by 80%.','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Urvan ATK','Urvan','Urvan','SID_ウルヴァン_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit receives consecutive attacks, reduces damage from foe''s second attack onward by 80%.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Urvan Brilliance','Urvan Brilliance','Urvan Brilliance','SID_蒼烈ウルヴァン','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Foes with Range = 1 cannot move through spaces adjacent to unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills). Foes with Range = 2 cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills).<br><br>At start of turn, grants【Radiant Hero】and "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+15 to unit, unit deals +25 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before unit''s first follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>【Radiant Hero】<br>Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 10 during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, when Special triggers, deals damage = unit''s max Special cooldown count value × 4 (excluding area-of-effect Specials).','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Urvan DEF','Urvan','Urvan','SID_ウルヴァン_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit receives consecutive attacks, reduces damage from foe''s second attack onward by 80%.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Urvan RES','Urvan','Urvan','SID_ウルヴァン_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit receives consecutive attacks, reduces damage from foe''s second attack onward by 80%.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Urvan SKILL1','Urvan','Urvan','SID_ウルヴァン_攻','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit receives consecutive attacks, reduces damage from foe''s second attack onward by 80%.<br>Reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40%. If foe initiates combat, foe can make a follow-up attack before unit can counterattack.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Urvan SPD','Urvan','Urvan','SID_ウルヴァン_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit receives consecutive attacks, reduces damage from foe''s second attack onward by 80%.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vafthrudnir','Vafþrúðnir','Vafþrúðnir','SID_ヴァフスルーズニル','weapon',2,null,'Inflicts Spd-5. If unit initiates combat, unit attacks twice.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',9,'0,9,-5,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vague Katti','Vague Katti','Vague Katti','SID_ヴァーグ・カティ','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase (except for in Summoner Duels), for unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit, grants "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat" for 1 turn, and also, if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-2; if Special cooldown count is at its maximum value - 1, grants Special cooldown count-1.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 3, + 5 (max 14), unit deals +X damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials; if unit''s Special is ready or unit''s Special triggered before or during this combat, X = 25; otherwise, X = 15), and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Spd and reduces damage from foe''s Specials by an additional 20% of unit''s Spd during combat (in either case, including area-of-effect Specials; excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials), and also, if decreasing the Spd difference necessary to make a follow-up attack by 10 would allow unit to trigger a follow-up attack (excluding guaranteed or prevented follow-ups), triggers 【Potent Follow 100%】during combat.<br><br>If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, after combat, if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit; if unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value - 1, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit.<br><br>【Potent Follow 100%】<br>Triggers an additional follow-up attack immediately after unit''s standard follow-up attack and deals damage = 100% of unit''s normal attack damage (if unit cannot make a follow-up attack, this effect triggers when the standard follow-up attack would occur; this effect is treated like a follow-up attack, so effects like "reduce damage by X%" still apply, but this effect is not affected by effects that prevent follow-ups or "attacks twice" effects; only highest value applied; does not stack).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Valaskjalf','Valaskjálf','Valaskjálf','SID_ヴラスキャルヴ','weapon',2,null,'If unit''s HP ≤ 50% and foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe''s first attack.','Thoron',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,'enemy_only'),
  ('Valbars Lance','Valbar''s Lance','Valbar''s Lance','SID_バルボの勇槍','weapon',1,null,'If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+5 to unit during combat, and also, if foe initiates combat, reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 60% during combat ("follow-up attack" normally means only the second strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the third and fourth strikes).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
