  ('Vassal-Saint Steel','Vassal-Saint Steel','Vassal-Saint Steel','SID_剣姫と剣聖の秘刀','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% and unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, inflicts Spd/Def-X on foe (X = 11 - foe''s max Special cooldown count value × 2; min 3; if foe does not have a Special skill, penalty = 3), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat, and also, if unit''s Spd ≥ foe''s Spd+5, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat. If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat and unit''s Special cooldown count is at its maximum value after combat, grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit after combat.','Wo Dao',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vassals Blade','Vassal''s Blade','Vassal''s Blade','SID_剣姫の刀','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, deals damage = 70% of difference between stats. (Maximum bonus of +7 damage. Combos with Phantom Spd.)','Wo Dao',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vassals Blade ATK','Vassal''s Blade','Vassal''s Blade','SID_剣姫の刀_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vassals Blade DEF','Vassal''s Blade','Vassal''s Blade','SID_剣姫の刀_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vassals Blade RES','Vassal''s Blade','Vassal''s Blade','SID_剣姫の刀_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Vassals Blade SKILL1','Vassal''s Blade','Vassal''s Blade','SID_剣姫の刀_見','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.<br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd+5 during combat and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vassals Blade SPD','Vassal''s Blade','Vassal''s Blade','SID_剣姫の刀_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Spd+5 to unit during combat and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Spd.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vedrfolnirs Edge','Veðrfölnir''s Edge','Veðrfölnir''s Edge','SID_始祖の巨人の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if there is an ally within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Null Follow-Up】to unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or if there is an ally within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 5 + number of allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 3 (max 14), neutralizes unit''s penalties, neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, unit deals +X damage, and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 50% of X during combat (X = highest total bonuses among unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit; "first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and also, when foe''s attack triggers foe''s Special, reduces Special damage by 50% of X (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Null Follow-Up】<br>If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd during combat, neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks for 1 turn.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_inherit_base'),
  ('Vedrfolnirs Egg','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','SID_フェルニルの妖卵','weapon',2,null,'Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat.','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vedrfolnirs Egg ATK','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','SID_フェルニルの妖卵_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = total bonuses on ally with the highest total bonuses within 2 spaces. (Example: if an ally within 2 spaces has Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6, grants Atk+24.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,15,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vedrfolnirs Egg DEF','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','SID_フェルニルの妖卵_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = total bonuses on ally with the highest total bonuses within 2 spaces. (Example: if an ally within 2 spaces has Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6, grants Atk+24.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,3,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vedrfolnirs Egg RES','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','SID_フェルニルの妖卵_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = total bonuses on ally with the highest total bonuses within 2 spaces. (Example: if an ally within 2 spaces has Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6, grants Atk+24.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,3,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Vedrfolnirs Egg SKILL1','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','SID_フェルニルの妖卵_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = total bonuses on ally with the highest total bonuses within 2 spaces. (Example: if an ally within 2 spaces has Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6, grants Atk+24.)<br>At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and the following status to unit and allies within 2 spaces for 1 turn: "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces." If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+5 to unit during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vedrfolnirs Egg SPD','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','Veðrfölnir''s Egg','SID_フェルニルの妖卵_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Spd+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and grants bonus to unit''s Atk during combat = total bonuses on ally with the highest total bonuses within 2 spaces. (Example: if an ally within 2 spaces has Atk/Spd/Def/Res+6, grants Atk+24.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'2,14,5,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vedrfolnirs Wing','Veðrfölnir''s Wing','Veðrfölnir''s Wing','SID_始祖の炎翼','passiveb',null,null,'Effect:【Pathfinder】<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is on a team with only 1 support partner, grants【Pathfinder】to support partner for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of turn, if unit is not on a team with support partner and if there is only 1 ally who has the highest Def, grants【Pathfinder】to that ally for 1 turn.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def = 5 + current bonus on each of foe''s stats × 2 (calculates each stat penalty independently; example: if foe has a +7 bonus to Atk, inflicts Atk-19, for a net penalty of Atk-12), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.<br><br>【Pathfinder】<br>When an ally moves through unit''s space, that space is counted as 0 spaces moved instead of 1 space. (Unit''s space can be freely added to ally''s normal movement. Applies only to allies with movement types that allow movement through unit''s space.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Veil Seal','Veil Seal','Veil Seal','SID_盗賊の偶像・踊り','sacredseal',null,null,'When the holder of this seal is defeated, restores 10 HP to unit that defeats holder, inflicts Special cooldown count+1 on that unit after combat, and a【Dancer''s Veil】drops.<br><br>【Dancer''s Veil】<br>Allows one random ally that has already acted to take another action.',null,null,false,0,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'enemy_only'),
  ('Veiled Valaskjalf','Veiled Valaskjálf','Veiled Valaskjálf','SID_幽暗ヴラスキャルヴ','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, and also, if foe initiates combat, unit can counterattack before foe’s first attack.','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner,enemy_only'),
  ('Velocity 1','Velocity 1','Velocity','SID_回避・拍節1','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 2 (max 20%). Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.',null,'Velocity 2',false,60,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Velocity 2','Velocity 2','Velocity','SID_回避・拍節2','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 3 (max 30%). Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.','Velocity 1','Velocity 3',false,120,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Velocity 3','Velocity 3','Velocity','SID_回避・拍節3','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%). Neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit.','Velocity 2',null,false,240,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vengeance','Vengeance','Vengeance','SID_復讐','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by 50% of damage dealt to unit.','Retribution',null,false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,null,3,null,'random_all,offensive_special'),
  ('Vengeful Fighter 1','Vengeful Fighter 1','Vengeful Fighter','SID_迎撃隊形1','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 90% and foe initiates combat, grants Special cooldown charge +1 per unit''s attack, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. (Does not stack.)',null,'Vengeful Fighter 2',false,60,'Armored','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vengeful Fighter 2','Vengeful Fighter 2','Vengeful Fighter','SID_迎撃隊形2','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 70% and foe initiates combat, grants Special cooldown charge +1 per unit''s attack, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. (Does not stack.)','Vengeful Fighter 1','Vengeful Fighter 3',false,120,'Armored','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vengeful Fighter 3','Vengeful Fighter 3','Vengeful Fighter','SID_迎撃隊形3','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 50% and foe initiates combat, grants Special cooldown charge +1 per unit''s attack, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack. (Does not stack.)','Vengeful Fighter 2',null,false,240,'Armored','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vengeful Fighter 4','Vengeful Fighter 4','Vengeful Fighter','SID_迎撃隊形4','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 25% and foe initiates combat, inflicts Atk-4 on foe during combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, foe cannot make a follow-up attack, and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).','Vengeful Fighter 3',null,false,300,'Armored','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vengeful God','Vengeful God','Vengeful God','SID_復讐の神形','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, if unit is equipped with Miracle, grants Special cooldown count-4 and restores 40 HP to unit.<br><br>Once per turn in player phase or enemy phase, if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, and if unit triggered Miracle during combat, after the effect of Miracle, damage dealt by unit''s attacks and damage from foe''s attacks during that combat are reduced to 0 (Røkkr take at least 1 damage), and after combat, grants Special cooldown count-4 to unit, restores 40 HP to unit, and grants Atk/Spd【Great Talent】 +10 to unit, and also, if unit initiates combat, grants another action to unit.<br><br>If unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = number of foes within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit × 3, + 5 (max 14), unit deals +X damage (excluding area of-effect Specials; X = 20% of unit''s Spd + total value of Atk and Spd 【Great Talent】), reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 20% of unit''s Spd ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks during combat.<br><br>(This skill grants max of【Great Talent】+20.)<br><br>【Great Talent】<br>Adds value of Great Talent (+X) to specified stats (until end of battle; max value of X is determined by the stat reaching the limit of 99, each stat calculated separately and cannot exceed max value for each skill; stat increases are not treated as Bonus effects).','Rexcalibur',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner,enemy_only'),
  ('Vengeful Lance','Vengeful Lance','Vengeful Lance','SID_復讐鬼の槍','weapon',1,null,'Grants Atk+3. If unit is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Atk > foe''s Def during combat and unit cannot make a follow-up attack, deals damage = 50% of unit''s Atk minus foe''s Def.','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vengeful Lance ATK','Vengeful Lance','Vengeful Lance','SID_復讐鬼の槍_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and deals damage = X% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area- of-effect Specials; if unit cannot perform a follow-up attack, X = 50; otherwise, X = 25), and also, if unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-Y to unit before unit''s first attack during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, Y = 2; otherwise, Y = 1).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vengeful Lance DEF','Vengeful Lance','Vengeful Lance','SID_復讐鬼の槍_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and deals damage = X% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area- of-effect Specials; if unit cannot perform a follow-up attack, X = 50; otherwise, X = 25), and also, if unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-Y to unit before unit''s first attack during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, Y = 2; otherwise, Y = 1).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vengeful Lance RES','Vengeful Lance','Vengeful Lance','SID_復讐鬼の槍_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and deals damage = X% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area- of-effect Specials; if unit cannot perform a follow-up attack, X = 50; otherwise, X = 25), and also, if unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-Y to unit before unit''s first attack during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, Y = 2; otherwise, Y = 1).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,19,0,0,4',null,null,null),
  ('Vengeful Lance SKILL1','Vengeful Lance','Vengeful Lance','SID_復讐鬼の槍_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and deals damage = X% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area- of-effect Specials; if unit cannot perform a follow-up attack, X = 50; otherwise, X = 25), and also, if unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-Y to unit before unit''s first attack during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, Y = 2; otherwise, Y = 1).<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Spd/Def-7,【Panic】, and【Undefended】on closest foes and foes within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd = 10% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, + 6, during combat, and also, when unit''s Special triggers, neutralizes foe''s "reduces damage by X%" effects from foe''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Panic】<br>Converts bonuses on unit into penalties through its next action.<br><br>【Undefended】<br>Unit cannot be protected by Savior through their next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,19,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vengeful Lance SPD','Vengeful Lance','Vengeful Lance','SID_復讐鬼の槍_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is not adjacent to an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and deals damage = X% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area- of-effect Specials; if unit cannot perform a follow-up attack, X = 50; otherwise, X = 25), and also, if unit''s attack can trigger unit''s Special, grants Special cooldown count-Y to unit before unit''s first attack during combat (if unit cannot perform follow-up and attack twice, Y = 2; otherwise, Y = 1).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vengeful Storm','Vengeful Storm','Vengeful Storm','SID_正銘狂嵐','passiveb',null,null,'At start of turn and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Atk/Def-7, 【Exposure】, and【Sabotage】on closest foes and any foe within 2 spaces of those foes through their next actions.<br><br>Inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe, unit deals damage = 20% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 20% of unit''s Def (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before unit''s first follow-up attack during combat.<br><br>After Canto (including cases where action is ended due to Canto Control), if unit entered combat on the current turn, grants another action to unit, and re-enables Canto (once per turn; does not trigger when affected by effects of traps in Aether Raids during Canto).<br><br>【Exposure】<br>Foe''s attacks deal +10 damage.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Venin Edge','Venin Edge','Venin Edge','SID_毒の剣','weapon',1,null,'Grants Def+3. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 10 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target, and inflicts status on those foes preventing counterattacks through their next actions.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,3,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Venin Edge ATK','Venin Edge','Venin Edge','SID_毒の剣_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Grants Def+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 10 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target, and inflicts status on those foes preventing counterattacks through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,18,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Venin Edge DEF','Venin Edge','Venin Edge','SID_毒の剣_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Grants Def+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. After combat, if unit attacked, deals 10 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target, and inflicts status on those foes preventing counterattacks through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,7,0',null,null,null),
