  ('Virtuous Naga ATK','Virtuous Naga','Virtuous Naga','SID_至聖ナーガ_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Effective against dragon foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit’s Atk > foe’s Atk or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,18,0,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
