  ('Virtuous Naga SKILL1','Virtuous Naga','Virtuous Naga','SID_至聖ナーガ_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Effective against dragon foes. Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if unit’s Atk > foe’s Atk or foe''s HP ≥ 75%, grants Atk/Res+6 to unit during combat, and also, if unit''s Res > foe''s Res, reduces damage from attacks during combat and from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 4 (max 40%).<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and also, if in combat against a dragon foe, unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,'dragon',null),
