  ('Virtuous Tyrfing RES','Virtuous Tyrfing','Virtuous Tyrfing','SID_至聖ティルフィング_RES','weapon',1,'res','Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 99%, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, or if foe initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 8 HP to unit (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,0,0,7',null,null,null),
  ('Virtuous Tyrfing SKILL1','Virtuous Tyrfing','Virtuous Tyrfing','SID_至聖ティルフィング_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 99%, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, or if foe initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 8 HP to unit (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).<br>If unit initiates combat or is within 3 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-5 on foe and reduces damage from attacks by X% during combat (if foe uses magic or staff, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40; excluding area-of-effect Specials). If foe initiates combat, unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, unit''s HP ≥ 50%, and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0 during combat, unit survives with 1 HP (once per turn; does not stack with non-Special effects that allow unit to survive with 1 HP if foe''s attack would reduce unit''s HP to 0; when any other such effect triggers, this effect will trigger too, regardless of its HP conditional).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,16,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Virtuous Tyrfing SPD','Virtuous Tyrfing','Virtuous Tyrfing','SID_至聖ティルフィング_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Res+3. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≤ 99%, if foe''s HP ≥ 75%, or if foe initiates combat, inflicts Atk/Def-6 on foe, deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s counterattacks during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe during combat, restores 8 HP to unit (triggers even if 0 damage is dealt).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'5,16,3,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Vision of Arcadia','Vision of Arcadia','Vision of Arcadia','SID_理想郷となるように','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if a dragon or beast ally is deployed, grants Atk/Def+6 to ally with the highest Atk for 1 turn.',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vision of Arcadia II','Vision of Arcadia II','Vision of Arcadia','SID_理想郷となる…・承','passivec',null,null,'At start of turn, if a dragon or beast ally is deployed, grants Atk/Spd/Def+6,【Null Panic】, and【Canto (１)】to unit and ally with the highest Atk (excluding unit) for 1 turn.<br><br>【Null Panic】<br>If unit is inflicted with Panic (bonuses converted into penalties), neutralizes the "converts bonuses on target into penalties" effect for 1 turn. (Even though the effect is neutralized, the Panic status remains, and is treated as a Penalty status.)<br><br>【Canto (１)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move １ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Vision of Arcadia',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vision of Daein','Vision of Daein','Vision of Daein','SID_デインの後継の書','weapon',2,null,'At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6, "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vision of Daein ATK','Vision of Daein','Vision of Daein','SID_デインの後継の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6, "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vision of Daein DEF','Vision of Daein','Vision of Daein','SID_デインの後継の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6, "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vision of Daein RES','Vision of Daein','Vision of Daein','SID_デインの後継の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6, "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Vision of Daein SKILL1','Vision of Daein','Vision of Daein','SID_デインの後継の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6, "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.<br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit and deals damage = 15% of unit''s Atk during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials), restores 7 HP to unit when unit deals damage to foe during combat, and also, if unit''s HP > 1 and foe would reduce unit''s HP to 0, unit survives with 1 HP (once per combat; does not stack with non-Special effects that allow unit to survive with 1 HP if foe''s attack would reduce HP to 0).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vision of Daein SPD','Vision of Daein','Vision of Daein','SID_デインの後継の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Res+6, "Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)," and "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Tome',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Vital Astra','Vital Astra','Vital Astra','SID_心流星','special',null,null,'Boosts damage by 30% of unit''s Spd. If unit''s Special is ready and unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from area-of-effect Specials (excluding Røkkr area-of-effect Specials) by percentage = difference between stats × 3 (max 30%). At the start of combat, if unit''s Special is ready and unit''s Spd > foe''s Spd, reduces damage from attacks during combat by percentage = difference between stats × 3 (max 30%). (Damage-reduction effects above are considered non-Special effects, so skills like Deadeye still apply.)','Astra',null,false,500,'Infantry','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe',null,null,2,null,'random_owner,offensive_special'),
  ('Void Tome','Void Tome','Void Tome','SID_絶無の書','weapon',2,null,'Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if foe''s Atk ≥ 50 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if foe''s Spd ≥ 35 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Atlas weapon',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Void Tome ATK','Void Tome','Void Tome','SID_絶無の書_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if foe''s Atk ≥ 50 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if foe''s Spd ≥ 35 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,18,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Void Tome DEF','Void Tome','Void Tome','SID_絶無の書_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if foe''s Atk ≥ 50 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if foe''s Spd ≥ 35 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,17,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Void Tome RES','Void Tome','Void Tome','SID_絶無の書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if foe''s Atk ≥ 50 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if foe''s Spd ≥ 35 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,17,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Void Tome SKILL1','Void Tome','Void Tome','SID_絶無の書_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if foe''s Atk ≥ 50 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if foe''s Spd ≥ 35 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).<br>At start of combat, if foe''s HP ≥ 50%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat. If foe has a Special skill and that foe''s maximum Special cooldown count is reduced (Special trigger is accelerated), grants Special cooldown count-1 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat. If foe''s Atk ≥ 50 at start of combat, deals damage during combat = 15% of foe''s Atk at start of combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials). At start of combat, if foe''s Def or Res ≥ 35 or if【Bonus】is active on foe, reduces damage from attacks by X% (X = the greater of foe''s Def or Res at start of combat; max 50; excluding area-of-effect Specials) during combat.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'0,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Void Tome SPD','Void Tome','Void Tome','SID_絶無の書_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Grants Atk+3. At start of combat, if foe''s Atk ≥ 50 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat. At start of combat, if foe''s Spd ≥ 35 or if【Penalty】is active on foe, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Tome',14,'2,17,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Volunteer Bow','Volunteer Bow','Volunteer Bow','SID_義勇兵の弓','weapon',2,null,'Effective against flying foes. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat, and also, if foe''s Range = 2, inflicts Atk/Spd-5 on foe and neutralizes foe''s bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,'flying',null)
