  ('Volunteer Bow ATK','Volunteer Bow','Volunteer Bow','SID_義勇兵の弓_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Effective against flying foes. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 during combat, and also, if foe''s Range = 2, inflicts Atk/Spd-5 on foe and neutralizes foe''s bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,'flying',null),
