  ('Vouge','Vouge','Vouge','SID_プージ','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 50%, unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vouge ATK','Vouge','Vouge','SID_プージ_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vouge DEF','Vouge','Vouge','SID_プージ_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vouge RES','Vouge','Vouge','SID_プージ_RES','weapon',1,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,0,4',-1,null,null),
  ('Vouge SKILL1','Vouge','Vouge','SID_プージ_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br>Foes with Range = 1 cannot move through spaces adjacent to unit, and foes with Range = 2 cannot move through spaces within 2 spaces of unit (does not affect foes with Pass skills). If foe initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat, reduces damage from foe''s first attack during combat by 30%, unit''s next attack deals damage = total damage reduced (by any source, including other skills; resets at end of combat), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vouge SPD','Vouge','Vouge','SID_プージ_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat and unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,3,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Vulture Axe','Vulture Axe','Vulture Axe','SID_禿鷹の斧','weapon',1,null,'If unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Def during combat = 5 + any current penalty on each of those stats. (Example: if foe has -7 penalty to Atk, inflicts Atk-12, for a net penalty of Atk-19 during combat.) Calculates each stat penalty independently.','Steel Axe','Vulture Axe Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vulture Axe Plus','Vulture Axe+','Vulture Axe+','SID_禿鷹の斧＋','weapon',1,null,'If unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Def during combat = 5 + any current penalty on each of those stats. (Example: if foe has -7 penalty to Atk, inflicts Atk-12, for a net penalty of Atk-19 during combat.) Calculates each stat penalty independently.','Vulture Axe',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Vulture Axe Plus ATK','Vulture Axe+','Vulture Axe+','SID_禿鷹の斧＋_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','If unit is not adjacent to an ally, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Def during combat = 5 + any current penalty on each of those stats. (Example: if foe has -7 penalty to Atk, inflicts Atk-12, for a net penalty of Atk-19 during combat.) Calculates each stat penalty independently.',null,null,true,350,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',14,'5,16,0,0,0',null,null,null),
