  ('Weaving Fighter','Weaving Fighter','Weaving Fighter','SID_理の守備隊形','passiveb',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, inflicts Atk/Def-4 on foe, unit and foe cannot make a follow-up attack, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by X% (if foe can make a follow-up attack, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40), and reduces damage from foe''s follow-up attack by 40% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes; likewise, "follow-up attack" normally means the second strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the third and fourth strikes), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.','Wary Fighter 3',null,false,300,'Armored','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wedding-Bell Axe','Wedding-Bell Axe','Wedding-Bell Axe','SID_幸せの鐘の斧','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants "unit can move to a space adjacent to an ally within 2 spaces" and【Triangle Attack】to unit and allies within 2 spaces. If unit initiates combat or if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Triangle Attack】<br>If unit initiates combat and 2 or more allies (excluding unit) with Triangle Attack are within 2 spaces of unit, unit attacks twice. (That turn only. Does not stack.)','Silver Axe',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Wedding-Bell Axe ATK','Wedding-Bell Axe','Wedding-Bell Axe','SID_幸せの鐘の斧_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces,"【Triangle Attack】, and 【Truly Incited】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+11 and Def/Res+10 to unit, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Triangle Attack】<br>If unit initiates combat and 2 or more allies (excluding unit) with Triangle Attack are within 2 spaces of unit, unit attacks twice. (That turn only. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Truly Incited】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2 (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,18,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Wedding-Bell Axe DEF','Wedding-Bell Axe','Wedding-Bell Axe','SID_幸せの鐘の斧_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces,"【Triangle Attack】, and 【Truly Incited】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+11 and Def/Res+10 to unit, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Triangle Attack】<br>If unit initiates combat and 2 or more allies (excluding unit) with Triangle Attack are within 2 spaces of unit, unit attacks twice. (That turn only. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Truly Incited】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2 (max 8).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'5,16,0,4,0',-1,null,null),
