  ('Wedding-Bell Axe SKILL1','Wedding-Bell Axe','Wedding-Bell Axe','SID_幸せの鐘の斧_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants "unit can move to a space adjacent to any ally within 2 spaces,"【Triangle Attack】, and 【Truly Incited】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+11 and Def/Res+10 to unit, and reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Triangle Attack】<br>If unit initiates combat and 2 or more allies (excluding unit) with Triangle Attack are within 2 spaces of unit, unit attacks twice. (That turn only. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Truly Incited】<br>Grants bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat × 2 (max 8).<br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and if the number of flying allies or allies with Triangle Attack active within 3 columns or 3 rows centered on unit (excluding unit) is ≥ 2, unit attacks twice, and grants Special cooldown count-1 before each of unit''s attacks during combat (including when unit attacks twice or performs a follow-up attack).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',16,'3,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
