  ('Weirding Tome RES','Weirding Tome','Weirding Tome','SID_奇異ルーテの書_RES','weapon',2,'res','Grants Spd+3. At start of turn, if any foe''s Res ≤ unit''s Res-3 and that foe is adjacent to another foe, inflicts Spd/Res-5 on that foe through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'2,14,3,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Weirding Tome SKILL1','Weirding Tome','Weirding Tome','SID_奇異ルーテの書_強','weapon',2,'skill1','Grants Spd+3. At start of turn, if any foe''s Res ≤ unit''s Res-3 and that foe is adjacent to another foe, inflicts Spd/Res-5 on that foe through its next action.<br>If【Penalty】is active on foe, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit during combat.<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,3,0,0',null,null,null),
