  ('Wild Tiger Fang SKILL1','Wild Tiger Fang','Wild Tiger Fang','SID_暴走の虎の爪牙_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>At start of turn, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-7,【Sabotage】, and status preventing counterattacks on foes within 5 spaces of unit through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes bonuses on foe during combat.<br><br>At start of turn 2, turn 4, and all later turns, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and during combat neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, but after combat, if unit attacked, deals 5 damage to unit.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.<br>Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, neutralizes unit''s penalties to Atk/Spd, unit deals +20 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'3,17,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Wild Tiger Fang SPD','Wild Tiger Fang','Wild Tiger Fang','SID_暴走の虎の爪牙_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Grants Atk+3.<br><br>At start of turn, and after unit acts (if Canto triggers, after Canto), inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-7,【Sabotage】, and status preventing counterattacks on foes within 5 spaces of unit through their next actions.<br><br>Grants Atk/Spd+6 and Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 15 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and neutralizes bonuses on foe during combat.<br><br>At start of turn 2, turn 4, and all later turns, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2, deals +7 damage when Special triggers, and during combat neutralizes effects that grant "Special cooldown charge +X" to foe or inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, but after combat, if unit attacked, deals 5 damage to unit.<br><br>【Sabotage】<br>Inflicts penalty on unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = highest penalty on each stat between unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit. Calculates each stat penalty independently.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'5,17,3,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Wild Wind Sword','Wild Wind Sword','Wild Wind Sword','SID_奔放なる風の剣','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, inflicts Spd/Def-7 on unit through unit''s next action.<br><br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 and bonus to Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = current penalty on each of those stats × 2 (example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+19, for a net bonus of Atk+12; calculates each stat bonus independently), unit deals damage = total penalties on unit × 1.5 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), neutralizes effects that guarantee foe''s follow-up attacks and effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks, and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and restores 7 HP to unit after combat.','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wildcat Dagger','Wildcat Dagger','Wildcat Dagger','SID_山猫の暗器','weapon',2,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 4 + current bonus on each of foe''s stats, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats (calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Wildcat Dagger ATK','Wildcat Dagger','Wildcat Dagger','SID_山猫の暗器_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 4 + current bonus on each of foe''s stats, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats (calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,15,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Wildcat Dagger DEF','Wildcat Dagger','Wildcat Dagger','SID_山猫の暗器_DEF','weapon',2,'def','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 4 + current bonus on each of foe''s stats, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats (calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,3,0',null,null,null),
  ('Wildcat Dagger RES','Wildcat Dagger','Wildcat Dagger','SID_山猫の暗器_RES','weapon',2,'res','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 4 + current bonus on each of foe''s stats, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats (calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,0,0,3',null,null,null),
  ('Wildcat Dagger SKILL1','Wildcat Dagger','Wildcat Dagger','SID_山猫の暗器_一','weapon',2,'skill1','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 4 + current bonus on each of foe''s stats, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats (calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.<br>If unit initiates combat or foe''s HP ≥ 75% at start of combat, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30%, and deals damage = 10% of unit''s Spd during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Wildcat Dagger SPD','Wildcat Dagger','Wildcat Dagger','SID_山猫の暗器_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 4 + current bonus on each of foe''s stats, inflicts penalty on foe''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = current bonus on each of foe''s stats (calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and neutralizes effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit during combat.<br>Effect:【Dagger ７】<br><br>【Dagger ７】<br>After combat, if unit attacked, inflicts Def/Res-７ on target and foes within 2 spaces of target through their next actions.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger',14,'2,14,2,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Wildflower Edge','Wildflower Edge','Wildflower Edge','SID_野花の花嫁の大剣','weapon',1,null,'Enables【Canto (Rem. +1)】.<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>If unit has entered combat during the current turn, allies within 5 spaces of unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res = 15% of unit''s Spd at start of combat, deals damage = 20% of unit''s Spd (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by X% during combat (if it is unit''s first combat initiated by unit or first combat initiated by foe that turn, X = 80; otherwise, X = 40; "first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).<br><br>If unit initiates combat, deals 10 damage to target and foes within 2 spaces of target after combat, and inflicts【Share Spoils】on target through its next action.<br><br>【Canto (Rem. +1)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move again.<br><br>The distance of the movement is the remaining movement the unit had before the actions listed above + 1 (If unit used a movement skill that warps them, the remainder is 0). (Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br><br>【Share Spoils】<br>Inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-5 on unit during combat and neutralizes "reduces damage by X%" effects from unit''s non-Special skills (excluding area-of-effect Specials). If foe initiates combat and if unit is defeated in combat, grants another action to that foe after combat (this effect has priority over other similar effects, including Time Is Light; in such cases, these other similar effects are treated as not having triggered).','Silver Sword',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,null),
  ('Wily Fighter 1','Wily Fighter 1','Wily Fighter','SID_正面隊形・敵方1','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 75% and foe initiates combat, neutralizes bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) on foe during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.',null,'Wily Fighter 2',false,60,'Armored',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wily Fighter 2','Wily Fighter 2','Wily Fighter','SID_正面隊形・敵方2','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 50% and foe initiates combat, neutralizes bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) on foe during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.','Wily Fighter 1','Wily Fighter 3',false,120,'Armored',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wily Fighter 3','Wily Fighter 3','Wily Fighter','SID_正面隊形・敵方3','passiveb',null,null,'If unit''s HP ≥ 25% and foe initiates combat, neutralizes bonuses (from skills like Fortify, Rally, etc.) on foe during combat and unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack.','Wily Fighter 2',null,false,240,'Armored',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wily Fighter 4','Wily Fighter 4','Wily Fighter','SID_正面隊形・敵方4','passiveb',null,null,'If foe initiates combat or if unit''s HP ≥ 25% at start of combat, inflicts Atk-5 on foe, deals +X damage (X = 20% of unit''s Def; excluding area-of-effect Specials), reduces damage from foe''s attacks by X (excluding area-of-effect Specials), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat.','Wily Fighter 3',null,false,300,'Armored',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wind','Wind','Wind','SID_ウインド','weapon',2,null,null,null,'Elwind',false,50,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',4,'0,4,0,0,0',null,null,'random_all'),
  ('Wind Boost 1','Wind Boost 1','Wind Boost','SID_生命の疾風1','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ foe''s HP+3, grants Spd+2 during combat.',null,'Wind Boost 2',false,50,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wind Boost 2','Wind Boost 2','Wind Boost','SID_生命の疾風2','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ foe''s HP+3, grants Spd+4 during combat.','Wind Boost 1','Wind Boost 3',false,100,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wind Boost 3','Wind Boost 3','Wind Boost','SID_生命の疾風3','passivea',null,null,'At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ foe''s HP+3, grants Spd+6 during combat.','Wind Boost 2',null,false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wind Edge','Wind Edge','Wind Edge','SID_風鋒','special',null,null,'When Special triggers, boosts damage by unit''s Spd.<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes), and if unit has weapon-triangle advantage or if unit and foe are colorless, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat.','Astra',null,false,500,'Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,null,5,null,'offensive_special,random_owner'),
  ('Wind Genesis','Wind Genesis','Wind Genesis','SID_風呼びの根源','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 and【Desperation】to unit for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd+6 to unit during combat and inflicts penalty on foe''s Spd/Res during combat = 11 - foe''s max Special cooldown count value × 2. (Minimum penalty of 3. If foe does not have a Special skill, penalty = 3.)<br><br>【Desperation】<br>Grants the following effect for 1 turn: "If unit initiates combat, unit can make a follow-up attack before foe can counterattack."','Thoron;Shine',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wind Parthia','Wind Parthia','Wind Parthia','SID_翠風パルティア','weapon',2,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 during combat, and if unit also deals damage to foe using a Special, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.)','Silver Bow',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'flying','random_owner'),
  ('Wind Parthia ATK','Wind Parthia','Wind Parthia','SID_翠風パルティア_ATK','weapon',2,'atk','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 during combat, reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】by 60% during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.)<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,15,0,0,0',-1,'flying',null),
  ('Wind Parthia DEF','Wind Parthia','Wind Parthia','SID_翠風パルティア_DEF','weapon',2,'def','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 during combat, reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】by 60% during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.)<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,3,0',-1,'flying',null),
  ('Wind Parthia RES','Wind Parthia','Wind Parthia','SID_翠風パルティア_RES','weapon',2,'res','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 during combat, reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】by 60% during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.)<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,0,0,3',-1,'flying',null),
  ('Wind Parthia SKILL1','Wind Parthia','Wind Parthia','SID_翠風パルティア_一','weapon',2,'skill1','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 during combat, reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】by 60% during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.)<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.<br>At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, neutralizes effects that prevent unit''s follow-up attacks and effects that inflict "Special cooldown charge -X" on unit, and also, if 【Bonus】is active on unit, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30%.<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,'flying',null),
  ('Wind Parthia SPD','Wind Parthia','Wind Parthia','SID_翠風パルティア_AGI','weapon',2,'spd','Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). Effective against flying foes. If unit initiates combat or if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 during combat, reduces the effect of【Deep Wounds】by 60% during combat, and also, if unit deals damage to foe using a Special during combat, restores 50% of unit''s maximum HP. (Triggers even if 0 damage is dealt.)<br><br>【Deep Wounds】<br>Unit''s HP cannot be healed through its next action.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow',14,'2,14,2,0,0',-1,'flying',null),
  ('Wind Tribe Club','Wind Tribe Club','Wind Tribe Club','SID_風の部族の金棒','weapon',1,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants "if unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack" and【Null Panic】to unit for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Def+X to unit during combat (X = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit and【Penalty】effects active on foe, excluding stat bonuses and stat penalties, × 2, + 5).<br><br>【Null Panic】<br>If unit is inflicted with Panic (bonuses converted into penalties), neutralizes the "converts bonuses on target into penalties" effect for 1 turn. (Even though the effect is neutralized, the Panic status remains, and is treated as a Penalty status.)<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Steel Axe','Wind Tribe Club Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,null),
  ('Wind Tribe Club Plus','Wind Tribe Club+','Wind Tribe Club+','SID_風の部族の金棒＋','weapon',1,null,'At start of turn, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants "if unit initiates combat, unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack" and【Null Panic】to unit for 1 turn. At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Def+X to unit during combat (X = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit and【Penalty】effects active on foe, excluding stat bonuses and stat penalties, × 2, + 5).<br><br>【Null Panic】<br>If unit is inflicted with Panic (bonuses converted into penalties), neutralizes the "converts bonuses on target into penalties" effect for 1 turn. (Even though the effect is neutralized, the Panic status remains, and is treated as a Penalty status.)<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).<br><br>【Penalty】<br>All effects that last "on foe through its next action." Includes penalties inflicted by a skill like Panic or Threaten and negative status effects (preventing counterattacks, restricting movement, or the effects of a skill like Triangle Adept or Guard).','Wind Tribe Club',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Axe',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
