  ('Windfire Balm','Windfire Balm','Windfire Balm','SID_業火疾風の祝福','special',null,null,'When healing an ally with a staff, grants Atk/Spd+4 to all allies for 1 turn.','Kindled-Fire Balm;Swift-Winds Balm',null,false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',null,null,1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Windfire Balm Plus','Windfire Balm+','Windfire Balm+','SID_業火疾風の祝福＋','special',null,null,'When healing an ally with a staff, grants Atk/Spd+6 to all allies for 1 turn.','Windfire Balm',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',null,null,1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Windfire Charm','Windfire Charm','Windfire Charm','SID_業火疾風の招福','special',null,null,'If an Assist skill is used, unit''s Special cooldown count does not go down.<br><br>When Special triggers, boosts damage by 70% of the greater of unit''s or foe''s Atk (calculates damage from staff after combat damage is added).<br><br>Reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, grants【Atk Liberate】and【Spd Liberate】to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn.<br><br>【Atk Liberate】<br>Grants bonus to Atk during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, + 4 (max 8).<br><br>【Spd Liberate】<br>Grants bonus to Spd during combat = number of【Bonus】effects active on unit, excluding stat bonuses, + 4 (max 8).<br><br>【Bonus】<br>All effects that last "for 1 turn" or "that turn only." Includes bonuses granted by a skill like Rally or Hone and positive status effects (extra movement or effects like Dominance).','Windfire Balm',null,false,500,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Colorless Staff',null,null,5,null,'offensive_special,random_owner'),
