  ('Winds Brand SKILL1','Wind''s Brand','Wind''s Brand','SID_深き印の風_梟','weapon',2,'skill1','At start of turn, inflicts Atk-7 on foe on the enemy team with the highest Atk through its next action.<br>During combat, boosts unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res by number of adjacent allies × 2.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Green Tome',14,'0,14,0,0,0',null,null,null),
