  ('Wing-Lifted Spear','Wing-Lifted Spear','Wing-Lifted Spear','SID_扶翼ウイングスピア','weapon',1,null,'Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Atk+3. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit during combat, and also, if foe has bonuses, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit and inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe during combat. (X = current bonus on each of foe''s stats.) Calculates each stat effect independently.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,19,0,0,0',null,'armored,cavalry','random_owner'),
  ('Wing-Lifted Spear ATK','Wing-Lifted Spear','Wing-Lifted Spear','SID_扶翼ウイングスピア_ATK','weapon',1,'atk','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe during combat (X = current bonus on each of foe''s stats; calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and unit deals +Y damage during combat (Y = number of Bonus effects active on unit and foe, excluding stat bonuses, × 5; max 25; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,21,0,0,0',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Wing-Lifted Spear DEF','Wing-Lifted Spear','Wing-Lifted Spear','SID_扶翼ウイングスピア_DEF','weapon',1,'def','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe during combat (X = current bonus on each of foe''s stats; calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and unit deals +Y damage during combat (Y = number of Bonus effects active on unit and foe, excluding stat bonuses, × 5; max 25; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,19,0,4,0',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Wing-Lifted Spear RES','Wing-Lifted Spear','Wing-Lifted Spear','SID_扶翼ウイングスピア_RES','weapon',1,'res','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe during combat (X = current bonus on each of foe''s stats; calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and unit deals +Y damage during combat (Y = number of Bonus effects active on unit and foe, excluding stat bonuses, × 5; max 25; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,19,0,0,4',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Wing-Lifted Spear SKILL1','Wing-Lifted Spear','Wing-Lifted Spear','SID_扶翼ウイングスピア_一','weapon',1,'skill1','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe during combat (X = current bonus on each of foe''s stats; calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and unit deals +Y damage during combat (Y = number of Bonus effects active on unit and foe, excluding stat bonuses, × 5; max 25; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)<br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1).<br><br>At start of player phase or enemy phase, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd+6 and the following statuses to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn: "neutralizes unit''s penalties during combat" and "grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack)."<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants bonus to unit''s Atk/Spd/Def/Res during combat = number of allies within 3 spaces of unit × 2, + 5 (max 11) and reduces the percentage of foe''s non-Special "reduce damage by X%" skills by 50% during combat (excluding area-of-effect Specials).',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'3,19,0,0,0',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Wing-Lifted Spear SPD','Wing-Lifted Spear','Wing-Lifted Spear','SID_扶翼ウイングスピア_AGI','weapon',1,'spd','Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Effective against armored and cavalry foes. Grants Atk+3.<br><br>If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X to unit, inflicts Atk/Spd/Def/Res-X on foe during combat (X = current bonus on each of foe''s stats; calculates each stat bonus and penalty independently), and unit deals +Y damage during combat (Y = number of Bonus effects active on unit and foe, excluding stat bonuses, × 5; max 25; excluding area-of-effect Specials).<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br>(Once per turn. Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'5,19,3,0,0',null,'armored,cavalry',null),
  ('Wings of Light','Wings of Light','Wings of Light','SID_光輝く翼','passivec',null,null,'Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+2+X to ally Mythic Heroes during combat in turns 1 through 5 (X = turn number). (Excludes unit.)<br><br>(Effect only active if team includes three or fewer Mythic Heroes, including unit.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wings of Light Plus','Wings of Light+','Wings of Light','SID_光輝く翼・神','passivec',null,null,'If the number of Mythic Hero allies on team ≤ 3 (including unit), grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+X (X = turn number + 3; max 8) and "reduces damage from attacks (excluding area-of-effect Specials) by 30%" to Mythic Hero allies (excluding unit) during their combat. Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 and Special cooldown charge +1 (only highest value applied; does not stack) per attack to allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit during their combat. If there is a Mythic Hero ally on your team (excluding unit), or if there is an ally within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, reduces damage from attacks during combat by 30% (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).','Wings of Light',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Wings of Mercy 1','Wings of Mercy 1','Wings of Mercy','SID_救援の行路1','passiveb',null,null,'If an ally''s HP ≤ 30%, unit can move to a space adjacent to that ally.',null,'Wings of Mercy 2',false,60,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('Wings of Mercy 2','Wings of Mercy 2','Wings of Mercy','SID_救援の行路2','passiveb',null,null,'If an ally''s HP ≤ 40%, unit can move to a space adjacent to that ally.','Wings of Mercy 1','Wings of Mercy 3',false,120,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('Wings of Mercy 3','Wings of Mercy 3','Wings of Mercy','SID_救援の行路3','passiveb',null,null,'If an ally''s HP ≤ 50%, unit can move to a space adjacent to that ally.','Wings of Mercy 2',null,false,240,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('Wings of Mercy 4','Wings of Mercy 4','Wings of Mercy','SID_救援の行路4','passiveb',null,null,'Inflicts Def/Res-3 on foe during combat. If unit is within 3 spaces of an ally and that ally''s HP ≤ 99%, unit can move to a space adjacent to that ally. If an ally''s HP ≤ 60%, unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of that ally.','Wings of Mercy 3',null,false,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_inherit_base,random_owner'),
  ('Winter Rapier','Winter Rapier','Winter Rapier','SID_冬祭のレイピア','weapon',1,null,'If unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Atk/Def+5 and bonus to Atk/Def during combat = current penalty on each of those stats × 2. (Example: if unit has -7 penalty to Atk, grants Atk+19, for a net bonus of Atk+12.) Calculates each stat bonus independently.','Steel Sword','Winter Rapier Plus',false,200,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',10,'0,10,0,0,0',null,null,null),
