  ('World Destroyer','World Destroyer','World Destroyer','SID_真神槌大地を穿つ','passivec',null,null,'Neutralizes "effective against flying" bonuses.<br>Unit can counterattack regardless of foe''s range.<br><br>Allies within 2 spaces of unit can move to a space within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>For unit and allies within 3 rows or 3 columns centered on unit, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5, reduces damage from foe''s attacks by 7 (excluding area-of-effect Specials), and next attack deals damage = 40% of foe''s first-attack damage prior to reductions during combat (resets at end of combat; only highest value applied; does not stack), and also, if Def ≥ foe''s Def+5, disables unit''s or ally''s skills and foe''s skills that change attack priority during combat.<br><br>Unit deals +7 damage (excluding area-of-effect Specials) and grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying',null,null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('World-Tree Tail','World-Tree Tail','World-Tree Tail','SID_世界樹の栗鼠の尻尾','weapon',1,null,'Enables【Canto (２)】.<br><br>Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of combat, if unit''s HP ≥ 25%, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+5 to unit, grants Atk/Spd+X to unit (X = 9, - 3 × number of allies with HP ≤ 40%; min 0), grants Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 40% during combat ("first attack" normally means only the first strike; for effects that grant "unit attacks twice," it means the first and second strikes). At start of turn, if unit is adjacent to only beast or dragon allies or is not adjacent to any ally, unit transforms (otherwise, unit reverts). If unit transforms, grants Atk+2 to unit, inflicts Atk/Def-Y on foe during combat (Y = number of spaces from start position to end position of whoever initiated combat, + 3; max 6), and also, if Y ≥ 5, reduces damage from foe''s first attack by 30% during combat.<br><br>【Canto (２)】<br>After an attack, Assist skill, or structure destruction, unit can move ２ space(s).<br><br>(Unit moves according to movement type. Once per turn. Cannot attack or assist. Only highest value applied. Does not stack. After moving, if a skill that grants another action would be triggered (like with Galeforce), Canto will trigger after the granted action. Unit''s base movement has no effect on movement granted. Cannot warp (using skills like Wings of Mercy) a distance greater than unit would be able to move with normal Canto movement.)','Adult Cavalry',null,true,400,'Cavalry','Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',14,'0,14,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Worldbreaker','Worldbreaker','Worldbreaker','SID_神槌大地を穿つ','passivec',null,null,'Grants Special cooldown charge +1 per attack during combat to unit and allies within 2 spaces. (Only highest value applied. Does not stack.)',null,null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Worldbreaker Plus','Worldbreaker+','Worldbreaker','SID_神槌大地を穿つ・神','passivec',null,null,'Allies within 2 spaces of unit can move to any space within 2 spaces of unit.<br><br>Grants Atk/Def/Res+5 and Special cooldown charge +1 to unit per attack (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown count-2 to unit before unit''s first attack during combat.<br><br>Grants Atk/Def/Res+4 and Special cooldown charge +1 per attack to allies within 3 spaces of unit (only highest value applied; does not stack), and grants Special cooldown count-1 to those allies before their first attack during their combat.','Worldbreaker',null,true,300,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword,  Blue Lance,  Green Axe,  Red Bow,  Blue Bow,  Green Bow,  Colorless Bow,  Red Dagger,  Blue Dagger,  Green Dagger,  Colorless Dagger,  Red Tome,  Blue Tome,  Green Tome,  Colorless Tome,  Colorless Staff,  Red Breath,  Blue Breath,  Green Breath,  Colorless Breath,  Red Beast,  Blue Beast,  Green Beast,  Colorless Beast',null,'0,0,0,0,0',null,null,'random_owner'),
  ('Worldly Lance','Worldly Lance','Worldly Lance','SID_老練の槍','weapon',1,null,'Accelerates Special trigger (cooldown count-1). At start of turn, if unit is within 2 spaces of an ally, grants Def/Res+6 and "neutralizes foe''s bonuses during combat" to unit and allies within 2 spaces of unit for 1 turn. If unit initiates combat or is within 2 spaces of an ally, inflicts Atk/Def-X on foe (X = 20% of unit''s Def at start of combat + 6), unit makes a guaranteed follow-up attack, and inflicts Special cooldown charge -1 on foe per attack during combat (only highest value applied; does not stack).','Silver Lance',null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Blue Lance',16,'0,16,0,0,0',-1,null,'random_owner'),
