  ('Yato SKILL1','Yato','Yato','SID_夜刀神_魅','weapon',1,'skill1','Grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+2.<br>If unit is within 2 spaces of support partner, grants Atk/Spd/Def/Res+4 to that ally during combat.',null,null,true,400,'Infantry,  Armored,  Cavalry,  Flying','Red Sword',16,'3,18,2,2,2',null,null,null),
